077dc9f-3a66-5988-a17f-094168f0836f'}, {'abstract': 'New measures intensify existing efforts to choke off Iran’s oil and shipping revenue. Officials said the measures were not tied to Mitt Romney’s suggestion of a tougher line on Iran.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/01/world/middleeast/obama-and-congress-in-step-over-iran-sanctions.html', 'snippet': 'New measures intensify existing efforts to choke off Iran’s oil and shipping revenue. Officials said the measures were not tied to Mitt Romney’s suggestion of a tougher line on Iran.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The White House and Congress raced to impose more punishing sanctions against Iran on Tuesday, as that country’s nuclear ambitions resurfaced in the presidential election campaign after Mitt Romney’s pledge to give Israel unstinting support in its confrontation with Iran.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'White House and Congress Are in Step Over Iran Sanctions', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Obama and Congress in Step Over Iran Sanctions', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Embargoes and Economic Sanctions', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-01T02:11:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Fo