ad_paragraph': 'The Yankees’ front office watched the nonwaiver trade deadline pass Tuesday with an air of self-assurance. The team did not rashly pull the trigger for a high-priced starting pitcher, instead trading for infielder Casey McGehee in a deal so minor that both the manager and the general manager mispronounced his last name twice in a news conference.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/01/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 674, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/01/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1348, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/01/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/01/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/01/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With No Trade Help for Rotation, Nova Has His Worst Start', 'kicker': 'Orioles 11, Yankees 5', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With No Trade Help for Rotation, Nova Has His Worst Start', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McGehee, Casey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Teixeira, Mark', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', '