rmance of a young Chinese swimmer has started a huge debate. Did she perhaps dope, or did her breakout swim come through her physical gifts and a decade of h...', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — A debate is raging about how a young Chinese athlete could have improved so dramatically at the Olympics — swimming a portion of her race faster than elite male swimmers — while capturing a gold medal in world-record time. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/01/blogs/ye-rdv/ye-rdv-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 708, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/01/blogs/ye-rdv/ye-rdv-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1417, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Debate Over Chinese Swimmer Turns Testy in Asia', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doping (Sports)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2012)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Steroids', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Swimming', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tests (Drug Use)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Phelps, Michael', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ye Shiwen', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Guardian (British Newspaper)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sina Weibo', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Te