2012/08/01/struggling-to-let-go-of-my-college-student-daughter/', 'snippet': 'My college-age daughter texts or e-mails me almost every day and comes home nearly every month. So why do I still feel such a profound sense of loss?', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I sent my daughter, Emma, off for her freshman year of college a few years ago, I found myself overwhelmed by an incredible feeling of melancholy. I was sad down to my bones.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Struggling to Let Go of My College-Student Daughter', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-01T15:34:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Randye Hoder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Randye', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/614815ec-b30f-5bd2-bd1d-dc484114587c', 'word_count': 679, 'uri': 'nyt://article/614815ec-b30f-5bd2-bd1d-dc484114587c'}, {'abstract': 'While the biofuel, electric battery and liquefied natural gas technologies are advancing, the internal combustion engine will reign supreme for decades, a group reports.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/01/a-glimpse-of-the-alternative-fuel-future/', 'snippet': 'While the biofuel, electric battery and liquefied natural gas technologies are advancing, the internal combustion engine will reign supreme for decades, a group reports.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While a variety of new fuel technologies are advancing, policy makers can be assured that the internal combustion engine will remain dominant for decades, the National Petroleum Council told the Department of Energy on Wednesday in a report. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Glimpse of the Alternative Fuel Future', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-08-01T15:41:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matthew L. Wald', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matthew', 'middlename': 'L.', 'lastname': 'Wald', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/01d3cc22-b567-5e57-8887-55ca9ffc030f', 'word_count': 982, 'uri': 'nyt://article/01d3cc22-b567-5e57-8887-55ca9ffc030f'}, {'abstract': 'Credit Suisse on Wednesday named David DeNunzio, one of its veteran deal makers, as the global chairman of its mergers and acquisitions group. The news follows the departure of Steven Koch to serve as a deputy mayor of Chicago.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/08/01/credit-suisse-names-denunzio-as-global-chairman-of-m-a/', 'snippet': 'Credit Suisse on Wednesday named David DeNunzio, one of its veteran deal makers, as the global chairman of its mergers and acquisitions group. The news follows the departure of Steven Koch to serve as a deputy mayor of Chicago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Credit Suisse on Wednesday named David DeNunzio, one of its veteran deal makers, as the global chairman of its mergers and acquisitions group, according to an internal memorandum reviewed by DealBook.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Credit Suisse Names DeNunzio as Global Chairman of M.&A.', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'k