406-a549-fa8219f158e9'}, {'abstract': 'He’s trying to force greater disclosure on the targeted killing program.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/01/john-cornyn-makes-sense/', 'snippet': 'He’s trying to force greater disclosure on the targeted killing program.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I don’t often find myself in agreement with Senator John Cornyn, the Texas Republican. But he’s rightfully fed up with the secrecy surrounding the Obama administration’s targeted killing program, and he’s now pushing a measure to force greater disclosure.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'John Cornyn Makes Sense', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Targeted Killings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Awlaki, Anwar al-', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cornyn, John', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-01T16:08:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Rosenthal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenthal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2afc27b7-ea4a-5ddc-a9cf-970edfce165c', 'word_count': 432, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2afc27b7-ea4a-5ddc-a9cf-970edfce165c'}, {'abstract': 'Cataract surgery may help prevent disabling hip fractures, a new study finds.', 'web_url': 'https://newoldage.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/01/a-novel-way-to-prevent-hip-fractures/', 'snippet': 'Cataract surgery may help prevent disabling hip fractures, a new study finds.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Times reports today on a study finding that cataract surgery greatly reduces the risk of hip fracture in the elderly. The benefits accrued particularly to those who were most ill and those in their early 80s; they experienced almost 30 percent fewer hip fractures in the first year after cataract surgery, compared with similar patients who did not have surgery, the researchers found.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Novel Way to Prevent Hip Fractures', 'kicker': 'The New Old Age', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bone Fractures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cataracts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elder Care', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-01T16:11:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3a251c5d-46f7-5e51-8895-2456e1fbe7d1', 'word_count': 267, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3a251c5d-46f7-5e51-8895-2456e1fbe7d1'}, {'abstract': 'The 2014 Mazda 6 hews to the automaker’s latest design concept known as Kodo and will be introduced to the North American market at the Los Angeles auto show in November.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/01/a-first-glimpse-of-the-2014-mazda-6-comes-in-moscow/', 'snippet': 'The 2014 Mazda 6 hews to the automaker’s latest design concept known as Kodo and will be introduced to the North American market at the Los Angeles auto show in November.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mazda has provided a peek at the revamped 2014 Mazda 6 sedan ahead of the car’s introduction at the Moscow Auto Show this month.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A First Glimpse of the 2014 Mazda 6 Comes in Moscow', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'ke