the government of President Bashar al-Assad.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/01/video-said-to-show-execution-by-syrian-rebels-stirs-debate/', 'snippet': 'Syrian rebels on Tuesday said they had captured and later executed several members of a prominent Aleppo family with close ties to the government of President Bashar al-Assad.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As my colleague Damien Cave reported, Syrian rebels on Tuesday said they had captured and later executed several members of a prominent Aleppo family with close ties to the government of President Bashar al-Assad. That act — captured on video and circulated widely — appeared to constitute a war crime, human rights activists said on Wednesday. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video Said to Show Execution by Syrian Rebels Stirs Debate', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Video Said to Show Executions by Syrian Insurgents Stirs Fierce Debate Online', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Firearms', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALEPPO (SYRIA)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-01T16:19:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. David Goodman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc0c9aba-bf6b-577d-9c13-a86a2a926f9b', 'word_count': 1151, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc0c9aba-bf6b-577d-9c13-a86a2a926f9b'}, {'abstract': 'From an airport art walk to running-shoe room service to a “workout in a bag,” airports and hotels are trying to make it easier to exercise on the go.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/05/travel/easing-the-pain-of-workouts-on-the-road.html', 'snippet': 'From an airport art walk to running-shoe room service to a “workout in a bag,” airports and hotels are trying to make it easier to exercise on the go.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IT’S called the LiveWell Walking Path: a new, nearly milelong route that includes two 55-foot-high staircases for cardio exercise. At one end, the path leads to the yoga studio where, beyond tall screens, barefoot travelers twist and bend while an instructional DVD plays quietly in a continuous loop. ', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/05/travel/05GETAWAY1_SPAN/05JPGETAWAY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/05/travel/05GETAWAY1_SPAN/05JPGETAWAY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/05/travel/05GETAWAY1_SPAN/05GETAWAY1_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 730, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/05/travel/05GETAWAY1_SPAN/05GETAWAY1_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1461, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/05/travel/05GETAWAY1_SPAN/05JPGETAWAY1-thumbStandard.jpg'