s.nytimes.com/2012/08/01/the-cycle-of-standoffs/', 'snippet': 'Legislators would rather make points than policy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Passing bills is passé in the 112th Congress, one of the least productive in history. Rather than work, the two parties prefer to spend their time in ideological combat, making points rather than policy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Cycle of Standoffs', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boehner, John A', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reid, Harry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-01T18:39:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Firestone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Firestone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/321a9cf0-b48f-55cf-9870-dff7b494f74b', 'word_count': 474, 'uri': 'nyt://article/321a9cf0-b48f-55cf-9870-dff7b494f74b'}, {'abstract': 'Lindsay Mendez talks about her role in the new Off Broadway musical “Dogfight.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/05/theater/lindsay-mendez-talks-about-dogfight.html', 'snippet': 'Lindsay Mendez talks about her role in the new Off Broadway musical “Dogfight.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'LINDSAY MENDEZ was putting her powerful pipes to good use, giving full throttle performances of “Bless the Lord“ in the recent Broadway revival of “Godspell” when she was cast in the new musical “Dogfight.” Leave a Broadway show for Off Broadway and play a character everyone thinks is ugly? But of course! Ms. Mendez felt lucky to have the chance to originate a role, though, and her touching performan