ier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/13870d6b-4e13-5157-becc-8bea9d9517f8', 'word_count': 122, 'uri': 'nyt://article/13870d6b-4e13-5157-becc-8bea9d9517f8'}, {'abstract': 'More than 38 million viewers watched the London Games on NBC on Tuesday night, a major increase over the audience for the Athens Games in 2004 and the Beijing Games in 2008.', 'web_url': 'https://london2012.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/01/olympics-ratings-higher-than-expected/', 'snippet': 'More than 38 million viewers watched the London Games on NBC on Tuesday night, a major increase over the audience for the Athens Games in 2004 and the Beijing Games in 2008.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An average of 38.7 million viewers watched the London Games on Tuesday night, nearly 5 million more than watched on the comparable day four years ago in Beijing and almost 9 million more than tuned in on the first Tuesday night of the Athens Games in 2004.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Olympics Ratings Higher Than Expected', 'kicker': '2012 London Olympics', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2012)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ratings (Audience Measurement)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Comcast Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-01T20:51:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Sandomir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sandomir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 're