-herd-on-gop-effort-to-produce-a-farm-bill-in-the-house.html', 'snippet': 'Representative Frank Lucas of Oklahoma has tried to bridge the gap between agriculture-centric Republicans like himself and those who worry the farm bill would look like too much Republican spending.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — When Representative Frank D. Lucas arrived in Washington in 1994, he was less concerned with building a name for himself around the Capitol than with quietly shaping the agricultural policy that is the bread and butter of his constituents in rural western Oklahoma. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/02/us/LUCAS/LUCAS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 656, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/02/us/LUCAS/LUCAS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1312, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/02/us/LUCAS/LUCAS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/02/us/LUCAS/LUCAS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/02/us/LUCAS/LUCAS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Riding Herd on G.O.P. Effort to Produce a Farm Bill in the House', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Riding Herd on G.O.P. Effort to Produce a Farm Bill in the House', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'na