try’s Supreme Court has issued a rare ruling in favor of the most prominent political prisoner, the jailed oil tycoon Mikhail B. Khodorkovsky.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Amid Political Prosecutions, Russian Court Issues Ruling Favorable to Oil Tycoon', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Amid Political Prosecutions, Russian Court Issues Ruling Favorable to Oil Tycoon', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Prisoners', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Khodorkovsky, Mikhail B', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Courts and the Judiciary', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-02T02:33:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew E. Kramer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Kramer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62cb13cc-07cc-50fc-9040-3bb5e94a4ccf', 'word_count': 742, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62cb13cc-07cc-50fc-9040-3bb5e94a4ccf'}, {'abstract': 'The world of online games has long been characterized by name-calling and trash talk, especially directed against women, but some recent episodes have prompted calls for change.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/02/us/sexual-harassment-in-online-gaming-stirs-anger.html', 'snippet': 'The world of online games has long been characterized by name-calling and trash talk, especially directed against women, but some recent episodes have prompted calls for change.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Miranda P