itude during a victory against the Giants.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/02/sports/baseball/niese-leads-mets-past-giants.html', 'snippet': 'Jon Niese pitched seven strong innings to help mask the Mets’ offensive ineptitude during a victory against the Giants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — Jon Niese’s body of work this season has been marked by overpowering starts interspersed with a number of aimless outings. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Niese’s Effort Makes Up for Mets’ Missed Opportunities', 'kicker': 'Mets 2, Giants 1', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Niese’s Effort Makes Up for Mets’ Missed Opportunities', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'San Francisco Giants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Niese, Jon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-02T05:36:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Keh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Keh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4814a873-d26b-54f5-898f-2073a5800c7d', 'word_count': 635, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4814a873-d26b-54f5-898f-2073a5800c7d'}, {'abstract': 'See what you know about the news of the day.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/02/news-quiz-august-2-2012/', 'snippet': 'See what you know about the news of the day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'See what you know about the news below. To prepare, you might scan the articles or summaries on today’s paper. Good luck!', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headlin