a Munn and Paul Schneider as a young couple who have trouble conceiving.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/03/movies/the-babymakers-with-olivia-munn-and-paul-schneider.html', 'snippet': '“The Babymakers,” a raunchy heist comedy directed by Jay Chandrasekhar, features Olivia Munn and Paul Schneider as a young couple who have trouble conceiving.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Speculate about this for a bit: What is the worst possible time for an evangelist bearing Jesus pamphlets to come to the front door? During your Seder? Nah, not even close. While you’re berating a misbehaving child at an embarrassing volume? Maybe.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/03/arts/03BABY_SPAN/03BABY_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/03/arts/03BABY_SPAN/03BABY_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/03/arts/03BABY_SPAN/03BABY_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/03/arts/03BABY_SPAN/03BABY_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/03/arts/03BABY_SPAN/03BABY_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/03/arts/03BABY_SPAN/03BABY_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge