and finely made slacks over a date with Ricky Schroder any day. (Maybe not.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Workin’ 9 to 5', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits (Apparel)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-02T12:00:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rashida Jones', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rashida', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jones', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a02d5696-e1c5-5544-9e07-fa2ecf357ce0', 'word_count': 1051, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a02d5696-e1c5-5544-9e07-fa2ecf357ce0'}, {'abstract': 'General Motors said it would focus new attention on its struggling Opel brand in Europe after net income in the second quarter fell to $1.48 billion, from $2.52 billion in the same period a year ago.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/03/business/gms-profit-falls-41-on-losses-in-europe.html', 'snippet': 'General Motors said it would focus new attention on its struggling Opel brand in Europe after net income in the second quarter fell to $1.48 billion, from $2.52 billion in the same period a year ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DETROIT — General Motors vowed Thursday to accelerate changes at its troubled European division after a loss in the region dragged down the company’s profit by 41 percent in the second quarter.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/03/business/Auto/Auto-articleLar