nd his team changed their strategy Thursday, saying it was time for a “political alternative.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Anna Hazare’s Movement Turns Political', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hazare, Anna', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Indian National Congress', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-02T12:25:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Niharika Mandhana', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Niharika', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mandhana', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ddd989d8-635d-5847-a057-5f2ce4886f50', 'word_count': 448, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ddd989d8-635d-5847-a057-5f2ce4886f50'}, {'abstract': 'Metropolitan Diary: A shopper discovers that some strangers seem to take it personally if their advice is not immediately obeyed.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/02/when-26-cents-isnt-worth-the-trip/', 'snippet': 'Metropolitan Diary: A shopper discovers that some strangers seem to take it personally if their advice is not immediately obeyed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dear Diary:I was in a health food store on the Upper East Side reaching for a package of Kashi cereal priced at $4.25 when an older gentleman in a bright red T-shirt appeared and admonished, “Don’t buy that; it’s cheaper in Fairway.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'When 26 Cents Isn’t Worth the Trip', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'prin