ists worry about protecting sensitive areas.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/05/realestate/new-jersey-in-the-region-mapping-future-growth.html', 'snippet': 'An update of sewer maps across New Jersey is seen as a first step toward shaping new development, but environmentalists worry about protecting sensitive areas.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AFTER years of confusion, disputes and rule changes, New Jersey’s 21 counties surprised many last month by meeting a deadline to produce updated sewer service maps — not only locating infrastructure already in place but also detailing where new infrastructure should go. The maps are expected to guide statewide development well into the future.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/05/realestate/0805NJZO_SPAN/0805NJZO_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/05/realestate/0805NJZO_SPAN/0805NJZO_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/05/realestate/0805NJZO_SPAN/0805NJZO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 697, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/05/realestate/0805NJZO_SPAN/0805NJZO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1395, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/05/realestate/0805NJZO_SPAN/0805NJZO_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/05/realestate/0805NJZO_SPAN/0