_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/03/nyregion/raymond-roth-missing-long-island-swimmer-reported-alive-in-south-carolina.html', 'snippet': 'Raymond Roth, 47, was reported vanished while swimming off Long Island on Saturday, but was pulled over while speeding through South Carolina on Thursday, authorities say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'These Am-I-or-Aren’t-I-Alive tales sprout up here and there with a certain wearying regularity. A person fleeing personal turbulence of some stripe — financial woes, marital discord, malfeasance — vanishes into the ocean or off the side of a cliff. But it is actually a calculated ruse to facilitate escape. The individual eventually turns up breathing quite well in Antigua.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/03/nyregion/VANISH3/VANISH3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 924, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/03/nyregion/VANISH3/VANISH3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1848, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/03/nyregion/VANISH3/VANISH3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/03/nyregion/VANISH3/VANISH3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/03/nyregion/VANISH3/VANISH3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'As Missing Swimmer Is Found Alive, Case Takes a Turn', 'kicker'