hrough a secret 2.5 million-word Defense Department history of the Vietnam War.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/03/business/media/gerald-gold-times-editor-on-the-pentagon-papers-is-dead-at-85.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Gold helped supervise the herculean task of combing through a secret 2.5 million-word Defense Department history of the Vietnam War.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gerald Gold, an editor for The New York Times who helped supervise the herculean task of combing through a secret 2.5-million-word Defense Department history of the Vietnam War, later known as the Pentagon Papers, to produce articles showing that officials had lied about the war, died on Wednesday at a hospice in Melville, N.Y. He was 85.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/03/nyregion/GOLD-obit/GOLD-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/03/nyregion/GOLD-obit/GOLD-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1407, 'width': 1759, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/03/nyregion/GOLD-obit/GOLD-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/03/nyregion/GOLD-obit/GOLD-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/03/nyregion/GOLD-obit/GOLD-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Gerald Gold, Editor on the Pentag