': 'Cameras', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'APERTURE FOUNDATION', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'George Eastman House', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Transit Museum', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-03T09:00:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Estrin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Estrin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/147e1d62-b329-5a69-8f5a-4c51eec7b39d', 'word_count': 601, 'uri': 'nyt://article/147e1d62-b329-5a69-8f5a-4c51eec7b39d'}, {'abstract': 'A major policy guideline published on Friday is the latest statement or speech in which Kim Jong-un has sounded more focused on the North Korean economy than on the military.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/04/world/asia/kim-jong-un-calls-for-greater-north-korean-prosperity.html', 'snippet': 'A major policy guideline published on Friday is the latest statement or speech in which Kim Jong-un has sounded more focused on the North Korean economy than on the military.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEOUL, South Korea — The North Korean leader Kim Jong-un called for building a “prosperous country” in a major policy guideline published on Friday, a day after he told a visiting Chinese delegation that he was focused on “developing the economy and improving people’s livelihoods.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/04/world/nkorea/nkorea-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 614, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy':