reported a 7 percent decline in quarterly profit.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/03/viacom-plans-new-projects-for-nickelodeon/', 'snippet': 'The effort to develop more than a dozen new television series and movies for the struggling children’s channel came as the media giant reported a 7 percent decline in quarterly profit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Viacom said Friday that it would develop more than a dozen new television series and movies for its struggling Nickelodeon channel. The announcement came minutes after the company said its profit fell 7 percent in the most recent quarter, driven by a decline in advertising revenue and a slower-than-usual quarter for its Paramount movie studio.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Viacom Plans New Projects for Nickelodeon', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cable Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Media', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nickelodeon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Paramount Pictures', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Viacom Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-03T13:56:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amy Chozick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chozick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3a3e6126-f05d-5c7f-aa49-dd6d7fdc9bef', 'word_count': 319, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3a3e6126-f05d-5c7f-aa49-dd6d7fdc9bef'}, {'abstract': 'Educational Web sites for stu