sues,” Senators Herb Kohl and Mike Lee of the Judiciary subcommittee on antitrust issues wrote after holding hearing on the planned takeover.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/03/senators-letter-to-f-t-c-adds-to-pressure-on-universal-emi-deal/', 'snippet': 'The $1.9 billion bid for EMI “presents significant competition issues,” Senators Herb Kohl and Mike Lee of the Judiciary subcommittee on antitrust issues wrote after holding hearing on the planned takeover.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Putting further pressure on the Universal Music Group in its $1.9 billion bid for EMI Music, the leaders of a Senate committee sent a letter on Friday to the Federal Trade Commission, saying that the deal “presents significant competition issues” and asking the agency to examine it closely.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Senators’ Letter to F.T.C. Adds to Pressure on Universal-EMI Deal', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Antitrust Laws and Competition Issues', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kohl, Herbert H', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lee, Michael S', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'EMI Group PLC', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Commission', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Trade Commission', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Universal Music Group', 'rank': 11, 'maj