athfinder’s construction to appeal to a change in consumer taste and to keep up with competing vehicles riding on unibody platforms.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Amid the crunching of nacho chips and the clicking of high heels navigating cobblestone streets, Nissan unveiled the 2013 Pathfinder in Lower Manhattan on Thursday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'With a Unibody Design, the 2013 Nissan Pathfinder Strikes a Sleeker Pose', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nissan Motor Co', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-03T21:14:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Kurczewski', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kurczewski', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/263882ce-35e8-5564-9fb5-0afc674f2fa8', 'word_count': 506, 'uri': 'nyt://article/263882ce-35e8-5564-9fb5-0afc674f2fa8'}, {'abstract': 'The news organization said that its opinion blog was compromised and that fabricated posts were put up, including a fake interview with the head of the Free Syrian Army.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/03/hacker-posts-false-syria-information-on-reuters-blog/', 'snippet': 'The news organization said that its opinion blog was compromised and that fabricated posts were put up, including a fake interview with the head of the Free Syrian Army.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Reuters News temporarily suspended its opinion blog on Friday after an anonymous hacker broke in and wrote false information about Syria.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hacker Posts False Syr