s/television/jerry-seinfelds-online-comedians-in-cars-getting-coffee.html', 'snippet': 'Jerry Seinfeld has a new online series, “Comedians in Cars Getting Coffee.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Leave it to Ricky Gervais to get to the essential truth, even in someone else’s Web series. “You’re like a young king, aren’t you?” he says, sitting across a table from Jerry Seinfeld in “Comedians in Cars Getting Coffee.” If Mr. Seinfeld wants to drive around in cool old cars with “some friends he’s seen on the telly,” well, all he has to do is pick up the phone. He’s Jerry Seinfeld, for God’s sake.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/04/arts/04WATCHLIST/04WATCHLIST-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 310, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/04/arts/04WATCHLIST/04WATCHLIST-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 310}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/04/arts/04WATCHLIST/04WATCHLIST-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 529, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/04/arts/04WATCHLIST/04WATCHLIST-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1058, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/04/arts/04WATCHLIST/04WATCHLIST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/04/arts/04WATCHLIST/04WATCHLIST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'i