lcin, a Turk, denied having any connection to Al Qaeda, said a person close to the investigation. A judge on Friday charged Mr. Yalcin with possession of explosives and ordered the other two detained for 48 hours for further investigation. Mr. Yalcin denied any knowledge of the explosives found in his home, said the newspaper El País. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spain: Terror Suspects Face Judge', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Europe', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Spain: Terror Suspects Face Judge', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Courts and the Judiciary', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spain', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AL QAEDA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-04T01:10:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Raphael Minder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Raphael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Minder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/28e68290-54a4-5cc0-9485-c836e53e6e34', 'word_count': 103, 'uri': 'nyt://article/28e68290-54a4-5cc0-9485-c836e53e6e34'}, {'abstract': 'Which New York City high school and playground bred the most major leaguers, and all about the Irish Alps in the Catskills.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/05/nyregion/answers-to-questions-about-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'Which New York City high school and playground bred the most major leaguers, and all about the Irish Alps in the Catskills.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Schoolboys With Talent', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'mult