gns and the park’s size (618 acres) present a challenge in making it to an Olympic event.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/04/sports/olympics/at-the-olympic-park-a-buoyant-bedlam.html', 'snippet': 'Despite the efforts of the 70,000 eager volunteers, confusing signs and the park’s size (618 acres) present a challenge in making it to an Olympic event.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — How could anyone passing through the St. Pancras International train station in central London fail to locate the new superfast train that hurtles passengers to the Olympic park in a mere seven minutes? Part of a mass signpost refit before the Olympics, the station is full of jaunty pink “Javelin Train to ” signs. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/04/sports/JPOLYMPICS2/JPOLYMPICS2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/04/sports/JPOLYMPICS2/JPOLYMPICS2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/04/sports/JPOLYMPICS2/JPOLYMPICS2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/04/sports/JPOLYMPICS2/JPOLYMPICS2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1368, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/04/sports/JPOLYMPICS2/JPOLYMPICS2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/04/sports/JPOLYMPICS2/JPOLYMPICS2-thumbStandar