, 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/9464b90e-ac0c-5c81-8fdc-ecf9e1b99cb3'}, {'abstract': 'Even competitors in popular sports are likely to find that life after gold is not very lucrative. And for the champions in sports like skeet shooting and archery, the odds are even higher.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/04/sports/olympics/olympic-athletes-may-win-gold-but-a-pot-of-it-rarely-follows.html', 'snippet': 'Even competitors in popular sports are likely to find that life after gold is not very lucrative. And for the champions in sports like skeet shooting and archery, the odds are even higher.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Vincent Hancock won gold in skeet shooting here this week, missing just 2 of 150 targets in the competition. It was an extraordinary performance and unprecedented, too. Hancock prevailed in the same event in Beijing in 2008, making him the first skeet shooter to successfully defend his Olympic title.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/04/sports/04obscure_337/04obscure_337-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 340, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/04/sports/04obscure_337/04obscure_337-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 340}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/04/sports/04obscure_337/04obscure_337-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/04/sports/04obscure_337/04obscure_337-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type