d in talks in Ethiopia, with pressure from the United States, on how much South Sudan, which has the oil, will pay Sudan, through which the export pipelines run.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/05/world/africa/two-sudans-reach-deal-on-fees-for-oil-pipelines.html', 'snippet': 'A deal was reached in talks in Ethiopia, with pressure from the United States, on how much South Sudan, which has the oil, will pay Sudan, through which the export pipelines run.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NAIROBI, Kenya — Sudan and South Sudan have reached a deal on oil pipeline fees, a highly divisive issue that nearly drove the two countries to war this year, African Union officials announced Saturday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/05/world/sudan/sudan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 737, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/05/world/sudan/sudan-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1474, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Two Sudans Reach Deal on Fees for Oil Pipelines', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Two Sudans Reach Deal on Fees for Oil Pipelines', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Sudan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pipelines', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sudan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-04T17:15