mes.com/2012/08/05/opinion/sunday/memory-and-the-cybermind.html', 'snippet': 'No one can remember everything, and the Web can be a great mind-expanding device.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE line that separates my mind from the Internet is getting blurry. This has been happening ever since I realized how often it feels as though I know something just because I can find it with Google. Technically, of course, I don’t know it. But when there’s a smartphone or iPad in reach, I know everything the Internet knows. Or at least, that’s how it feels.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/05/sunday-review/05CLOUD/05CLOUD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1003, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/05/sunday-review/05CLOUD/05CLOUD-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2006, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/05/sunday-review/05CLOUD/05CLOUD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/05/sunday-review/05CLOUD/05CLOUD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/05/sunday-review/05CLOUD/05CLOUD-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Don’t Fear the Cybermind', 'kicker': 'Opinion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Don’t Fear The Cybermind', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Memory