l campaigns let their advertising do the talking this weekend with the candidates off the trail.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/05/dueling-campaigns-ads-for-a-weekend-off-the-trail/', 'snippet': 'The presidential campaigns let their advertising do the talking this weekend with the candidates off the trail.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Both Mitt Romney and President Obama are off the campaign trail today, but their campaigns are not resting. Both sides released new ads this weekend that took up some fresh themes, with the Romney campaign seizing on the unemployment figures released Friday and the Obama team making an appeal to female voters.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dueling Campaign Ads for a Weekend Off the Trail', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Advertising', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Planned Parenthood Federation of America', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-05T14:46:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gerry Mullany', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gerry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mullany', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9182ac0e-3e43-572d-8c37-fb1a418ec586', 'word_count': 328, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9182ac0e-3e43-572d-8c37-fb1a418ec586'}, {'abstract': 'Apple, by going to a jury trial to defend the patents of its most prized products, is allowing competitors and the public to see inside one of the most secretive companies in the world.', 'web