ount': 518, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a5b5b6df-895d-50f5-9bee-c525bc823282'}, {'abstract': 'Heidi Latsky’s “Gimp,” featuring several disabled dancers, challenges preconceptions about beauty and body image.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/06/arts/dance/heidi-latsky-dance-performs-gimp-at-lincoln-center.html', 'snippet': 'Heidi Latsky’s “Gimp,” featuring several disabled dancers, challenges preconceptions about beauty and body image.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I’ve been watching you,” David Harrell yelled at the people assembled in Hearst Plaza on Saturday night for Lincoln Center Out of Doors. “I think you’re beautiful,” he said, and then, “I thought this was going to be strange,” and: “This has really moved me. It’s really changed me.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/06/arts/gimp/gimp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 594, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/06/arts/gimp/gimp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1187, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/06/arts/gimp/gimp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/06/arts/gimp/gimp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/06/arts/gimp/gimp-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sailing Into a Summer Night on the Wings of Beauty', 'kicker': 'Dance Review