g the opportunities that have come out of his sudden success on Broadway.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/06/theater/james-corden-goes-far-beyond-in-one-man-two-guvnors.html', 'snippet': 'As his run in “One Man, Two Guvnors” enters its last weeks, James Corden has been juggling the opportunities that have come out of his sudden success on Broadway.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The actor James Corden arrived in New York this spring not exactly a household name and cast in the lead of a comedy some people feared might be too British to succeed on Broadway. He promptly won the Tony for best actor and a passel of other awards, putting that doubt to rest. Now, as his run in “One Man, Two Guvnors” enters its last weeks, he has become a case study in multitasking, juggling the opportunities that have come out of his sudden success here.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/06/arts/20120806CORDEN-slide-4LIN/20120806CORDEN-slide-4LIN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/06/arts/20120806CORDEN-slide-4LIN/20120806CORDEN-slide-4LIN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/06/arts/20120806CORDEN-slide-4LIN/20120806CORDEN-slide-4LIN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/06/arts/20120806CORDEN-slide-4LIN/20120806CORDEN-slide-4LIN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url