ogress in meeting the terms of its second bailout and said they would return in September for a final assessment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/06/world/europe/greece-says-progress-made-in-talks-with-troika.html', 'snippet': 'Creditors wrapped up a review of the country’s progress in meeting the terms of its second bailout and said they would return in September for a final assessment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATHENS — Envoys of Greece’s international creditors on Sunday wrapped up a review of the country’s progress in meeting the terms of its second bailout and said they would return in September for a final assessment that will determine whether further money would be released and a potentially disastrous default averted. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Optimism in Greece After Talks With Lenders', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Optimism In Greece After Talks With Lenders', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Monetary Union', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Monetary Fund', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Central Bank', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greece', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-05T23:37:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Niki Kitsantonis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Niki', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kitsantonis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/92efb675-8fd3-5c4b-b0ec-78b06e4fbaaf', 'word_count': 456, 'uri': 'nyt://article/92efb675-8fd3-5c4b-b0ec-78b06e4fbaaf'}, {'abstract': 'Olympic Stadium, Sunday night. Imagining what I could have seen had I come an hour earlier and gotten a better seat.', 'web_url': 'https://niemann.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/05/competitive-armchair-olympics-olympic-record/', 'snippet': 'Olympic Stadium, Sunday night. Imagining what I could have seen had I come an hour earlier and gotten a better seat.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Click to begin the race.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Competitive Armchair Olympics: Olympic Record', 'kicker': 'Abstract Sunday', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-08-05T23:45:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jon Huang and Christoph Niemann', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Huang', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Christoph', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Niemann', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1b1d0bad-0119-5001-ab81-f91b0924ea4e', 'word_count': 40, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1b1d0bad-0119-5001-ab81-f91b0924ea4e'}, {'abstract': 'History was made on Sunday with 12 fights as women competed in boxing, which was the last all-male sport in the Olympic Games.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/06/sports/olympics/women-participate-in-olympic-boxing-for-first-time.html', 'snippet': 'History was made on Sunday with 12 fights as women competed in boxing, which was the last all-male sport in the Olympic Games.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — For much of the match, the North Korean boxer seemed intent on wrapping her arms around her Russian opponent as if her strategy were to dance cheek to cheek. Occasionally, they traded blows, and the Russian slightly got the better of that. She won the bout, 12-9.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/06/sports/FIGHT/FIGHT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/06/sports/FIGHT/FIGHT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/06/sports/FIGHT/FIGHT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 757, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/06/sports/FIGHT/FIGHT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1514, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/06/sports/FIGHT/FIGHT-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Women Finally Get Their Chance to Be Contenders in Olympic Boxing', 'kicker': 'Boxing | Women', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Women Finally Get Their Chance to Be a Contender', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kom, Mary', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boxing', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Underwood, Quanitta', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Esparza, M