e, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f7a28fc0-f882-5235-849f-67d37fcb1c31', 'word_count': 1297, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f7a28fc0-f882-5235-849f-67d37fcb1c31'}, {'abstract': 'Both men were Egyptian immigrants of a similar age who were shot with .22-caliber guns in their own stores.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/06/nyregion/killings-of-2-brooklyn-shopkeepers-unnerve-fellow-merchants.html', 'snippet': 'Both men were Egyptian immigrants of a similar age who were shot with .22-caliber guns in their own stores.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The recent killings of two shopkeepers in south Brooklyn bore eerie similarities, though their deaths occurred nearly four weeks apart. Both were shot in the head or neck with what the police said were .22-caliber guns. Both were Egyptian immigrants around retirement age. And both sold their wares at addresses that contained the same numbers: two 7s, a 1 and an 8.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/06/nyregion/KILLER1/KILLER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/06/nyregion/KILLER1/KILLER1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1320, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fatal Shootings of 2 Brooklyn Shopkeepers Unnerve Fellow Merchants', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fatal Shootings of 2 Brooklyn Shopkeepers Unnerve Fellow Merchants', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Mu