 'lead_paragraph': 'Pam Stuper, the head field hockey coach at Yale, played on three national championship teams at Old Dominion University, and on the United States national team from 1990-1998, earning a bronze medal at the 1994 World Cup. She currently chairs the USA Field Hockey Board of Directors. She will be writing for the 2012 London Olympics blog throughout the Games.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'USA Field Hockey Looking to Continue Growth', 'kicker': '2012 London Olympics', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Field', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-06T16:08:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pam Stuper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stuper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b6980b26-fbde-5128-90b0-0e260e956b55', 'word_count': 353, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b6980b26-fbde-5128-90b0-0e260e956b55'}, {'abstract': 'Only about one-quarter of women with vaginal pain ever report the problem to a medical professional. And those who do speak up are often told — incorrectly — that nothing can be done.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/06/persistence-is-key-to-treating-vaginal-pain/', 'snippet': 'Only about one-quarter of women with vaginal pain ever report the problem to a medical professional. And those who do speak up are often told — incorrectly — that nothing can be done.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Millions of women experience vaginal discomfort, and sometimes crippling pain, for a variety of reasons, most often a loss of estrogen. The resulting vaginal dryness and atrophy can make sexual intercourse, a pelvic exam, urinating, or even sitting, walking or cycling a painful nightmare.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/science/07BROD/07BROD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 708, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/science/07BROD/07BROD-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1416, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/science/07BROD/07BROD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/07/science/07BROD/07BROD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/science/07BROD/07BROD-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Persistence Is Key to Treating Sexual Pain', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Personal Health: Persistence Is Key to Treating Sexual Pain', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Estrogen', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pain', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vagina', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-06T16:08:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_na