s the work of Xavier Dumont, who has created a twig-inspired benches and easels.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/06/garden/xavier-dumonts-sculptural-furniture-at-anthropologie.html', 'snippet': 'Anthropologie’s gallery displays the work of Xavier Dumont, who has created a twig-inspired benches and easels.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Xavier Dumont’s furniture pieces look as if tree limbs fell to the ground and settled into graceful but utilitarian shapes. Mr. Dumont, a French sculptor, created the one-of-a-kind twig-inspired benches and easels now on display at Anthropologie’s gallery at Rockefeller Center. He opened his own design studio in 2005 in Paris, where he lives.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/06/garden/06CURRENTS_DUMONTSPAN/06CURRENTS_DUMONTSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/06/garden/06CURRENTS_DUMONTSPAN/06CURRENTS_DUMONTSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/06/garden/06CURRENTS_DUMONTSPAN/06CURRENTS_DUMONTSPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 730, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/06/garden/06CURRENTS_DUMONTSPAN/06CURRENTS_DUMONTSPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1033, 'width': 1450, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/06/garden/06CURRENTS_DUMONTSPAN/06CURRENTS_DUMONTSPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/06/garden/06