sporty-sleek silhouettes and separates for his prefall and fall collections, both of which were inspired by neo-noir comic books like Sin City and Superman. Earning its name from the classic “V for Vendetta,” Lim’s new Vendetta cross-body bag packs a powerful one-two punch: a compact shape and an extra-long strap, making it ideal for quickly slinging over the shoulder (and keeping your superwoman hands free). “I like the idea of it being worn in many different ways, as a messenger during the day and as a clutch at night,” Lim says. The Vendetta comes in classic brown, black and a most coveted color-blocked version. “The basis of the bag comes from structured vintage satchels,” Lim adds. “We played with the idea of color blocking to modernize it and changed the proportion a little, too.” WHAM!', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Get | 3.1 Phillip Lim’s Vendetta Mini Cross-Body', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-08-06T19:15:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Claire Knebl', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Claire', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Knebl', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dda10b10-62ca-55bb-be01-c42a36ab0310', 'word_count': 150, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dda10b10-62ca-55bb-be01-c42a36ab0310'}, {'abstract': 'NASA’s Curiosity rover landed on the surface of Mars early Monday morning.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2012/08/06/science/space/0806-mars.html', 'snippet': 'NASA’s Curiosity rover landed on the surface of Mars early Monday morning.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NASA’s Curiosity rover landed on the surface of Mars early Monday morning.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline':