or fat that consumers will like.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/07/science/us-cheese-industry-works-to-reduce-sodium-and-fat.html', 'snippet': 'Under pressure to reduce sodium and saturated fats in American diets, the cheese industry has tried, with little success, to make products with less salt or fat that consumers will like.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MILWAUKEE — In the centuries that Americans have been making cheese, they have gotten very good at it, producing world-class Cheddars and chèvres, to name just two varieties. But more recently, cheese making has been something of a struggle.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/science/07CHEE/07CHEE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 745, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/science/07CHEE/07CHEE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1489, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/science/07CHEE/07CHEE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/07/science/07CHEE/07CHEE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/science/07CHEE/07CHEE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Asked to Get Slim, Cheese Resists', 'kicker': 'What We Eat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Asked To Get Slim, Cheese Resists', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'ke