d tour.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The pioneering Afrobeat band is back with a new album and tour.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/arts/music/08072012ANTIBALAS-slide-XF34/08072012ANTIBALAS-slide-XF34-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/arts/music/08072012ANTIBALAS-slide-XF34/08072012ANTIBALAS-slide-XF34-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/arts/music/08072012ANTIBALAS-slide-XF34/08072012ANTIBALAS-slide-XF34-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/07/arts/music/08072012ANTIBALAS-slide-XF34/08072012ANTIBALAS-slide-XF34-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/arts/music/08072012ANTIBALAS-slide-XF34/08072012ANTIBALAS-slide-XF34-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Antibalas Returns', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-08-06T22:26:13+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Arts', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/9176840e-7fcc-506a-8b1e-1d6795399c71', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/9176840e-7fcc-506a-8b1e-1d6795399c71'}, {'abstract': 'The two showpiece-filled International Evenings of Dance on Friday and Saturday have been highlights of the Vail International Dance Festival in Colorado.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/07/arts/dance/vail-international-dance-festivals-evenings-of-dance.html', 'snippet': 'The two showpiece-filled International Evenings of Dance on Friday and Saturday have been highlights of the Vail International Dance Festival in Colorado.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VAIL, Colo. — Each year a central feature of the two-week Vail International Dance Festival, high in the Rockies, is its two consecutive International Evenings of Dance. Organized and introduced onstage by the festival’s artistic director, Damian Woetzel, this year’s presentations were distinguished above all by catholic taste and brilliant programming. They merit superlatives. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/arts/vail/vail-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 771, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/arts/vail/vail-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1542, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/arts/vail/vail-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/07/arts/vail/vail-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/arts/vail/vail-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Surprises at Every Twirl', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Surprises At Every Twirl', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vail International Dance Festival', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woetzel, Damian', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Vail (Colo)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-06T22:27:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alastair Macaulay', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alastair', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Macaulay', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/c73740ed-e4b0-5e63-b46f-df26fc955c2f', 'word_count': 948, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c73740ed-e4b0-5e63-b46f-df26fc955c2f'}, {'abstract': 'With “Fela!” carving a place in the mainstream for Afrobeat music, the Brooklyn band Antibalas renews its drive to reach the spotlight.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/07/arts/music/antibalas-afrobeat-band-hopes-for-post-fela-audience.html', 'snippet': 'With “Fela!” carving a place in the mainstream for Afrobeat music, the Brooklyn band Antibalas renews its drive to reach the spotlight.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Five years have elapsed since the pioneering Afrobeat band Antibalas last released a CD. That recording, “Security,” was a commercial disappointment, but in the interim bands like Vampire Weekend and Toubab Krewe have become successful by dipping into the Afrobeat sound, and the genre has even found its way onto Broadway in “Fela!,” a musical about the creator of Afrobeat, which won a Tony award. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times',