anization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'List', '_id': 'nyt://article/5443d662-03dc-5c23-8fb2-227289120416', 'word_count': 211, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5443d662-03dc-5c23-8fb2-227289120416'}, {'abstract': 'The challenge for the United States and its allies is not just to step up the pressure on Syria, but it is also to prepare the country for a stable future.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/07/opinion/if-president-assad-falls-in-syria.html', 'snippet': 'The challenge for the United States and its allies is not just to step up the pressure on Syria, but it is also to prepare the country for a stable future.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Bashar al-Assad’s security forces are continuing to kill Syrians in huge numbers, but the opposition’s chances of prevailing look better than they did six months ago. The challenge for the United States and its partners is not just to step up the pressure, but also to prepare the ground for a constructive future for Syria. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'If Assad Falls in Syria', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'If Assad Falls in Syria', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-07T01:56:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/bcd0f1