 '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/d5d1ac97-31c4-5290-8864-e06a11ce3a09', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/d5d1ac97-31c4-5290-8864-e06a11ce3a09'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Piazza sang with the Metropolitan Opera, appeared on TV and performed on the supper-club circuit in the United States and Cuba.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/07/arts/music/marguerite-piazza-popular-singer-of-opera-dies-at-86.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Piazza sang with the Metropolitan Opera, appeared on TV and performed on the supper-club circuit in the United States and Cuba.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Marguerite Piazza had a voice that could pack a concert hall and a figure that transfixed television audiences. She was sought out for ribbon cuttings and commercial endorsements and once performed as part of a Super Bowl halftime show. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/arts/PIAZZA-obit/PIAZZA-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 853, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/arts/PIAZZA-obit/PIAZZA-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1706, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/arts/PIAZZA-obit/PIAZZA-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/07/arts/PIAZZA-obit/PIAZZA-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/arts/PIAZZA-obit/PIAZZA-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Marguerite Piazza, Popular Singer of Opera, Dies at 86', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Marguerite Piazza, 86, Versatile Singer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Piazza, Marguerite', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-07T02:30:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Schwirtz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schwirtz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/5519c199-e9ae-537e-9e8e-7a3409041204', 'word_count': 571, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5519c199-e9ae-537e-9e8e-7a3409041204'}, {'abstract': 'For the second time in three games, the Yankees faced a Cy Young Award winner and lost. This time, Ivan Nova was no match for Detroit’s ace, Justin Verlander.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/07/sports/baseball/tigers-justin-verlander-fans-14-and-beats-yankees.html', 'snippet': 'For the second time in three games, the Yankees faced a Cy Young Award winner and lost. This time, Ivan Nova was no match for Detroit’s ace, Justin Verlander.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DETROIT — On April 20, after a decent performance against the Boston Red Sox, Ivan Nova noted that if asked, he would say he is the best pitcher in the world, a comment meant to express self-confidence more than a critical assessment of his talent. Nova is certainly not the best in the world, especially after another dismal outing Monday. But a strong case could be made for the man who beat him.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/sports/YANKEES2/YANKEES2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/sports/YANKEES2/YANKEES2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/sports/YANKEES2/YANKEES2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/07/sports/YANKEES2/YANKEES2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/07/sports/YANKEES2/YANKEES2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Verlander Dominates the Yankees While Nova Proves Ineffective Again', 'kicker': 'Tigers 7, Yankees 2', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Verlander Dominates the Yankees While Nova Proves Ineffective Again', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Verlander, Justin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nova, Ivan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Detroit Tigers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-07T02:36:14+0000', 'document_type': 'ar