, the Pro’s Pro', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bergman, Marilyn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hamlisch, Marvin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kleban, Edward', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lloyd Webber, Andrew', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Seberg, Jean', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Streisand, Barbra', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-07T19:48:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Holden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1785cd03-25c2-5b69-aaf9-181c8ced8013', 'word_count': 463, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1785cd03-25c2-5b69-aaf9-181c8ced8013'}, {'abstract': 'You probably won’t find these plum varieties in the supermarket.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/08/dining/at-greenmarkets-special-plums.html', 'snippet': 'You probably won’t find these plum varieties in the supermarket.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Greenmarkets normally win plaudits for selling produce that’s locally grown and often organic, but they also sell items that are simply not available anywhere else.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/08/dining/08STUFF_PLUMSPAN/08STUFF_PLUMSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/08/dining/08STUFF_PLUMSPAN/08STUFF_PLUMSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/08/dining/08STUFF_PLUMSPAN/08STUFF3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/08/dining/08STUFF_PLUMSPAN/08STUFF3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/08/dining/08STUFF_PLUMSPAN/08STUFF_PLUMSPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/08/dining/08STUFF_PLUMSPAN/08STUFF_PLUMSPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/08/dining/08STUFF_PLUMSPAN/08STUFF_PLUMSPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Calling Jack Horner', 'kicker': 'Food Stuff', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Calling Jack Horner', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Local Food', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Plums', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Supermarkets and Grocery Stores', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-07T19:50:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/51e619b3-4711-5053-a0d7-2f9f5cef31e7', 'word_count': 186, 'uri': 'nyt://article/51e619b3-4711-5053-a0d7-2f9f5cef31e7'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Hamlisch, the singularly productive composer of musicals like “A Chorus Line” and songs like “The Way We Were,” won Oscars, Grammys, Emmys, a Tony and a Pulitzer Prize.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/08/arts/music/marvin-hamlisch-composer-dies-at-68.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Hamlisch, the singularly productive composer of musicals like “A Chorus Line” and songs like “The Way We Were,” won Oscars, Grammys, Emmys, a Tony and a Pulitzer Prize.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Marvin Hamlisch, the Pulitzer Prize-winning composer who imbued his movie and Broadway scores with pizazz and panache and often found his songs in the upper reaches of the pop charts, died on Monday in Los Angeles. He was 68 and lived in New York.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/08/arts/subHAMLISCH/subHAMLISCH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1004, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/08/arts/subHAMLISCH/subHAMLISCH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1004, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/08/arts/subHAMLISCH/subHAMLISCH-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/08/arts/subHAMLISCH/subHAMLISCH-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/08/arts/subHAMLISCH/subHAMLISCH-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Marvin Hamlisch, Whose Notes Struck Gold, Dies at 68', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Wrote Golden Signature Notes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hamlisch, Marvin', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-07T19:52:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rob Hoerburger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoerburger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/26cf0d60-1c40-5ab7-a419-a2c3345e0ea2', 'word_count': 1373, 'uri': 'nyt://article/26cf0d60-1c40-5ab7-a419-a2c3345e0ea2'}, {'abstract': 'In a study, doing at least two and a half hours a week of either aerobic exercise or weight training substantially lowered the risk of Type 2 diabetes — but doing both may offer the greatest benefit.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/07/weight-training-may-lower-diabetes-risk/', 'snippet': 'In a study, doing at least two and a half hours a week of either aerobic exercise or weight training substantially lowered the risk of Type 2 diabetes — but doing both may offer the greatest benefit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Doctors routinely recommend regular aerobic exercise to reduce the risk of Type 2 diabetes. But for those who prefer resistance training to running on a treadmill, a new study shows that weight training can protect against diabetes as well.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/08/health/08well_barbell/08well_barbell-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 316, 'width': 380, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/08/health/08well_barbell/08well_barbell-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 316, 'width': 380, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/08/health/08well_barbell/08well_barbell-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/08/health/08well_barbell/08well_barbell-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/08/health/08well_barbell/08well_barbell-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Weight Training May Lower Diabetes Risk', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-08-07T19:58:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': "By Anahad O'Connor", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anahad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "O'Connor", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1ca23b99-5599-5f49-9e4c-476ef3796b06', 'word_count': 645, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1ca23b99-5599-5f49-9e4c-476ef3796b06'}, {'abstract': 'A federal judge on Tuesday approved a $4.8 million settlement between the Justice Department and Morgan Stanley over accusations of price fixing in the electricity market, even as he said that the settlement amount was too low.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/08/07/federal-judge-grudgingly-approves-morgan-stanley-price-fixing-case/', 'snippet': 'A federal judge on Tuesday approved a $4.8 million settlement between the Justice Department and Morgan Stanley over accusations of price fixing in the electricity market, even as he said that the settlement amount was too low.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over objections from consumer groups and New York officials, a federal judge on Tuesday approved a $4.8 million settlement between the Justice Department and Morgan Stanley over accusations of price fixing in the electricity market.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Federal Judge Grudgingly Approves Morgan Stanley Price-Fixing Case', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Morgan Penalty In Price-Fixing Gets Approval', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Antitrust Laws and Competition Issues', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AARP', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Astoria Generating Co', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Keyspan Energy Corp', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Morgan Stanley', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Grid Plc', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-07T19:59:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Lattman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lattman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1047dfc1-1398-5f16-9ddc-dc8508a4119a', 'word_count': 516, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1047dfc1-1398-5f16-9ddc-dc8508a4119a'}, {'abstract': 'Bialetti, an Italian cookware company, is now offering its five-quart oval pasta pot in red, charcoal gray, purple, turquoise and orange.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/08/dining/bialetti-pasta-pot-now-more-colors.html', 'snippet': 'Bialetti, an Italian cookware company, is now offering its five-quart oval pasta pot in red, charcoal gray, purple, turquoise and orange.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bialetti, an Italian cookware company, introduced its five-quart oval pasta pot more than 10 years ago. I loved its shape, which neatly accommodated a pound or two of long pasta like spaghetti, and its colanderlike lid, which locked in place for easy draining. I even put up with the color, metallic blue. Now Bialetti has introduced an array of hues: red, charcoal gray, purple, turquoise and orange. Meanwhile, I have discovered some uses besides preparing pasta: It will hold six ears of corn on the cob, and is ideal for steaming or boiling two 1 ¼-pound lobsters. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/08/dining/08STUFF_POTSPAN/08STUFF_POTSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/08/dining/08STUFF_POTSPAN/08STUFF_POTSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 36