', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editors', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editors'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/75e91d0b-f591-5311-b1cd-cef8ec1847fc', 'word_count': 447, 'uri': 'nyt://article/75e91d0b-f591-5311-b1cd-cef8ec1847fc'}, {'abstract': 'How much higher taxes might be in France under a proposed law.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2012/08/07/business/higher-taxes-in-france.html', 'snippet': 'How much higher taxes might be in France under a proposed law.', 'lead_paragraph': 'How much higher taxes might be in France under a proposed law.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wealthy in France May Pay More', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-07T22:48:17+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Business Day', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/5afa7ec1-3fed-5618-8d40-34f7b0f9fba2', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/5afa7ec1-3fed-5618-8d40-34f7b0f9fba2'}, {'abstract': 'Heading into the P.G.A. Championship at the Ocean Course, Tiger Woods was relaxed and candid about the highs and lows of the past season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/08/sports/golf/before-pga-championship-woods-is-candid-about-last-season.html', 'snippet': 'Heading into the P.G.A. Championship at the Ocean Course, Tiger Woods was relaxed and candid about the highs and lows of the past season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KIAWAH ISLAND, S.C. — Tiger Woods was speaking, but the boom of thunder overhead would not let him be heard. Then he 