olloquial sense that someone is doping. Instead, the juice these athletes are imbibing is literal, with beetroot juice and tart cherry juice two of the most popular choices. Growing numbers of elite athletes are turning to these natural beverages to provide what they hope will be a legal performance benefit. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Looking for Fitness in a Glass of Juice', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Phys Ed: More Athletes Look for an Edge in a Glass of Juice', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beverages', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cycling, Track', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Exercise', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Juices', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muscles', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2012)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-08T04:01:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gretchen Reynolds', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gretchen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Reynolds', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c13f3c5b-dbd1-59e5-855b-315fd2d53cd4', 'word_count': 976, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c13f3c5b-dbd1-59e5-855b-315fd2d53cd4'}, {'abstract': 'This fall, Square will begin processing credit and debit card transactions at Starbucks stores in the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/08/technology/starbucks-and-square-to-team-up.html', 'snippet': 'This fall, Square will begin processing credit and debit card transactions at Starbucks stores in the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — Cash moved one small step nearer to its deathbed with the announcement on Wednesday that Square, the mobile payments start-up, would form a partnership with the Starbucks Coffee Company.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/08/business/SQUARE/SQUARE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 614, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/08/business/SQUARE/SQUARE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2045, 'width': 1227, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/08/business/SQUARE/SQUARE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/08/business/SQUARE/SQUARE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/08/business/SQUARE/SQUARE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Starbucks and Square to Team Up', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Starbucks And Square To Team Up', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Square Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Starbucks Corporation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Commerce', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Start-ups', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 5