8, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea0226ce-2474-52f9-8731-a33f48a79627'}, {'abstract': 'Water polo stays mostly out of the spotlight for the four years between Summer Olympics. But what goes on under the water is receiving added attention.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/09/sports/olympics/water-polos-increased-exposure-at-the-olympics.html', 'snippet': 'Water polo stays mostly out of the spotlight for the four years between Summer Olympics. But what goes on under the water is receiving added attention.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — With several news media outlets broadcasting or Web streaming every event at the Olympics, it is almost inevitable that water polo will have its share of R-rated moments.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/sports/09underwater-span/09underwater-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/09/sports/09underwater-span/09underwater-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/sports/09underwater-span/09underwater-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/sports/09underwater-span/09underwater-span-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/sports/09underwater-span/09underwater-span-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbna