or.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/08/stone-links-the-drone-wars/', 'snippet': 'In this week’s links: the ethics of drones, Facebook philosophy, Amartya Sen on the idea of Europe, and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A new chapter in the ongoing debate about the morality of drones opened last week, with a profile in The Guardian of the philosopher Bradley Strawser. Strawser’s perspective on just war theory and the ethics of drones, which was also featured in a recent news analysis in the Sunday Review, is all the more interesting because, as a professor at the U.S. Naval Postgraduate School, he is employed by an institution which is uniquely positioned to act on his views.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Stone Links: The Drone Wars', 'kicker': 'The Stone', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philosophy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-08T20:05:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.c. Lee', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/70a72f3f-d85f-5ae3-abdc-fb0543b1ab62', 'word_count': 676, 'uri': 'nyt://article/70a72f3f-d85f-5ae3-abdc-fb0543b1ab62'}, {'abstract': 'Roberto Sanchez Rivera built his home in Puerto Rico to look like a spaceship, with lights and audio effects.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/garden/100000001705279/ufo-home.html', 'snippet': 'Roberto Sanchez Rivera built his home in Puerto Rico to look like a spaceship, with lights and audio effects.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Roberto Sanchez Rivera built his home in Puerto Rico to look like a spaceship, with lights and audio effects.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarg