 four holes at last month’s British Open, allowing Ernie Els to win the title, Els consoled Scott.', 'web_url': 'https://onpar.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/08/scott-recalls-elss-show-of-support-at-british-open/', 'snippet': 'After Adam Scott bogeyed the final four holes at last month’s British Open, allowing Ernie Els to win the title, Els consoled Scott.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KIAWAH ISLAND, S.C. — Ernie Els, who won last month’s British Open when Adam Scott bogeyed the final four holes, played nine practice holes with Scott on Wednesday at the Ocean Course.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Scott Recalls Els’s Show of Support at British Open', 'kicker': 'On Par', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Els, Ernie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scott, Adam', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-08T21:42:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Pennington', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pennington', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/322c8806-b8e1-5afe-8b90-36cf2862c823', 'word_count': 143, 'uri': 'nyt://article/322c8806-b8e1-5afe-8b90-36cf2862c823'}, {'abstract': 'The computer maker has aggressively spent on deal-making, paying billions of dollars for businesses like E.D.S., Palm, Compaq and, more recently, Autonomy, but few acquisitions have panned out.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/08/08/hewlett-packard-deal-making-missteps/', 'snippet': 'The computer maker has aggressively spent on deal-making, paying billions of dollars for businesses like E.D.S., Palm, Compaq and, more recently, Autonomy, but few acquisitions have panned out.',