yt://article/1a00ed04-723f-52b0-b574-2937b88ba5fb'}, {'abstract': 'Voters in three counties approved a property tax that is expected to raise $23 million a year for the Detroit Institute of Arts, which receives no financial support from either the city or the state.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/09/arts/design/detroit-institute-of-arts-county-millage-tax-approved.html', 'snippet': 'Voters in three counties approved a property tax that is expected to raise $23 million a year for the Detroit Institute of Arts, which receives no financial support from either the city or the state.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Detroit Institute of Arts was saved from devastating budget cuts Tuesday night after voters in three Michigan counties agreed to institute a property tax increase earmarked specifically for the museum.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/arts/SUB-MUSEUM/SUB-MUSEUM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 819, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/arts/SUB-MUSEUM/SUB-MUSEUM-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1566, 'width': 1253, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/arts/SUB-MUSEUM/SUB-MUSEUM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/09/arts/SUB-MUSEUM/SUB-MUSEUM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/arts/SUB-MUSEUM/SUB-MUSEUM-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop