 a surreal pursuit by an Orthodox wedding party, according to a pool report.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mitt Romney’s arrival at a New Jersey fund-raiser on Wednesday capped a breakneck drive along New Jersey’s highways followed by a surreal pursuit by an Orthodox Jewish wedding party, according to a reporter on the trip.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney Makes a Surprise Stop at a New Jersey Wedding', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At a New Jersey Wedding, a Surprise Stop by Romney', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lakewood (NJ)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-08T22:23:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Wheaton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wheaton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9f432c9d-68f1-5391-9c10-f0af52f5dfc3', 'word_count': 405, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9f432c9d-68f1-5391-9c10-f0af52f5dfc3'}, {'abstract': 'Madeline Weinrib reimagines midcentury furniture classics with her signature prints.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/09/garden/madeline-weinribs-textiles-on-midcentury-furniture.html', 'snippet': 'Madeline Weinrib reimagines midcentury furniture classics with her signature prints.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Midcentury furniture classics reimagined: that’s the angle behind the designer Madeline Weinrib’s treatment of a score of notable pieces, which she upholstered in her signature prints. Displayed from Saturday to Sept. 3 at Sebastian & Barquet’s Southampton gallery, the collection includes Vladimir Kagan’s Erica chaise in lavender jacquard ($18,500), Osvaldo Borsani’s P32 lounge chair in dove-gray striped ikat on the back and dove-gray ikat on the front ($7,000) and a three-seat sofa by Ico and Luisa Parisi in brown-striped ikat (above, $45,000). “I wanted to pay tribute to the original designs,” Ms. Weinrib said, “while simultaneously introducing them to the viewer in a way they’ve never experienced the pieces before.” The exhibition is open Tuesdays through Saturdays, 11 a.m. to 6 p.m., 67 Jobs Lane, Southampton, N.Y.; information: (631) 283-0456 or sebastianbarquet.com. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/garden/09SHOWS_SPAN/09SHOWS_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/09/garden/09SHOWS_SPAN/09SHOWS_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/garden/09SHOWS_SPAN/09CURR7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 713, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/garden/09SHOWS_SPAN/09CURR7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1425, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/garden/09SHOWS_SPAN/09SHOWS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/09/garden/09SHOWS_SPAN/09SHOWS-thumb