o', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/garden/09QNA1_SPAN/09QNA1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/09/garden/09QNA1_SPAN/09QNA1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/garden/09QNA1_SPAN/09QNA1_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How the French Get Connected', 'kicker': 'Currents | Q&A', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How the French Get Connected', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lehanneur, Mathieu', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wireless Communications', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Design', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-08T22:30:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Arlene Hirst', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Arlene', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hirst', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/6d36cd7a-8627-5e09-a41f-4a71e4a891c0', 'word_count': 771, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6d36cd7a-8627-5e09-a41f-4a71e4a891c0'}, {'abstract': 'José María Olazábal recalls a 1991 Ryder Cup Match at the Ocean Course in which Seve Ballesteros refused to concede.', 'web_url': 'https://onpar.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/08/rembering-ballesteros-the-competitor-who-never-quit/', 'snippet': 'José María Olazábal recalls a 1991 Ryder Cup Match at the Ocean Course in which Seve Ballesteros refused to concede.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KIAWAH ISLAND, S.C. — As the lone returning competitor from the 1991 Ryder Cup match at Kiawah Island Resort’s Ocean Course to play here this week in the P.G.A. Championship, José María Olazábal couldn’t help but reminisce. Olazábal paired with Seve Ballesteros to form “the Spanish Armada,” one of the most formidable teams in Ryder Cup history. In 1991, they went 3-0-1 in their four matches together.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rembering Ballesteros, the Competitor Who Never Quit', 'kicker': 'On Par', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'PGA Championship', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ryder Cup (Golf)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ballesteros, Seve', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Olazabal, Jose Maria', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-08T22:34:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Schupak', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schupak', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bd31ba74-e54a-549d-bdea-2d1ce503370d', 'word_count': 287, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd31ba74-e54a-549d-bdea-2d1ce503370d'}, {'abstract': 'There are many apps made just for people who want to fill a few minutes of downtime.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/09/technology/personaltech/apps-that-offer-a-lift-during-downtime.html', 'snippet': 'There are many apps made just for people who want to fill a few minutes of downtime.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Times have changed since the best way to pass an idle 10 minutes was Nokia’s famous Snake, or whatever flavor of game was built into your old, dumb cellphone. These basic games were simple entertainment and they were fun — to an extent. But with smartphones, we have thousands of app-enabled ways to pass the time waiting in line at the post office or even when struck with insomnia.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/business/9-SMART1/9-SMART1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 705, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/business/9-SMART1/9-SMART1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1411, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/business/9-SMART1/9-SMART1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/09/business/9-SMART1/9-SMART1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/business/9-SMART1/9-SMART1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Time Wasters, Pointless but Fun', 'kicker': 'App Smart', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Time Wasters, Pointless But Fun', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'M