Campion Platt, architect and father of four, shops for work spaces for children that allow them to spread out and to keep their things there.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/09/garden/shopping-for-childrens-work-spaces-with-campion-platt.html', 'snippet': 'Campion Platt, architect and father of four, shops for work spaces for children that allow them to spread out and to keep their things there.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THIS time of year, children often begin to despair over the end of summer and the looming school year. For many parents, mid-August signals the start of school-supply shopping season and perhaps a time to rethink their child’s work space.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/garden/09SHOP1_SPAN/09-SHOP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/09/garden/09SHOP1_SPAN/09-SHOP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/garden/09SHOP1_SPAN/09-SHOP1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1016, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/garden/09SHOP1_SPAN/09-SHOP1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2032, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/09/garden/09SHOP1_SPAN/09-SHOP1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/09/garden/09SHOP1_SPAN/09-SHOP1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 7