488, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5c83b426-bcf6-568c-bf96-50d1de859501'}, {'abstract': 'Syrian rebels in embattled Aleppo highlighted small gains in the midst of a withdrawal from the most contested area of the city, as government forces fired on their positions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/10/world/middleeast/offensive-in-aleppo-syria-enters-second-day.html', 'snippet': 'Syrian rebels in embattled Aleppo highlighted small gains in the midst of a withdrawal from the most contested area of the city, as government forces fired on their positions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIRUT, Lebanon — Syrian rebels in embattled Aleppo tried to maintain morale on Thursday by highlighting small gains in the midst of a withdrawal from the most contested area of the city, as government forces fired on their positions with jets, helicopters, artillery and tanks. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/10/world/SYRIA/SYRIA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/10/world/SYRIA/SYRIA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/10/world/SYRIA/SYRIA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/10/world/SYRIA/SYRIA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/10/world/SYRIA/SYRIA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 't