 'nyt://article/b579b7fc-f50e-5809-82b8-7ef4dc49fd55', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b579b7fc-f50e-5809-82b8-7ef4dc49fd55'}, {'abstract': 'While critics applaud a halt to the issuing of license renewals by the Nuclear Regulatory Commission, it will not prevent existing plants from continuing to operate, the commission says.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/09/an-uncertain-phase-for-nuclear-power-licenses/', 'snippet': 'While critics applaud a halt to the issuing of license renewals by the Nuclear Regulatory Commission, it will not prevent existing plants from continuing to operate, the commission says.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a rare action, the Nuclear Regulatory Commission has acceded to a petition filed by anti-nuclear groups that it halt some licensing activities until the agency can sort out its troubled policy on nuclear waste. The groups, two dozen of them, are sounding triumphant, as if they have brought the industry to its knees. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Uncertain Phase for Nuclear Power Licenses', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Indian Point Nuclear Power Plant (NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Wastes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nuclear Regulatory Commission', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Yucca Mountain (Nev)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-09T11:27:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matthew L. Wald', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matthew', 'middlename': 'L.', 'lastname': 'Wald', 'qualifier