lith.” It would be an apt prediction of the splashy new projects appearing in this Mediterranean city, which has recruited titans of fashion and architecture to inject some style and modernity. Christian Lacroix, celebrated for his radiant clothing lines, has decorated two recently unveiled tram lines, while the superstar architect Jean Nouvel devised the plans for the enormous new monolithic (and very blue) city hall. Throw in a forthcoming futuristic municipal archives building from the architect Zaha Hadid, and this university center and night-life hotbed may be France’s most forward-looking city.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/travel/12HOURS_SPAN/12HOURS_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 228, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/12/travel/12HOURS_SPAN/12HOURS_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 228}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/travel/12HOURS_SPAN/12HOURS_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 228, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/travel/12HOURS_SPAN/12HOURS_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 228, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/travel/12HOURS_SPAN/12HOURS_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/12/travel/12HOURS_SPAN/12HOURS_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarg