ts', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/3ed55d89-ec49-5126-96e5-0d308b363558', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/3ed55d89-ec49-5126-96e5-0d308b363558'}, {'abstract': 'The weekend offers plenty of free outdoor dance events, including the Downtown Dance Festival, Camille A. Brown, MoralesDance, MBDance and the Kùlú Mèlé African Dance and Drum Ensemble.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/10/arts/dance/downtown-dance-festival-african-drumming-and-more.html', 'snippet': 'The weekend offers plenty of free outdoor dance events, including the Downtown Dance Festival, Camille A. Brown, MoralesDance, MBDance and the Kùlú Mèlé African Dance and Drum Ensemble.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While Weekend Miser is soaking up the rays along the beaches of North Carolina (you think he’d pay Hamptons prices?), he has passed the baton — or rather forwarded several e-mails — to us about all kinds of affordable cultural goings-on around New York.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Downtown Dance Festival, African Drumming and More', 'kicker': 'Weekend Miser', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Culture (Arts)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Battery Dance Company', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-09T20:35:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hilary Howard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hilary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Howard', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Ne