e first time the United States has won two decathlon medals in the same Olympics since 1956.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/10/sports/olympics/ashton-eaton-wins-gold-medal-in-decathlon.html', 'snippet': 'Ashton Eaton took the gold and his teammate Trey Hardee finished second, marking the first time the United States has won two decathlon medals in the same Olympics since 1956.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — By the time Ashton Eaton finished, after he dashed and hurdled and jumped and vaulted, after he completed 10 grueling events in two very long days, he struggled to stand up straight. He paused at the final finish line and bent over, hands on knees, gasping for breath.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/10/sports/DECATHLON10/DECATHLON10-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/10/sports/DECATHLON10/DECATHLON10-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/10/sports/DECATHLON10/DECATHLON10-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/10/sports/DECATHLON10/DECATHLON10-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1144, 'width': 858, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/10/sports/DECATHLON10/DECATHLON10-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/10/sports/DECATHLON10/DECATHLON10-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnail