er life (about which more shortly), Marion launches into an unhinged, obscene tirade at the poor man. Later in the film a karmically empowered pigeon drops an airborne excretory insult on him. Since Marion is played by the director of the film, Julie Delpy, I will take this as a warning.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '3 Guests, 48 Hours, Constant Agita', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '3 Guests, 48 Hours, Constant Agita', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Delpy, Julie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rock, Chris', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': '2 Days in New York (Movie)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-09T21:50:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.O. Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'O.', 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/9239cd25-6b9c-5e79-998f-36899ef72ccf', 'word_count': 817, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9239cd25-6b9c-5e79-998f-36899ef72ccf'}, {'abstract': 'A selected guide to movies playing in and outside the New York area as well as noteworthy film series.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/10/movies/movie-listings-for-aug-10-16.html', 'snippet': 'A selected guide to movies playing in and outside the New York area as well as noteworthy film series.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Movies', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Movie Listings for Aug. 10-16', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Listings', 'name': None, 