 a Jewish state, using still photos and early film footage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bland is a word you probably don’t associate with either the history of Zionism or Theodor Herzl. But the documentary “It Is No Dream: The Life of Theodor Herzl,” directed by Richard Trank, manages to be almost boldly dull. A production of Moriah Films, a division of the Simon Wiesenthal Center, “It Is No Dream” satisfies neither as a movie nor as a history lesson.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/10/arts/10RDP_DREAMSPAN/10RDP_DREAMSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 389, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/10/arts/10RDP_DREAMSPAN/10RDP_DREAMSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 389}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/10/arts/10RDP_DREAMSPAN/0810DREAM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 779, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/10/arts/10RDP_DREAMSPAN/0810DREAM-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1558, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/10/arts/10RDP_DREAMSPAN/10RDP_DREAMSPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/10/arts/10RDP_DREAMSPAN/10RDP_DREAMSPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/10/arts/10RDP_DREAMSPAN/10RDP_DREAMSPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, '