eal to nostalgia for a mythical past. The latest is sponsored by Representative Steve King of Iowa, one of the most ardent restrictionists in Washington, whose other hard-line bills included one to build an electrified border fence (which he designed and once demonstrated on the floor of the House).', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mr. King’s English-Only Bill', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mr. King&#8217;s English-Only Bill', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'English Language', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Language and Languages', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'King, Steven A', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gonzalez, Charles', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigrants', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-10T01:07:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/42a7ffc9-fd30-51c4-adf5-c963ca8d5d88', 'word_count': 363, 'uri': 'nyt://article/42a7ffc9-fd30-51c4-adf5-c963ca8d5d88'}, {'abstract': 'The Dallas Cowboys owner Jerry Jones and players for various football teams are featured in ads that emphasize the importance of Monday nights to the sport’s viewers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/10/busines