 a decision to cut funds for breast cancer screenings at Planned Parenthood was greeted with skepticism on Thursday among breast cancer advocates and longtime former supporters.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Komen’s Leadership Changes Are Met With Skepticism', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Breast Cancer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brinker, Nancy Goodman', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Komen, Susan G, for the Cure', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Planned Parenthood Federation of America', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-10T02:43:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/64c5008e-d7b7-511a-9b3f-ac7657f93627', 'word_count': 1091, 'uri': 'nyt://article/64c5008e-d7b7-511a-9b3f-ac7657f93627'}, {'abstract': 'With the help of Maggie Steffens, the United States women’s water polo team defeated Spain and filled a void that some of its members had been feeling.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/10/sports/olympics/womens-water-polo-gold-goes-to-us-as-it-beats-spain.html', 'snippet': 'With the help of Maggie Steffens, the United States women’s water polo team defeated Spain and filled a void that some of its members had been feeling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Thrice before, gold medals were awarded in women’s water polo, and each time the United States team was on the podium but not atop it. The bridesmaid routine was wearing thinner than a wedding veil for Brenda Villa and Heather Petri, the two holdovers from the inaugural Olympic squad from 2000. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fourth Time Brings Title for United States', 'kicker': "Women's Water Polo | Final", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fourth Time Brings Title for United States', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2012)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Water Polo', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spain', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-10T02:46:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/02571d30-bee1-57ac-be9c-37cb7bb67b19', 'word_count': 788, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02571d30-bee1-57ac-be9c-37cb7bb67b19'}, {'abstract': 'After the shooting in Wisconsin, residents of Oak Creek have come together in efforts to open communication.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/10/us/wisconsin-community-promotes-tolerance-after-shooting.html', 'snippet': 'After the shooting in Wisconsin, residents of Oak Creek have come together in efforts to open communication.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OAK CREEK, Wis. — After the sadness and shock, members of Wisconsin’s insular Sikh community found themselves confronting scenes they never would have expected. There were outpourings of support, including a gathering of hundreds of people of different faiths and skin col