and much more in Hyderabad’s old city.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/10/hyderabads-charm-found-in-ramadan-delights/', 'snippet': 'Break your fast with Haleem, biryani, qubani-ka-meetha and much more in Hyderabad’s old city.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hyderabad, the Scottish historian William Dalrymple wrote, hides “its charms from the eyes of outsiders, veiling its splendors from curious eyes behind nondescript walls and labyrinthine backstreets.” But some secrets, like Hyderabad’s sinfully rich food, perhaps its greatest charm, are hard to keep. And the month of Ramadan is ideal for discovering the city’s most indulgent dishes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hyderabad’s Charm Found in Ramadan Delights', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ramadan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hyderabad (India)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-10T11:10:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Aparna Alluri', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Aparna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alluri', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d2cc9014-1b7d-53ba-83a3-2a275d77dc7d', 'word_count': 646, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d2cc9014-1b7d-53ba-83a3-2a275d77dc7d'}, {'abstract': "The United States dominate a lot of sports at the Olympics, including men's and women's basketball, but men's boxing is not one of them. Jason Stallman has the latest from London.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/multimedia/100000001714260/what-were