{'abstract': 'A collection of links from the reporters and editors of the Dining section.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/10/what-were-reading-498/', 'snippet': 'A collection of links from the reporters and editors of the Dining section.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Disney Food Blog: The indefatigable A. J. Wolfe, who has an entire blog and several books dedicated to the food at Disney World, has the scoop on new restaurants opening this winter, including a 550-seat French showpiece in the Beast’s Castle. — Julia Moskin', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What We’re Reading', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-08-10T13:38:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/21c8e487-1045-5ace-8adf-cea024cf78da', 'word_count': 557, 'uri': 'nyt://article/21c8e487-1045-5ace-8adf-cea024cf78da'}, {'abstract': 'NASA has apps to help you waste time. But you might learn something as well.', 'web_url': 'https://gadgetwise.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/10/app-smart-extra-wasting-time-with-nasa/', 'snippet': 'NASA has apps to help you waste time. But you might learn something as well.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week’s App Smart column was about curious little apps that will help you happily while away an otherwise boring moment while you’re stuck somewhere and have to wait. These time-waster apps are invaluable if your brain craves input and you can’t tolerate boredom, but they’re not exactly going to add quality to your life.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'App Smart Extra: Wasting Time With NASA', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Space', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-10T13:42:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kit Eaton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kit', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eaton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/949cde28-6320-577d-9e9f-1cc27ff51d6d', 'word_count': 329, 'uri': 'nyt://article/949cde28-6320-577d-9e9f-1cc27ff51d6d'}, {'abstract': 'Daniel Aukin, who’s directing the premiere of Sam Shepard’s “Heartless” for Signature Theater, is admired for embracing uncertainty, his colleagues say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/12/theater/daniel-aukin-director-of-sam-shepards-heartless.html', 'snippet': 'Daniel Aukin, who’s directing the premiere of Sam Shepard’s “Heartless” for Signature Theater, is admired for embracing uncertainty, his colleagues say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IT’S a truism that we learn from failure. But who among us doggedly seeks it out — hunts down the half-baked idea, the simplistic shortcut, the embarrassing misstep — and mines it for its teaching value?', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12AUKIN1_SPAN/Aukin1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12AUKIN1_SPAN/Aukin1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12AUKIN1_SPAN/Aukin1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 