ticle', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tara Siegel Bernard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tara', 'middlename': 'Siegel', 'lastname': 'Bernard', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f225a01c-1128-5444-b262-e5d59d266dc4', 'word_count': 183, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f225a01c-1128-5444-b262-e5d59d266dc4'}, {'abstract': 'The right-wing leader denies links to political groups.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/10/surprise-mohan-bhagwat-meets-the-foreign-press/', 'snippet': 'The right-wing leader denies links to political groups.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mohan Bhagwat usually reserves his remarks for his cadres in the Rashtriya Swayamsevak Sangh, or R.S.S., the right-wing Hindu group based in Nagpur. But on Thursday the group’s leader found himself in New Delhi addressing an unlikely audience – some 30 international journalists.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Surprise, Mohan Bhagwat Meets the Foreign Press', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Delhi (India)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-10T13:45:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Niharika Mandhana', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Niharika', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mandhana', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b7e62f2-bf8a-5ab2-906c-7d2850963899', 'word_count': 689, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b7e62f2-bf8a-5ab2-906c-7d2850963899'}, {'abstract': 'New categories in the New York Dance and Performance Awards, or Bessies, shift the focus to definitions instead of to what is onstage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/12/arts/dance/bessies-new-categories-limit-definitions-of-dance.html', 'snippet': 'New categories in the New York Dance and Performance Awards, or Bessies, shift the focus to definitions instead of to what is onstage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHAT makes a dance a dance? It’s a loaded question, especially when many experimental choreographers — in something of a return to the ’60s — have abandoned traditional frames of presentation. It is not uncommon now to see dance in major museums. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12BESSIE1_SPAN/12BESSIE1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12BESSIE1_SPAN/12BESSIE1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12BESSIE1_SPAN/12BESSIE1_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12BESSIE1_SPAN/12BESSIE1_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12BESSIE1_SPAN/12BESSIE1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12BESSIE1_SPAN/12BESSIE1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumb