s has fallen, but remains above prerecession levels.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Off the Charts: More Openings, Fewer Firings', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Layoffs and Job Reductions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-10T16:26:06+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Business Day', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/3a607e05-bc8f-58ef-a6c1-7b842d8282fa', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/3a607e05-bc8f-58ef-a6c1-7b842d8282fa'}, {'abstract': 'T’s Jane Herman delivers The Daily Shoe from the Bergdorf Goodman shoe salon. Today’s pick: a triple-print Mary Jane heel from Tabitha Simmons.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/t-magazine/100000001714666/the-daily-shoe-tabitha-simmons.html', 'snippet': 'T’s Jane Herman delivers The Daily Shoe from the Bergdorf Goodman shoe salon. Today’s pick: a triple-print Mary Jane heel from Tabitha Simmons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'T’s Jane Herman delivers The Daily Shoe from the Bergdorf Goodman shoe salon. Today’s pick: a triple-print Mary Jane heel from Tabitha Simmons.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/10/t-magazine/video-tmag-dailyshoetabitha/video-tmag-dailyshoetabitha-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/10/t-magazine/video-tmag-dailyshoetabitha/video-tmag-dailyshoetabitha-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image'