ike “I Married a Mobster,” on Investigation Discovery. A critic for The Times tries out a few hours of their workdays.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/12/arts/television/extras-in-i-married-a-mobster-and-other-docu-series.html', 'snippet': 'Extras pack expertise into those re-enactment moments of docu-series like “I Married a Mobster,” on Investigation Discovery. A critic for The Times tries out a few hours of their workdays.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’M not normally a violent person, but I swear, if that bastard had leaned any closer to my don without letting me pat him down first, I would have plugged him between the eyes. Shoot first, ask questions later. I didn’t survive this long in the Mafia — “this long” being about two hours — without learning that.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12EXTRAS1_SPAN/12EXTRAS1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12EXTRAS1_SPAN/12EXTRAS1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12EXTRAS1_SPAN/12EXTRAS1_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12EXTRAS1_SPAN/12EXTRAS1_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12EXTRAS1_SPAN/12EXTRAS1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard'