2-8353-2670088a0053', 'word_count': 828, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c00d85aa-bf7c-5d12-8353-2670088a0053'}, {'abstract': 'In the last decade, the number of men who have left the work force entirely to raise children has more than doubled, according to recent United States census data.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/12/fashion/dads-are-taking-over-as-full-time-parents.html', 'snippet': 'In the last decade, the number of men who have left the work force entirely to raise children has more than doubled, according to recent United States census data.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN 2006, James Griffioen was a litigator at a national firm in San Francisco with an 18-month-old daughter and a problem. “Having to go back to the office and work 70 hours a week — or 90, if you want to make partner — that cracked something in me. Something broke,” he said. “It was all the drive and ambition I had as a lawyer. I looked at it over the next five years and thought, ‘There’s no way I’m even going to see my kid.’\xa0”', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/fashion/12DADS_SPAN/12SUBDADS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/12/fashion/12DADS_SPAN/12SUBDADS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/fashion/12DADS_SPAN/12SUBDADS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 677, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/fashion/12DADS_SPAN/12SUBDADS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1354, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/fashion/12DADS_SPAN/12SUBDADS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/12/fashion/12DADS_SPAN/12SUBDADS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/fashion/12DADS_SPAN/12SUBDADS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Just Wait Until Your Mother Gets Home', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Just Wait Until Your Mother Gets Home', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Men and Boys', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-10T20:52:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alex Williams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alex', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Williams', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ea1c4f8d-16e0-5d3c-960c-f486caad3620', 'word_count': 2201, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea1c4f8d-16e0-5d3c-960c-f486caad3620'}, {'abstract': '“Jaws,” a seminal blockbuster, is now out in a Blu-ray edition.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/12/movies/homevideo/jaws-seminal-blockbuster-now-on-blu-ray.html', 'snippet': '“Jaws,” a seminal blockbuster, is now out in a Blu-ray edition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AS part of Universal’s centennial celebration that studio has reissued “Jaws” (1975) on Blu-ray in a newly restored edition, retrofitted with a remixed 7.1-channel stereo soundtrack. Happily, the filmmakers have resisted the temptation to replace Bruce, the balky mechanical shark (actually three of them, used for different types of shots) whose frequent breakdowns helped swell the shooting schedule to 159 days from 55, with a digitally animated creature. A C.G.I. shark might have been more convincing for contemporary audiences — poor Bruce can’t do much more than roll his eyes and flap his mouth, like the world’s most menacing Muppet — but the movie isn’t really about him, after all.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12KEHR_SPAN/12KEHR_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12KEHR_SPAN/12KEHR_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12KEHR_SPAN/12KEHR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12KEHR_SPAN/12KEHR-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12KEHR_SPAN/12KEHR_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12KEHR_SPAN/12KEHR_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/arts/12KEHR_SPAN/12KEHR_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Oh, Bruce, What Teeth You Have', 'kicker': 'DVD', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Oh, Bruce, What Teeth You Have', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scheider, Roy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, John (1932- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dreyfuss, Richard', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings and Downloads', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Jaws (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spielberg, Steven', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-10T20:58:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'subsection_name': 'DVD', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Kehr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kehr', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1b2f9cf5-4d8f-5cb3-8a1f-e26496ac104a', 'word_count': 1416, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1b2f9cf5-4d8f-5cb3-8a1f-e26496ac104a'}, {'abstract': 'In honor of Julia Child, whipping up one of her classic desserts: île flottante, floating island, a cake of soft meringue rising from a pale custard sea.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/15/dining/a-familiar-classic-made-new-with-apricots-a-good-appetite.html', 'snippet': 'In honor of Julia Child, whipping up one of her classic desserts: île flottante, floating island, a cake of soft meringue rising from a pale custard sea.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MY parents were on