reenwich House.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/11/arts/music/matt-mitchell-with-trio-at-greenwich-house.html', 'snippet': 'The recently lauded pianist Matt Mitchell played a set with Chris Tordini and Dan Weiss on Thursday night as part of the Sound It Out series at Greenwich House.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Matt Mitchell crept up on the New York jazz scene pretty recently, and he didn’t seem in a hurry to make himself known. A pianist of classical touch and methodical temperament, he fell in with coolly instigative composer-improvisers like John Hollenbeck and Tim Berne, his reputation accruing as a byproduct of his work ethic. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/arts/MITCHELL/MITCHELL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/11/arts/MITCHELL/MITCHELL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/arts/MITCHELL/MITCHELL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 556, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/arts/MITCHELL/MITCHELL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1111, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/arts/MITCHELL/MITCHELL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/11/arts/MITCHELL/MITCHELL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'cr