cer-dies-at-67.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Cragun was the partner of Marcia Haydée, the prima ballerina, in an acclaimed series of classical dance dramas in the 1960s and 1970s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Richard Cragun, a former star dancer with the Stuttgart Ballet and the partner of the prima ballerina Marcia Haydée in a series of classical dance dramas acclaimed internationally in the 1960s and ’70s, including “Romeo and Juliet,” “Eugene Onegin” and “The Taming of the Shrew,” died on Monday in Rio de Janeiro, where he had lived since 1999. He was 67. The Stuttgart Ballet, which announced his death, did not give the cause.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/arts/CRAGUN-obit/CRAGUN-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 853, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/arts/CRAGUN-obit/CRAGUN-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1707, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/arts/CRAGUN-obit/CRAGUN-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/11/arts/CRAGUN-obit/CRAGUN-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/arts/CRAGUN-obit/CRAGUN-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Richard Cragun, Stuttgart Ballet Dancer, Dies at 67', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Richard Cragun, 67, Stuttgart Ballet Dancer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cragun, Richard', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Stuttgart Ballet', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Haydee, Marcia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-10T23:47:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Vitello', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vitello', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/2529b812-4b92-57ce-af41-8166e49b26f9', 'word_count': 599, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2529b812-4b92-57ce-af41-8166e49b26f9'}, {'abstract': 'People from around the world attended a group memorial service and wake at a school in Oak Creek, Wis., for Sikh worshipers who were killed on Sunday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/11/us/in-wisconsin-service-held-for-6-killed-at-sikh-temple.html', 'snippet': 'People from around the world attended a group memorial service and wake at a school in Oak Creek, Wis., for Sikh worshipers who were killed on Sunday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OAK CREEK, Wis. — One by one, six coffins were rolled into a high school gymnasium here Friday and were surrounded by Sikh men and women singing traditional Punjabi hymns. As they sang, thousands of people from around the world streamed into the gym to mourn the six worshipers who were shot and killed on Sunday at the Sikh Temple of Wisconsin here. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': '