ress materials accompanying the exhibition “Marc Chagall” at the Nassau County Museum of Art in Roslyn Harbor, N.Y. The second part of Mr. Schapiro’s statement isn’t included, however. He added that Chagall was “also a surprising anomaly in the art of an age which otherwise seems so remote from the content and attitude of his work.”', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/nyregion/12ARTSLI2/12ARTSLI2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1452, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/nyregion/12ARTSLI2/12ARTSLI2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2039, 'width': 1438, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/nyregion/12ARTSLI2/12ARTSLI2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/12/nyregion/12ARTSLI2/12ARTSLI2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/nyregion/12ARTSLI2/12ARTSLI2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Vibrant Postcards From an Inner World', 'kicker': 'Arts | Long Island', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Vibrant Postcards From an Inner World', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nassau County Museum of Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Long Island (NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank