a three-way for first, with Carl Pettersson and his old rival Vijay Singh, after a one-under 71 on a blustery day at the P.G.A. Championship.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/11/sports/golf/tiger-woods-ties-for-pga-championship-lead.html', 'snippet': 'Tiger Woods was in a three-way for first, with Carl Pettersson and his old rival Vijay Singh, after a one-under 71 on a blustery day at the P.G.A. Championship.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KIAWAH ISLAND, S.C. — On a day with wind so blustery a well-struck 4-iron still traveled only 145 yards and even short putts ended up completely blown off the green, Tiger Woods, his shirt sleeves and pant legs flapping in the gusts, faced down the elements and charged into a three-way tie for the lead of the P.G.A. Championship on Friday.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/sports/pga-1/pga-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 359, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/11/sports/pga-1/pga-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 359}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/sports/pga-1/pga-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/sports/pga-1/pga-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1334, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/sports/pga-1/pga-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/11/sports/pga-1/pga-1-thumbSt