rstein, there was Hart. The lyricist Lorenz Hart collaborated with Richard Rodgers on more than 800 songs and more than two dozen Broadway musicals until just before his death, in 1943.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Exploring a Lyricist and a Brooklyn ‘Bohemia’', 'kicker': 'Bookshelf', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Exploring a Lyricist and a Brooklyn ‘Bohemia’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Block, Frederic', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Marmorstein, Gary', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-11T02:40:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Roberts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roberts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b14191c6-fb9b-51ff-89dd-8a7d36f7794a', 'word_count': 526, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b14191c6-fb9b-51ff-89dd-8a7d36f7794a'}, {'abstract': 'Matt Harvey, still a work in progress for the Mets after their loss against the Braves on Friday, grew up pitching to his father, a longtime baseball coach who got him started early.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/11/sports/baseball/mets-harvey-nurtured-his-promise-at-home.html', 'snippet': 'Matt Harvey, still a work in progress for the Mets after their loss against the Braves on Friday, grew up pitching to his father, a longtime baseball coach who got him started early.', 'lead_paragraph': 'His family had traveled to the city, but so had the rain. So Matt Harvey’s first start in Citi Field was in some doubt before he took the mound at 7:10 Friday night and threw his first pitch for a called strike. By then, the skies had cleared, a nice omen, maybe, for a team that could use one. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/sports/sub-mets/sub-mets-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/11/sports/sub-mets/sub-mets-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/sports/sub-mets/sub-mets-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/sports/sub-mets/sub-mets-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1358, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/sports/sub-mets/sub-mets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/11/sports/sub-mets/sub-mets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/sports/sub-mets/sub-mets-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'To Harvey and His Father, Promise Has Always Been There', 'kicker': 'Braves 4, Mets 0', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Harvey and His Father, Promise Has Always Been There', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harvey, Matt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atlanta Braves', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-11T02:43:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hunter Atkins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hunter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Atkins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/066a5c5b-f934-5246-bc05-8d83192aa296', 'word_count': 1053, 'uri': 'nyt://article/066a5c5b-f934-5246-bc05-8d83192aa296'}, {'abstract': 'The Giants’ ground game, for all of the preseason talk about reinvention, had an up-and-down showing against the Jaguars’ first-team defense during Friday’s preseason game.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/11/sports/football/giants-jets-nfl-football-roundup.html', 'snippet': 'The Giants’ ground game, for all of the preseason talk about reinvention, had an up-and-down showing against the Jaguars’ first-team defense during Friday’s preseason game.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JACKSONVILLE, Fla. — Tom Coughlin is an old-school coach with an old-school mind-set. So it makes sense that his off-season talking point has revolved around the Giants getting back to the basics of running the football better. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/sports/sub-nfl/sub-nfl-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 848, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/sports/sub-