 vice-presidential candidate on Saturday in Norfolk, Va. Several signs suggest Representative Paul D. Ryan of Wisconsin has emerged as the leading candidate for the position.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/11/live-updates-romney-chooses-paul-ryan-as-running-mate/', 'snippet': 'Live coverage of Mitt Romney’s announcement of his vice-presidential candidate on Saturday in Norfolk, Va. Several signs suggest Representative Paul D. Ryan of Wisconsin has emerged as the leading candidate for the position.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mitt Romney introduced Representative Paul D. Ryan of Wisconsin as his running mate Saturday morning in Norfolk, Va., the beginning of their bus tour through battleground states. The Times is providing live updates and analysis.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Live Updates: Romney Chooses Paul Ryan as Running Mate', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-08-11T11:35:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2b277f0d-5970-5ea3-8832-a4752ba93378', 'word_count': 5639, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2b277f0d-5970-5ea3-8832-a4752ba93378'}, {'abstract': 'By choosing Paul Ryan, Mitt Romney has upended a whole host of assumptions about his candidacy.', 'web_url': 'https://bruni.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/11/risky-ryan/', 'snippet': 'By choosing Paul Ryan, Mitt Romney has upended a whole host of assumptions about his candidacy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Until this morning, Mitt Romney was running a campaign of extreme caution, in which he seemed intent on making it as hard as possible for voters—and Democrats—to pin down how he would really govern, which tough choices he’d be prepared to make.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Risky Ryan', 'kicker': 'Frank Bruni', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Paul D Jr', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-11T12:04:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Frank Bruni', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Frank', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bruni', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/55ead125-6ac0-528f-9e38-89755b548eb4', 'word_count': 712, 'uri': 'nyt://article/55ead125-6ac0-528f-9e38-89755b548eb4'}, {'abstract': 'Mitt Romney responded to a question about hunting while campaigning in April of 2007. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/multimedia/100000001716495/mitt-romney-on-hunting-in-2007.html', 'snippet': 'Mitt Romney responded to a question about hunting while campaigning in April of 2007. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mitt Romney responded to a question about hunting while campaigning in April of 2007. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/multimedia/video-romney-varmints/video-romney-varmints-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/11/multimedia/video-romney-varmints/video-romney-varmints-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/11/multimedia/video-romney-varmints/video-romne