ract': 'Billy Hamilton, a shortstop, could give first-place Cincinnati an extraordinary pinch-running threat in a playoff series.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/11/reds-prospect-speeds-up-the-stolen-bases-ladder/', 'snippet': 'Billy Hamilton, a shortstop, could give first-place Cincinnati an extraordinary pinch-running threat in a playoff series.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In May, when the Cincinnati Reds prospect Billy Hamilton was starting his mission to steal as many bases as possible, Hamilton said the single-season major league record of 130, set by Rickey Henderson in 1982, was “always breakable.”', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Reds Prospect Speeds Up the Stolen Bases Ladder', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Extra Bases: Speeding Up the Ladder', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hamilton, Billy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cincinnati Reds', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-11T15:24:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tyler Kepner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tyler', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kepner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cb916f7e-2305-50ec-86dc-18a62e16887d', 'word_count': 107, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cb916f7e-2305-50ec-86dc-18a62e16887d'}, {'abstract': 'To date, Mitt Romney has been criticized for a lack of detail in his plan to reduce the nation’s debt. Tapping the architect of the House Republican budget plan changes that.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/12/us/politics/ryan-and-his-budget-are-a-gamble-for-romne