. He was my first role model when it came to working hard. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/business/0812SBNTHEBOSS/0812SBNTHEBOSS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 790, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/business/0812SBNTHEBOSS/0812SBNTHEBOSS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1579, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/business/0812SBNTHEBOSS/0812SBNTHEBOSS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/12/business/0812SBNTHEBOSS/0812SBNTHEBOSS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/12/business/0812SBNTHEBOSS/0812SBNTHEBOSS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Trail to the Top', 'kicker': 'The Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Trail to the Top', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Careers and Professions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Backcountry.com Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Executives and Management (Theory)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Layfield, Jill', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-11T20:47:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Job Market', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jill Layfield', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Layfield', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/84131afa-3e58-57f7-994e-7611672b1fe5', 'word_count': 635, 'uri': 'nyt://article/84131afa-3e58-57f7-994e-7611672b1fe5'}, {'abstract': 'After providing NBC’s Olympic broadcasts with high ratings for his races, Michael Phelps will get help from the Golf Channel, a part of the NBC Sports Group, as the latest celebrity to appear on the swing coach Hank Haney’s “Haney Project.”', 'web_url': 'https://london2012.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/11/after-medal-haul-phelps-plans-to-work-on-his-golf-game/', 'snippet': 'After providing NBC’s Olympic broadcasts with high ratings for his races, Michael Phelps will get help from the Golf Channel, a part of the NBC Sports Group, as the latest celebrity to appear on the swing coach Hank Haney’s “Haney Project.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'After 22 Olympic medals, 18 of them gold, Michael Phelps has a new goal: improve his golf game. And after providing NBC’s Olympic broadcasts with high ratings for his races, Phelps will get help from the Golf Channel, a part of the NBC Sports Group, as the latest celebrity to appear on the swing coach Hank Haney’s “Haney Project.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Medal Haul, Phelps Plans to Work on His Golf Game', 'kicker': '2012 London Olympics', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Swimming', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Haney, Hank', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Phelps, Michael', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-