ars” of income tax returns from potential running mates – suggesting that Paul Ryan had produced tax returns for a greater number of years than Mr. Romney.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/12/romney-team-hints-at-more-openness-on-ryans-tax-records/', 'snippet': 'A top aide to Mitt Romney said that the campaign obtained “several years” of income tax returns from potential running mates – suggesting that Paul Ryan had produced tax returns for a greater number of years than Mr. Romney.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DULLES, Va. — A top aide to Mitt Romney said that the campaign had obtained “several years” of income tax returns from potential running mates – suggesting that Representative Paul D. Ryan had produced tax returns for a greater number of years than Mr. Romney has in his run for the White House.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney Team Hints at More Openness on Ryan’s Tax Records', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Tax', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Myers, Beth', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Paul D Jr', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-12T05:28:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Barbaro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barbaro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d6643874-d636-57af-a700-67be494187af', 'word_count': 285, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d6643874-d636-57af-a700-67be494187af