': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/7a7c2f17-26a3-5a4c-bd61-ff19b399e2ab', 'word_count': 621, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7a7c2f17-26a3-5a4c-bd61-ff19b399e2ab'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Naughton was a writer, mentor and irrepressible prankster whose career took him to The New York Times, The Philadelphia Inquirer and a leading journalism institute.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/13/us/james-m-naughton-reporter-and-editor-dies-at-73.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Naughton was a writer, mentor and irrepressible prankster whose career took him to The New York Times, The Philadelphia Inquirer and a leading journalism institute.', 'lead_paragraph': 'James M. Naughton, a prank-loving White House and national correspondent for The New York Times during the Nixon, Ford and Carter administrations and later a senior editor at The Philadelphia Inquirer for almost two decades, died on Saturday at his home in St. Petersburg, Fla. He would have been 74 on Monday. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/13/us/sub-naughton-obit/sub-naughton-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 709, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/13/us/sub-naughton-obit/sub-naughton-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1419, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/13/us/sub-naughton-obit/sub-naughton-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/13/us/sub-naughton-obit/sub-