ons with Iran.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/13/world/middleeast/time-to-call-diplomatic-effort-on-iran-a-failure-israeli-official-says.html', 'snippet': 'Amid reports that Israel is close to ordering a strike against Iran’s nuclear program, its deputy foreign minister sought a declaration from countries in negotiations with Iran.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — Amid intensifying Israeli news reports saying that Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu is close to ordering a military strike against Iran’s nuclear program, his deputy foreign minister called Sunday for an international declaration that the diplomatic effort to halt Tehran’s enrichment of uranium is dead.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Israeli Minister Asks Nations to Say Iran Talks Have Failed', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Israeli Official Calls for Declaration That Diplomacy on Iran Has Failed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Netanyahu, Benjamin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Uranium', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tehran (Iran)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-12T23:34:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jodi Rudoren', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jodi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rudoren', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a2d3ddd3-a65d-5097-8527-8ddc1485e26d', 'word_count': 682, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a2d3ddd3-a65d-5097-8527-8ddc1485e26d'}, {'abstract': 'Mike Feller, New York City’s chief naturalist, ventures into Alley Pond Park in Queens at night looking for creatures like slugs, spiders, moths and beetles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/13/nyregion/in-alley-pond-park-in-queens-the-lure-of-nocturnal-creatures.html', 'snippet': 'Mike Feller, New York City’s chief naturalist, ventures into Alley Pond Park in Queens at night looking for creatures like slugs, spiders, moths and beetles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mike Feller directed his headlamp toward a fallen log. A dot of green beamed back, the telltale eyeshine. It was coming from a fishing spider, an arachnid known for its multiple eyes, considerable girth (two inches in diameter) and speed of movement.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/13/nyregion/SUMMERNIGHTS/SUMMERNIGHTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/13/nyregion/SUMMERNIGHTS/SUMMERNIGHTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/13/nyregion/SUMMERNIGHTS/SUMMERNIGHTS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 649, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/13/nyregion/SUMMERNIGHTS/SUMMERNIGHTS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1299, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/13/nyregion/SUMMERNIGHTS/SUMMERNIGHTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'heigh