 'uri': 'nyt://article/2e1a8182-8c84-5ce2-abdc-c6d0940fc21b'}, {'abstract': 'Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg plans to visit Chicago and Boston, the respective homes of the Obama and Romney campaigns, to press for an overhaul of immigration policies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/13/nyregion/bloomberg-to-press-obama-and-romney-campaigns-on-immigration.html', 'snippet': 'Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg plans to visit Chicago and Boston, the respective homes of the Obama and Romney campaigns, to press for an overhaul of immigration policies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg wants the presidential candidates to talk more about immigration policy. So on Tuesday, he will be visiting the cities where their campaigns have headquarters, pressing them on the issue. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In ’12 Race, Mayor Seeks Immigration Discussion', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In ’12 Race, Mayor Seeks Immigration Discussion', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreign Workers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chicago (Ill)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Boston (Mass)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-12T23:38:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taylor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': N