orted', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/8ba76687-5ffb-59db-b021-c7b570f11b39', 'word_count': 625, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8ba76687-5ffb-59db-b021-c7b570f11b39'}, {'abstract': 'Mike Baxter missed nearly two months after crashing into the wall during Johan Santana’s no-hitter, but the glow of making a catch for the ages hasn’t worn off.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/12/again-backing-santana-a-met-reaffirms-his-painful-decision/', 'snippet': 'Mike Baxter missed nearly two months after crashing into the wall during Johan Santana’s no-hitter, but the glow of making a catch for the ages hasn’t worn off.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As Johan Santana delivered the first few pitches of his start against the Atlanta Braves on Saturday night, the Mets’ Mike Baxter momentarily felt an eerie familiarity and smiled to himself.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Again Backing Santana, a Met Reaffirms His Painful Decision', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baxter, Mike', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-13T01:13:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zach Schonbrun', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zach', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schonbrun', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bde9e987-d230-5945-a60a-49a253e8cfdb', 'word_count': 748, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bde9e987-d230-5945-a60a-49a253e8cfdb'}, {'abstract': 'Rory McIlroy led the final round of the P.G.A. Championship from start to finish, crushing an elite field to win by eight strokes — the largest margin in the tournament’s 94-year history.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/13/sports/golf/mcilroy-wins-pga-dominating-another-major.html', 'snippet': 'Rory McIlroy led the final round of the P.G.A. Championship from start to finish, crushing an elite field to win by eight strokes — the largest margin in the tournament’s 94-year history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KIAWAH ISLAND, S.C. — The birth of a champion, and maybe golf’s next dominant player, was dispiriting, humiliating defeat. Put Rory McIlroy back in the woods of the 10th hole at the 2011 Masters as he whacked his ball from tree to tree, a boy lost in the forest on his way to a mortifying fall from the summit of the leader board. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/13/sports/golf/13golf-2/13golf-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/13/sports/golf/13golf-2/13golf-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/13/sports/golf/13golf-2/13golf-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 743, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/13/sports/golf/13golf-2/13golf-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1485, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/13/sports/golf/13golf-2/13golf-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legac