gin in the fall.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/13/consumer-reports-receives-2-million-grant-for-food-safety-study/', 'snippet': 'The magazine has received a Pew Charitable Trusts grant for an ambitious study of the safety of meat, poultry and other food items that will begin in the fall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Consumer Reports, the product-testing magazine, has received a $2 million grant from The Pew Charitable Trusts to engage in an ambitious two-year study of the safety of meat, poultry and other food items.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Consumer Reports Receives $2 Million Grant for Food Safety Study', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-08-13T12:00:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Glenn Collins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Glenn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Collins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/63484aed-f889-52c3-8f8c-91cf92995b06', 'word_count': 301, 'uri': 'nyt://article/63484aed-f889-52c3-8f8c-91cf92995b06'}, {'abstract': 'A summary of what’s on today’s editorial page.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/13/opinion-report-paul-ryan/', 'snippet': 'A summary of what’s on today’s editorial page.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From the editorial page', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Opinion Report: Paul Ryan', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-08-13T12:09:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Rosenthal', 'person': [{'firstname