1e659f-2448-51b6-b8ba-0d0d961a352d'}, {'abstract': 'Researchers have tried for over a year to track down FinFisher, an elusive spyware product manufactured by the Gamma Group, a British surveillance firm. After a big break last month, the spyware is popping up across the globe, from Australia to Qatar to the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/13/elusive-finspy-spyware-pops-up-in-10-countries/', 'snippet': 'Researchers have tried for over a year to track down FinFisher, an elusive spyware product manufactured by the Gamma Group, a British surveillance firm. After a big break last month, the spyware is popping up across the globe, from Australia to Qa...', 'lead_paragraph': ' It is one of the more elusive commercial cyberespionage tools available. It is marketed as a way for governments to spy on criminals. And for over a year, virus hunters unsuccessfully tried to track it down. Now it is popping up across the globe, from Qatar to an Amazon server in the United States.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/14/technology/14bits/14bits-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 225, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/14/technology/14bits/14bits-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 225}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/14/technology/14bits/14bits-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 260, 'width': 692, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/14/technology/14bits/14bits-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 260, 'width': 692, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Elusive FinSpy Spyware Pops Up in 10 Countries', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'con