avel search results.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Google Plans to Buy Frommer’s Travel Guides', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Google Says It Will Buy Frommer’s For Content', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Frommer's", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'John Wiley & Sons', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-13T16:15:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Claire Cain Miller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Claire', 'middlename': 'Cain', 'lastname': 'Miller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/99ec16cc-c6ed-55c9-8c5f-bec320b26e4d', 'word_count': 983, 'uri': 'nyt://article/99ec16cc-c6ed-55c9-8c5f-bec320b26e4d'}, {'abstract': 'When a recipe calls for more egg whites than yolks, don’t just throw away the surplus.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/13/what-should-i-do-with-extra-yolks/', 'snippet': 'When a recipe calls for more egg whites than yolks, don’t just throw away the surplus.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My column this week gives a recipe for floating island that uses eight egg whites and four egg yolks, which brings us to the question, so what should I do with the extra yolks? ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What Should I Do With Extra Yolks?', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '201