spensions on the police cruisers may fail, G.M. said, while Mercedes said certain floor mats may interfere with the operation of the gas pedal on ML Class sport utility vehicles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'General Motors is recalling about 36,000 Chevrolet Impala police cruisers because of a suspension failure that could cause a driver to lose control. In a separate action, Mercedes-Benz is recalling almost 8,700 accessory floor mats because the gas pedal, when fully depressed, may be caught and held in place by the lip of the mat.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'G.M. Recalls 36,000 Impala Police Cruisers, and Mercedes-Benz Will Replace 8,700 Floor Mats', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Safety Features and Defects', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chevrolet Division of General Motors Corp', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'General Motors', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mercedes-Benz', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Highway Traffic Safety Administration', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-13T19:43:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher Jensen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jensen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5a2fe801-14b1-530c-b853-5ce6760c8755', 'word_count': 398, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5a2fe801-14b1-530c-b853-5ce6760c8755'}, {'abstract': 'Representative Jesse L. Jackson Jr., Democrat of Illinois, who has been absent from Congress since