, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/727783fa-0059-5223-a1e9-c8365f9760e8', 'word_count': 1334, 'uri': 'nyt://article/727783fa-0059-5223-a1e9-c8365f9760e8'}, {'abstract': 'Florida is emerging as a test of the Republican Party’s gamble that concerns over the deficit will trump voters’ worries about Paul D. Ryan’s proposed Medicare overhaul.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/14/us/politics/medicare-rises-as-voters-issue-in-gamble-by-the-gop.html', 'snippet': 'Florida is emerging as a test of the Republican Party’s gamble that concerns over the deficit will trump voters’ worries about Paul D. Ryan’s proposed Medicare overhaul.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TAMPA, Fla. — With Mitt Romney’s selection of Representative Paul D. Ryan as his running mate, Florida quickly emerged on Monday as a critical test of the nationwide Republican gamble that concerns over the mounting federal debt can blunt potent Democratic attacks on conservative proposals to revamp Medicare. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/14/us/sub-14florida/sub-14florida-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/14/us/sub-14florida/sub-14florida-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Medicare Rises as Prime Election Issue', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': "Medicare Rises As Voters' Issue In G.O.P. Gamble", 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elderly', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicare', 'rank': 2,