r, helped by a grand slam by Nick Swisher two batters later.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/14/sports/baseball/yankees-defeat-rangers-8-2.html', 'snippet': 'Ichiro Suzuki’s sacrifice bunt kick-started a big inning, as the Yankees scored five runs off Ryan Dempster, helped by a grand slam by Nick Swisher two batters later.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A week ago, Derek Lowe sat on his couch in Cleveland watching baseball highlights on television and wondering when his next chance to pitch would come. And for whom? And what if it doesn’t?', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/14/sports/JPYANKEES/JPYANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/14/sports/JPYANKEES/JPYANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/14/sports/JPYANKEES/JPYANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 714, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/14/sports/JPYANKEES/JPYANKEES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1428, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Lowe Earns Save in Yankees Debut', 'kicker': 'Yankees 8, Rangers 2', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lowe Earns Save in His Yankees Debut', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lowe, Derek', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Texas Rangers', 'rank': 4,