article/452f149d-e149-543b-8064-25b62749bd58', 'word_count': 339, 'uri': 'nyt://article/452f149d-e149-543b-8064-25b62749bd58'}, {'abstract': 'City Room, quick to pounce on errors made in the public sphere, acknowledges when problems are solved.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/14/getting-it-right/', 'snippet': 'City Room, quick to pounce on errors made in the public sphere, acknowledges when problems are solved.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We’re quick enough at City Room to pounce on errors made in the public sphere. We should be equally prompt in acknowledging when problems are solved.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Getting It Right', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Names, Geographical', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-14T13:49:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By David W. Dunlap', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Dunlap', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c1870aec-db9a-5086-8bcc-30eeab28a6c3', 'word_count': 251, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c1870aec-db9a-5086-8bcc-30eeab28a6c3'}, {'abstract': 'Although retailers had better-than-expected sales, the Standard & Poor’s 500-stock index fell for a second day.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/15/business/daily-stock-market-activity.html', 'snippet': 'Although retailers had better-than-expected sales, the Standard & Poor’s 500-stock index fell for a second day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Stocks were mixed in light trading on Tuesday, with the Standard & Poor’s 500-stock index falling for a second day, as a slump in technology and financial shares reversed an earlier rally that followed a report of better-than-expected retail sales.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tech and Financials Slump, Thwarting a Market Rally', 'kicker': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tech and Financials Slump, Thwarting a Market Rally', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-14T13:51:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bloomberg News', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bloomberg', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'News', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f40a3163-9c12-57fe-b76c-168ec6731f9f', 'word_count': 325, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f40a3163-9c12-57fe-b76c-168ec6731f9f'}, {'abstract': 'Catching up on non-Olympic news, sportswriters consider Chad Johnson’s brief Dolphins career, the home run’s comeback and the life of Johnny Pesky, who died at age 92.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/15/sports/dolphins-receiver-chad-johnsons-new-reality-leading-off.html', 'snippet': 'Catching up on non-Olympic news, sportswriters consider Chad Johnson’s brief Dolphins career, the home run’s comeback and the life of Johnny Pesky, who died at age 92.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Perhaps we should thank Chad Johnson for officially welcoming us to football season. Because the N.F.L. cannot really begin until some nonsense involving a past-his-prime receiver reminds us there is no I in team, but there is in “oh geez, not another reality show.” This is possibly now in the N.F.L. rule book. So, Johnson merely stepped up to perform his duty as past-his-prime receiver with the celebrity ego gone off the rails. That he got arrested on domestic violence charges against the woman he just married on reality TV and well, you have the proper absurdity points for a full-fledged fiasco.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Wide Receiver’s New Reality', 'kicker': 'Leading Off', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Chad', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pesky, Johnny', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'DiMaggio, Joe', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Philbin, Joe', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woods, Tiger', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Leftwich, Byron', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-14T13:55:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lynn Zinser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lynn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/39d9dc28-21b4-5dbe-a228-9b1709e714bb', 'word_count': 652, 'uri': 'nyt://article/39d9dc28-21b4-5dbe-a228-9b1709e714bb'}, {'abstract': 'The invasive reptile, whose population is soaring in South Florida, was carrying 87 eggs.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/14/on-our-radar-a-colossal-burmese-python/', 'snippet': 'The invasive reptile, whose population is soaring in South Florida, was carrying 87 eggs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'University of Florida researchers dissect the largest Burmese python ever found in the state, measuring 17 feet, 7 inches and weighing 164 pounds. The snake, an invasive species, was carrying 87 eggs, highlighting the challenge of controlling a population estimated to have grown to tens of thousands of snakes in South Florida. [Ocala.com]', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On Our Radar: A Colossal Burmese Python', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-08-14T14:04:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7320b1b9-c0e7-572f-912a-dfa4e04db4ee', 'word_count': 192, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7320b1b9-c0e7-572f-912a-dfa4e04db4ee'}, {'abstract': 'Bombings and shootings took the lives of at least 43 Afghans on Tuesday. The assaults came as people were thronging shops to prepare for the Muslim holiday that ends the month of Ramadan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/15/world/asia/suicide-attackers-kill-at-least-29-in-afghan-bazaar.html', 'snippet': 'Bombings and shootings took the lives of at least 43 Afghans on Tuesday. The assaults came as people were thronging shops to prepare for the Muslim holiday that ends the month of Ramadan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — Bombings and shootings took the lives of at least 43 Afghans on Tuesday in the deadliest day for civilians this year as insurgents struck while people were preparing for the Muslim holiday that ends the month of Ramadan. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Afghan Attacks Kill Dozens in Deadliest Day for Civilians This Year', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Attacks, Including One Partly Thwarted, Bring Deadliest Day for Afghan Civilians', 'nam