 {'abstract': 'A Bugatti chassis, said by its owner to be the last made by a member of the Bugatti family, will show off its new body at the Quail, the less formal collector-car event on the Monterey peninsula this weekend.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/14/in-monterey-dressing-up-a-bugatti-for-a-dress-down-affair/', 'snippet': 'A Bugatti chassis, said by its owner to be the last made by a member of the Bugatti family, will show off its new body at the Quail, the less formal collector-car event on the Monterey peninsula this weekend.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jean Bugatti incorporated a good deal of advanced engineering into the Type 64 Coupe, the last Bugatti produced by a member of the Franco-Italian clan. But only three Type 64s were built before Bugatti’s death in a testing accident in 1939. The grieving family never completed chassis No. 64002, and it remained without a body for 73 years.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Monterey, Dressing Up a Bugatti for a Dress-Down Affair', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Antique and Classic Cars', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Pebble Beach Concours D'Elegance (Car Show)", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bugatti, Jean', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bugatti Motors', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mullin Automotive Museum', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-14T16:49:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Motavalli', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Motavalli', 'qualifier': No