 at training camp have contributed to the team’s injury problems.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALBANY – Injuries are starting to pile up for the Giants just as the end of\xa0 training camp nears. On Tuesday, the team listed four defensive linemen with injuries: Marvin Austin (back), Chris Canty (knee), Martin Parker (back) and Shaun Rogers (leg).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mounting Injuries Trouble Giants; Are Beds to Blame?', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rogers, Shaun', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALBANY (NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-14T18:15:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taylor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f653cd0c-007b-5255-9e13-3300f9a32a75', 'word_count': 489, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f653cd0c-007b-5255-9e13-3300f9a32a75'}, {'abstract': 'Julia Child was born 100 years ago Wednesday, and many home cooks still have a recipe or two that, unlike her cassoulet, come together quickly and will always be a part of their repertory.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/15/dining/the-julia-child-recipes-home-cooks-still-make.html', 'snippet': 'Julia Child was born 100 years ago Wednesday, and many home cooks still have a recipe or two that, unlike her cassoulet, come together quickly and will always be a part of their repertory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHEN aspiring young food writers ask how I learned the trade — Was culinary school the first step? A journalism degree? Apprenticeship in a three-star kitchen in France? — I brace myself to disappoint them. I didn’t do any of those (extremely practical and admirable) things.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/dining/15MYFAVORITE/15MYFAVORITE-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/15/dining/15MYFAVORITE/15MYFAVORITE-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/dining/15MYFAVORITE/15MYFAVORITE-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/dining/15MYFAVORITE/15MYFAVORITE-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/dining/15MYFAVORITE/15MYFAVORITE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/15/dining/15MYFAVORITE/15MYFAVORITE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/dining/15MYFAVORITE/15MYFAVORITE-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Gifts She Gave', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Gifts She Gave', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Child, Julia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Mastering the Art of French Cooking (Book)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-14T18:22:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julia Moskin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moskin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/45875164-2a7c-5128-beb8-2269e2c247d7', 'word_count': 1480, 'uri': 'nyt://article/45875164-2a7c-5128-beb8-2269e2c247d7'}, {'abstract': 'For Julia Child, the sharing of food with family and friends was as important as the making of it, Jacques Pépin says.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/15/dining/jacques-pepin-recalls-friendship-with-julia-child.html', 'snippet': 'For Julia Child, the sharing of food with family and friends was as important as the making of it, Jacques Pépin says.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I TOLD Helen that I thought the manuscript was really good. In fact, it was the type of cookbook that I thought I would have written someday, and I was slightly jealous of it.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/14/dining/14julia_cnd/14julia_cnd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 739, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credi