y-fire-near-dekalb-station-in-brooklyn-causes-delays/', 'snippet': 'UPDATE 6:45 P.M.: Burning cables north of the Dekalb station are causing delays and reroutings. Transit officials recommend using the numbered lines where possible.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Update, 6:45 p.m. | A fire in the subway tunnel north of the Dekalb Avenue station in Brooklyn is wreaking late-afternoon havoc on lettered train lines, causing an ever-changing series of delays and reroutings, the Metropolitan Transportation Authority said. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Subway Fire Near Dekalb Station in Brooklyn Causes Delays', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Delays (Transportation)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Subways', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-14T21:02:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andy Newman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Newman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8452d7a0-60af-5b8b-80ff-4b90282a8d20', 'word_count': 292, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8452d7a0-60af-5b8b-80ff-4b90282a8d20'}, {'abstract': 'The French will sponsor several food festivals in New York in September.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/15/dining/several-french-food-festivals-benefits-and-other-events-dining-calendar.html', 'snippet': 'The French will sponsor several food festivals in New York in September.', 'lead_paragraph': 'So Very French', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': Non