e/b368f692-884c-556f-a371-364f1d4e9544'}, {'abstract': 'The truth is, no one really knows exactly how — or why — the right-field foul pole in Fenway Park came to be known as the Pesky Pole.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/15/sports/baseball/tall-tale-origin-of-the-pesky-pole-feeds-red-sox-lore.html', 'snippet': 'The truth is, no one really knows exactly how — or why — the right-field foul pole in Fenway Park came to be known as the Pesky Pole.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The truth is, no one really knows exactly how — or why — the right-field foul pole in Fenway Park came to be known as the Pesky Pole. The truth, too, is that no one was really giving the subject that much thought until Johnny Pesky died on Monday at age 92 after seven decades with the Boston Red Sox as a player, manager, coach, broadcaster and beloved baseball ambassador.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/sports/YjpPESKY/YjpPESKY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 889, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/sports/YjpPESKY/YjpPESKY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1779, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tall Tale: Origin of the Pesky Pole Feeds Red Sox Lore', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tall Tale', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fenway Park (Boston)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boston Red Sox', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Parnell, Mel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pesky, Johnny', 'rank': 5, 'major':