n what prosecutors describe as a case of mistaken identity.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/15/nyregion/young-college-graduate-killed-in-harlem.html', 'snippet': 'Despite his mother’s efforts, Matt Shaw, 21, who planned to attend graduate school in the fall, was killed on July 4 in what prosecutors describe as a case of mistaken identity.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Paula Shaw-Leary had every reason to believe that the seven children she raised in Harlem were finally clear of the street violence that had worried her for years.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/nyregion/SHOT/SHOT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 808, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/nyregion/SHOT/SHOT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1617, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mother’s Precautions Finally Fail, 2 Blocks From Home', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mother’s Precautions Finally Fail, 2 Blocks From Home', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'East Harlem (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kelly, Raymond W', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shaw-Leary, Paula', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shaw, Matt', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-15T01:37:34+000