pad-apps/', 'snippet': 'Pinterest, the social networking service where people “pin” content from around the Web on a virtual board, released versions of its mobile app for Android devices and the iPad.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Pinterest, the social networking service where people “pin” content from around the Web on a virtual board, said on Tuesday that it was releasing versions of its mobile app for Android devices and the iPad.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pinterest Rolls Out Android and iPad Apps', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pinterest', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-15T04:18:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian X. Chen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': 'X.', 'lastname': 'Chen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a3add4f3-d0dc-596b-a4f6-bc17091828e4', 'word_count': 186, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a3add4f3-d0dc-596b-a4f6-bc17091828e4'}, {'abstract': 'A man who killed a constable and a passerby near Texas A&M University campus posted names of snipers and pictures of assault rifles on his Facebook page.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/15/us/texas-am-gunman-wrote-of-snipers-who-were-inspirational.html', 'snippet': 'A man who killed a constable and a passerby near Texas A&M University campus posted names of snipers and pictures of assault rifles on his Facebook page.', 'lead_paragraph': 'COLLEGE STATION, Tex. — On his Facebook page, Thomas Caffall posted a list of “inspirational people.” One was Carlos Hathcock, one of the most famous snipers in the United States Marine Corps who recorded 93 confirmed kills during the Vietnam War. Another was Vasily Zaytsev, a Russian sniper during World War II who was known for his skills with the Mosin-Nagant rifle.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/us/SHOOTING-1/SHOOTING-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/15/us/SHOOTING-1/SHOOTING-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/us/SHOOTING-1/SHOOTING-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 755, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/us/SHOOTING-1/SHOOTING-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1509, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/us/SHOOTING-1/SHOOTING-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/15/us/SHOOTING-1/SHOOTING-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/us/SHOOTING-1/SHOOTING-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Gunman in Texas Wrote of ‘Inspirational’ Snipers and of Buying a Gun', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gunman in Texas Wrote of ‘Inspirational’ Snipers and of Buying a Gun', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Caffall, Thomas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Texas A&M University', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'College Station (Tex)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-15T04:21:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Manny Fernandez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Manny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fernandez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fb684021-891b-5c25-9e92-8baf38d38523', 'word_count': 758, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fb684021-891b-5c25-9e92-8baf38d38523'}, {'abstract': 'Tommy G. Thompson, a former governor, defeated three fellow conservatives in a statewide primary that splintered the Tea Party vote.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/15/us/politics/tommy-thompson-wins-gop-senate-primary-in-wisconsin.html', 'snippet': 'Tommy G. Thompson, a former governor, defeated three fellow conservatives in a statewide primary that splintered the Tea Party vote.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WAUKESHA, Wis. — In the final week of his primary campaign, Tommy G. Thompson, the 70-year-old former governor of Wisconsin, performed 50 push-ups for a local newspaper editorial board to prove he was spry enough for the Senate post he is seeking. He has barnstormed the state for months, visiting with voters and raking in high-profile endorsements for a candidacy that, once presumed dominant, had increasingly felt the encroachment of younger challengers for the Republican nomination.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/us/15wisconsin/15wisconsin-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/15/us/15wisconsin/15wisconsin-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/us/15wisconsin/15wisconsin-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/us/15wisconsin/15wisconsin-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/us/15wisconsin/15wisconsin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/15/us/15wisconsin/15wisconsin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/15/us/15wisconsin/15wisconsin-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Thompson Wins G.O.P. Senate Race in Wisconsin', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Thompson Wins G.O.P. Senate Race In Wisconsin', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thompson, Tommy G', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Wisconsin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baldwin, Tammy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pri