alue': 'Philosophy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-15T11:00:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark de Silva', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'de Silva', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/952dba83-ce69-5d0f-b82c-3164f5558e8b', 'word_count': 386, 'uri': 'nyt://article/952dba83-ce69-5d0f-b82c-3164f5558e8b'}, {'abstract': 'With its acquisition of Getty Images, the private equity firm Carlyle Group has completed 19 deals worth more than $14 billion over the past year.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/08/15/carlyle-in-3-3-billion-deal-for-getty-images/', 'snippet': 'With its acquisition of Getty Images, the private equity firm Carlyle Group has completed 19 deals worth more than $14 billion over the past year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While summer has traditionally been a slow time for deal making, the Carlyle Group has been on a buying spree in recent weeks.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Carlyle Group Continues an Unusually Busy Summer', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Private Equity Firm Continues Its Busy Summer for Deals', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Private Equity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Carlyle Group LP', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Getty Images', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'HELLMAN & FRIEDMAN', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-15T11:12:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day'