-convicted-of-murder-in-five-deaths-from-2003-wildfire.html', 'snippet': 'Rickie Lee Fowler, 30, intentionally set a fire in Waterman Canyon in the foothills above San Bernardino which burned 91,000 acres and 1,000 homes.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Rickie Lee Fowler, 30, was convicted of murder on Wednesday in the deaths of five men caused by a fire he intentionally set in 2003 in Waterman Canyon in the foothills above San Bernardino. The wildfire burned 91,000 acres and 1,000 homes. Investigators said Mr. Fowler was high on methamphetamine and angry with a friend who had thrown him out of his home. Witnesses reported seeing Mr. Fowler and another man fling a lighted flare into dry brush, the authorities said. Prosecutors said they would seek the death penalty. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'California: Man Convicted of Murder in Five Deaths From 2003 Wildfire', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | West', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'California: Man Convicted of Murder In Five Deaths From 2003 Wildfire', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARSON', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Bernardino County (Calif)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fires and Firefighters', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Forest and Brush Fires', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fowler, Rickie Lee', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T00:06:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ana Facio-Krajcer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ana', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Facio-Krajcer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None},