a-8fd104912653'}, {'abstract': 'America should allow exports of liquefied natural gas but guard against the risks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/opinion/the-case-for-natural-gas-exports.html', 'snippet': 'America should allow exports of liquefied natural gas but guard against the risks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW data released last month signaled a milestone for American energy: natural gas joined coal as the top source of electric power. Gas production has boomed on the back of abundant supplies. That has spurred debates over hydraulic fracturing, a method to extract gas from shale.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Case for Natural Gas Exports', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Case for Natural Gas Exports', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Natural Gas', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Trade Organization', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T01:03:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael A. Levi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'A.', 'lastname': 'Levi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/b7ecc44c-1fe6-55a6-b4a0-f183f2913a23', 'word_count': 655, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b7ecc44c-1fe6-55a6-b4a0-f183f2913a23'}, {'abstract': 'The court that tried Gu Kailai did not even begin to consider the serious legal shortcomings of the case against her.', 'web_url': 'http