did the right thing when he concluded that free tickets from the United States Tennis Association exceeded the state’s gift ban.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/opinion/a-freebie-too-far-for-senator-avella.html', 'snippet': 'State Senator Tony Avella of Queens did the right thing when he concluded that free tickets from the United States Tennis Association exceeded the state’s gift ban.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Most tennis fans can only dream about receiving the kind of thick, cream-colored invitation that State Senator Tony Avella of Queens got recently in the mail. The United States Tennis Association was pleased to invite him and a guest to view this year’s tennis championships, which begin Aug. 27. They could sit in the President’s Suite. They could pick “one session of your choice” during the first week. This is tennis at its best, viewed from the best seats in Arthur Ashe Stadium. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Freebie Too Far', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Freebie Too Far', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Avella, Tony', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics (Institutional)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Conflicts of Interest', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Tennis Assn', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Queens (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T01:22:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/30c23ea0-1fcb-5b1f-9a69-4170eabb10d2', 'word_count': 369, 'uri': 'nyt://article/30c23ea0-1fcb-5b1f-9a69-4170eabb10d2'}, {'abstract': 'Demand for high-yield corporate debt is insatiable, even as analysts warn that the market has become overheated and is ripe for a fall.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/08/15/risk-builds-as-junk-bonds-boom/', 'snippet': 'Demand for high-yield corporate debt is insatiable, even as analysts warn that the market has become overheated and is ripe for a fall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Money market funds pay next to nothing. Interest rates on United States Treasuries are dismal. The volatile stock market has been dead money for more than a decade.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Risk Builds as Junk Bonds Boom', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Junk Bonds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bank of America Corporation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'JPMorgan Chase & Company', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T01:23:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Lattman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lattman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0fb58edc-89e8-52ad-a8e0-c1483eee5aa7', 'word_count': 1178, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0fb58edc-89e8-52ad-a8e0-c1483eee5aa7'}, {'abstract': 'Tom Durkin, the voice of New York racing when the Saratoga meet is in session, pulled out all the stops when he went to watch his trotting colt, Coraggioso, race.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/sports/saratoga-horse-racing-pink-pants-trotters-and-an-entourage.html', 'snippet': 'Tom Durkin, the voice of New York racing when the Saratoga meet is in session, pulled out all the stops when he went to watch his trotting colt, Coraggioso, race.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SARATOGA SPRINGS, N.Y. — Normally on the dark day here, Tom Durkin sleeps late and catches up on bills and errands. It’s the only day off for the voice of New York racing when the Saratoga meet is in session, and Durkin cherishes his alone time and silence.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/16/sports/Y-JP-POSTCARDS/Y-JP-POSTCARDS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/16/sports/Y-JP-POSTCARDS/Y-JP-POSTCARDS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/16/sports/Y-JP-POSTCARDS/Y-JP-POSTCARDS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/16/sports/Y-JP-POSTCARDS/Y-JP-POSTCARDS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/16/sports/Y-JP-POSTCARDS/Y-JP-POSTCARDS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Pink Pants, Trotters and an Entourage', 'kicker': 'Postcard From Saratoga Springs', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pink Pants, Trotters And an Entourage', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keyw