organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5136e568-f2a9-5ef4-af0a-8269bb6e217c', 'word_count': 1244, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5136e568-f2a9-5ef4-af0a-8269bb6e217c'}, {'abstract': 'Freddy Garcia allowed four hits and two runs in six and two-thirds innings as he joined his fellow Yankee pitchers in containing the Rangers offense for the third consecutive night.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/sports/baseball/freddy-garcia-pitches-yankees-past-texas-rangers.html', 'snippet': 'Freddy Garcia allowed four hits and two runs in six and two-thirds innings as he joined his fellow Yankee pitchers in containing the Rangers offense for the third consecutive night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Freddy Garcia started Wednesday’s game facing the unenviable task of following perhaps the best Yankees pitching performance of the season, and he had to wait an additional 105 minutes before he could even attempt to outshine it.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/17/sports/16yankees-1/16yankees-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 885, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/17/sports/16yankees-1/16yankees-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1769, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/17/sports/16yankees-1/16yankees-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/17/sports/16yankees-1/16yankees-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'c