ditor, appeared in court with six other people on Thursday to face hacking charges.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Andy Coulson, the former communications director for Prime Minister David Cameron and a onetime top editor in Rupert Murdoch’s British media outpost, appeared in court with six other people on Thursday to face charges in the long-running hacking scandal.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ex-Aide to Cameron Appears in Court on Hacking Charges', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Britain: 7 Appear in Court in Phone Hacking Case', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'News of the World', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cameron, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'News Corporation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mulcaire, Glenn', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wiretapping and Other Eavesdropping Devices and Methods', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coulson, Andy', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T10:02:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Cowell and John F. Burns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cowell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': 'F.', 'lastname': 'Burns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/489de2b7-00aa-5226-adaf-b5b3788b331f', 'word_count': 695, 'uri': 'nyt://article/489de2b7-00aa-5226-adaf-b5b3788b331f'}, {'abstract': 'Austerity in a depressed economy was always a bad idea.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/slump-and-circumstance/', 'snippet': 'Austerity in a depressed economy was always a bad idea.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The New Statesman had a good idea — it went to 20 British economists who signed a letter back in early 2010 calling for immediate austerity and asked them whether they still supported the Osborne policies now that Britain is in double-dip recession. Only one of those who replied said yes, while nine urged Osborne to reconsider his opposition to stimulus.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Slump And Circumstance', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T10:51:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/53582f02-9ecf-5ed0-b3b9-bf98ad9ba88b', 'word_count': 190, 'uri': 'nyt://article/53582f02-9ecf-5ed0-b3b9-bf98ad9ba88b'}, {'abstract': 'If you are eligible for a certain type of loan, it’s unlikely that you are going to be able to twist a lender’s arm into offering you a better one.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/when-looking-for-a-loan-you-cant-fight-gravity/', 'snippet': 'If you are eligible for a certain type of loan, it’s unlikely that you are going to be able to twist a lender’s arm into offering you a better one.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Getting a loan for your business is not a simple proposition. There are many types of loans, and many criteria that go into evaluating how much you can borrow and what you can expect to pay. There are thousands of lenders to pick from, and each one may have a slightly different proposition to suggest.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'When Looking for a Loan, You Can’t Fight Gravity', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T11:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ami Kassar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ami', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kassar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/61d7286d-7f10-5860-b627-5c9b318c667d', 'word_count': 701, 'uri': 'nyt://article/61d7286d-7f10-5860-b627-5c9b318c667d'}, {'abstract': 'Mastering the charred (and sweet) science of the Argentine chapa.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/19/magazine/how-to-burn-dinner.html', 'snippet': 'Mastering the charred (and sweet) science of the Argentine chapa.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here is a simple, intense late-summer dinner you could cook on a pancake griddle set on the grate above a fire pit in someone’s backyard, as if performing a magic trick. The result is a plate of thick, luscious pork with a deep, burnished crust, redolent of garlic and rosemary, and a sunset of soft, smoky peaches nutty with brown butter. Those with powerful venting systems in their kitchens might try to cook the dish indoors, but the threat of the smoke alarm will loom. There is little poetry to that. For this recipe, endeavor to cook outside, under the sky.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '40', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/19/magazine/19eat/19eat-articleLarge-v3.png', 'height': 489, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/19/magazine/19eat/19eat-articleLarge-v3.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 489}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/19/magazine/19eat/19eat-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 661, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/19/magazine/19eat/19eat-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 930, 'width': 1440, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/19/magazine/19eat/19eat-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/19/magazine/19eat/19eat-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/19/magazine/19eat/19eat-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How to Burn Dinner', 'kicker': 'Eat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How to Burn Dinner', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Meat', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T11:00:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Sifton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sifton', 'qualifier': None, 'titl