eks, Mr. Romney’s campaign has been diverted — often of its own accord — from its singular focus on the economy.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/romney-campaign-diversifies-lines-of-attack/', 'snippet': 'In the last several weeks, Mr. Romney’s campaign has been diverted — often of its own accord — from its singular focus on the economy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For most of the last year, Mitt Romney has stuck to one basic message: President Obama has botched the economy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney’s Message Moves Beyond Jobs', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Advertising', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T12:04:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a62992ab-8023-52a6-8270-176a95cf9250', 'word_count': 926, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a62992ab-8023-52a6-8270-176a95cf9250'}, {'abstract': 'A summary of what’s on today’s editorial page.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/opinion-report-freebies/', 'snippet': 'A summary of what’s on today’s editorial page.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From the editorial page', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Opinion Report: Freebies', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_hea