ewal process are transformed into happiness by a compassionate and witty clerk.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dear Diary: ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Clerk With a Heart', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Metropolitan Diary', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beards and Mustaches', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drivers Licenses', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Department of Motor Vehicles', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Long Island (NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T12:30:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Terence Gordon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Terence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gordon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8747182b-5811-50c8-9d92-40dfa0816592', 'word_count': 223, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8747182b-5811-50c8-9d92-40dfa0816592'}, {'abstract': 'The Tampa Bay Rays have had a perfect game thrown against them in three of the past four seasons.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/four-rays-form-perfect-game-club/', 'snippet': 'The Tampa Bay Rays have had a perfect game thrown against them in three of the past four seasons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The saying goes that you should do one thing and do it better than anyone else. Unfortunately for the Tampa Bay Rays, what the team does best is suffer through perfect games.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Four Rays Form Perfect Game Club', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_