id less than 13 percent of his income in taxes during the past decade, but called the continued focus on his personal tax returns “small-minded” in the face of the nation’s problems.', 'lead_paragraph': '10:22 p.m. | Updated  The revised version of this post is available here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney Says ‘I’ve Paid at Least 13%’ in Taxes in Past Decade', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Ann', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Carolina', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T16:53:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d8c1dd24-2cb8-5492-a60e-5ddbd3017fa6', 'word_count': 1004, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d8c1dd24-2cb8-5492-a60e-5ddbd3017fa6'}, {'abstract': 'Nationally, the share of voters who could decide the election is likely between just 3 percent and 5 percent, polling experts say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/17/us/politics/pursuing-the-elusive-swing-voter.html', 'snippet': 'Nationally, the share of voters who could decide the election is likely between just 3 percent and 5 percent, polling experts say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Curtis Napier, a 52-year-old father of two in Lima, Ohio, belongs to a much-discussed group of Americans that is far