e in their cars, is releasing an iPhone app.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/an-app-to-transport-ride-sharing-to-the-road/', 'snippet': 'Ridejoy, an online service that matches travelers who need rides with drivers who have space in their cars, is releasing an iPhone app.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Users of Ridejoy, the online ride-sharing service, can now take it on the road. The company released an iPhone app today to complement its Web site, which, like a motor version of CouchSurfing, matches travelers who need rides with drivers who have space in their cars.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An App to Transport Ride-Sharing to the Road', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'CAR POOLS', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ridejoy Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T17:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emily Brennan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emily', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brennan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/938b5b23-43ae-569b-a68f-3a264717c8d3', 'word_count': 173, 'uri': 'nyt://article/938b5b23-43ae-569b-a68f-3a264717c8d3'}, {'abstract': 'Videos of top teachers sharing their best practices and strategies in the classroom.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/videos-of-top-teachers-explaining-their-craft/', 'snippet': 'Videos of top teachers sharing their best practices and strategies in the classroom.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Teachers are human, afte