 national security operations–like the raid that killed Bin Laden.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/return-of-the-swift-boat/', 'snippet': 'A new video rebukes the president for “politically capitalizing” on national security operations–like the raid that killed Bin Laden.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In March, Karl Rove wrote an Op-Ed for the Wall Street Journal in which he belittled the president’s decision to order the raid on Osama bin Laden. “Mr. Obama did what virtually any commander in chief would have done in the same situation,” Mr. Rove argued. “For this to be portrayed as the epic achievement of the first term tells you how bare the White House cupboards are.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Return of the Swift Boat', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'bin Laden, Osama', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rove, Karl', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T17:20:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Juliet Lapidos', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Juliet', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lapidos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9fa9fa63-1c98-5539-ac47-229204fa96f8', 'word_count': 419, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9fa9fa63-1c98-5539-ac47-229204fa96f8'}, {'abstract': '“Family Tree,” created by Christopher Guest and Jim Piddock, will star Chris O’Dowd as a 30-year-old man on a journey of personal discovery.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/hbo-orders-comedy-series-family-tree-from-christopher-guest/', 'snippet': '“Family Tree,” created by Christopher Guest and Jim Piddock, will star Chris O’Dowd as a 30-year-old man on a journey of personal discovery.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Has Christopher Guest finally found that rarest of packages to satisfy the implacable Mort Guffman? As Corky St. Clair might put it, a “beautifully wrapped, glossy, sweet-smelling show?” At the very least, Mr. Guest, a writer, director and star of comedies like “This Is Spinal Tap,” “Waiting for Guffman” and “A Mighty Wind,” has hit upon a project that will bring him back to series television.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'HBO Orders Comedy Series ‘Family Tree’ From Christopher Guest', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Return to TV For Christopher Guest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Guest, Christopher', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Home Box Office', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T17:23:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b5a64fae-7385-5fa5-bfe3-64b2fcd040d7', 'word_count': 241, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b5a64fae-7385-5fa5-bfe3-64b2fcd040d7'}, {'abstract': 'George Orwell’s diaries address his interests in politics but also his passion for nature and gardening.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/17/books/diaries-by-george-orwell-edited-by-peter-davison.html', 'snippet': 'George Orwell’s diaries address his interests in politics but also his passion for nature and gardening.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My favorite biographical detail about George Orwell might be that, when he died from tuberculosis in 1950 at the age of 46, hi