ck: an equestrian-inspired, leg-lengthening boot.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/the-daily-shoe-givenchy-2/', 'snippet': 'Today’s pick: an equestrian-inspired, leg-lengthening boot.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jane Herman delivers The Daily Shoe from the Bergdorf Goodman shoe salon in honor of the store’s 111th anniversary. Today’s pick: an equestrian-inspired, leg-lengthening boot from Givenchy. $1,695.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Daily Shoe | Givenchy', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T17:32:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e3811b3b-4a02-576f-b49d-d05fbbb83ef0', 'word_count': 35, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e3811b3b-4a02-576f-b49d-d05fbbb83ef0'}, {'abstract': 'Our second installment of a new feature, in which an English Language Learning specialist suggests activities and Times articles to go with them.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/ideas-for-english-language-learners-recipes-travel-idioms-and-more/', 'snippet': 'Our second installment of a new feature, in which an English Language Learning specialist suggests activities and Times articles to go with them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This summer we’ve started a new monthly feature on The Learning Network called “Ideas for E.L.L.’s.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ideas for English Language Learners | Recipes, Travel, Idioms and More', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'ke