een assigned to protect the judge in Russia presiding over the trial of three members of the all-female protest band Pussy Riot after unspecified threats.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/russia-assigns-bodyguards-to-judge-ahead-of-verdict-in-pussy-riot-trial/', 'snippet': 'Bodyguards have been assigned to protect the judge in Russia presiding over the trial of three members of the all-female protest band Pussy Riot after unspecified threats.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW – Russian authorities announced on Thursday that bodyguards have been assigned to protect the judge presiding over the trial of three members of the all-female protest band Pussy Riot, after unspecified threats. The authorities did not describe the threats to the judge, Marina Syrova, who is expected to announce a verdict and possible jail terms for the women on Friday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Russia Assigns Bodyguards to Judge Ahead of Verdict in Pussy Riot Trial', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of Speech and Expression', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Russian Orthodox Church', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Alyokhina, Maria', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Khodorkovsky, Mikhail B', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCartney, Paul', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Peaches (Musician)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Samutsevich, Yekate