g Zobel’s “Compliance” a fast-food manager confines and searches an employee at the direction of a telephone caller identifying himself as a police officer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Confining extremes of human behavior to a single, drab room, “Compliance,” the squirmy sophomore feature from the writer and director Craig Zobel, is a slow-motion punch to the groin. As such, it’s fitting that one of our first sights is a large “NO” stenciled in the parking lot of a fast-food joint in suburban Ohio: as the film progresses, the word becomes a silent mantra for viewers who can’t quite believe what they’re seeing.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Real-Life Creepiness: Just Following Orders', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Real-Life Creepiness: Just Following Orders', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zobel, R Craig', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Healy, Pat', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dowd, Ann', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Walker, Dreama', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Compliance (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T23:28:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeannette Catsoulis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeannette', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Catsoulis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/f7030149-5fe2-5466-bd6a-b85a5b701535', 'word_count': 429, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f7030149-5fe2-5466-bd6a-b85a5b701535'}, {'abstract': 'Chris Teare, the director of college counseling at Antilles School in St. Thomas, V.I., advises rising seniors to complete their summer reading and start their college applications.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/for-rising-seniors-a-college-checklist-for-august/', 'snippet': 'Chris Teare, the director of college counseling at Antilles School in St. Thomas, V.I., advises rising seniors to complete their summer reading and start their college applications.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For this week’s installment of The Choice on India Ink, we present our Counselor’s Calendar, designed to keep students on track during the college admissions process.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Rising Seniors, a College Checklist for August', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T23:30:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chris Teare', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chris', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Teare', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8f8b2206-02f0-5284-8367-d79f5b496146', 'word_count': 711, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8f8b2206-02f0-5284-8367-d79f5b496146'}, {'abstract': 'On an 86-degree day, the automaker opened a life-size snow globe adjacent to the High Line, complete with skating rink, to promote its new all-wheel-drive system.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/jaguar-hunting-for-traction-in-chelsea-and-beyond/', 'snippet': 'On an 86-degree day, the automaker opened a life-size snow globe adjacent to the High Line, complete with skating rink, to promote its new all-wheel-drive system.', 'lead_paragraph': '“It really all started with the synthetic ice,” David Pryor, standing on a sun-baked patch of pavement adjacent to the High Line, said on Wednesday. Minutes before, the brand vice president for Jaguar North America had overseen a blizzard in a geodesic dome built here, on 10th Avenue between 17th and 18th Streets.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jaguar Hunts for Traction in Chelsea and Beyond', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morgan, Tracy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jaguar Land Rover', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chelsea (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T23:34:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Schultz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schultz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eae03866-9b69-5f82-acfe-1665db8cfe67', 'word_count': 670, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eae03866-9b69-5f82-acfe-1665db8cfe67'}, {'abstract': 'August 16, 2012 - Jay-Z capitalizes on a minor financial investment in the Brooklyn Nets.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/business/100000001726361/jay-zs-blueprint-for-brooklyn.html', 'snippet': 'August 16, 2012 - Jay-Z capitalizes on a minor financial investment in the Brooklyn Nets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'August 16, 2012 - Jay-Z capitalizes on a minor financial investment in the Brooklyn Nets.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/16/business/video-bdl-120816-jayz/video-bdl-120816-jayz-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'x