 manner,” an affidavit said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/17/us/family-research-council-shooting-possibly-driven-by-politics.html', 'snippet': 'A man accused of shooting a guard at the office of a prominent conservative group “has strong opinions with respect to those he believes do not treat homosexuals in a fair manner,” an affidavit said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — A Virginia man charged with shooting a security guard at the headquarters of a prominent conservative organization told the guard “words to the effect of ‘I don’t like your politics,’\xa0” according to an affidavit filed in the case on Thursday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Family Research Council Shooting Possibly Driven by Politics', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Role of Politics Is Seen in Shooting of Guard at the Offices of a Conservative Group', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Washington (DC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Family Research Council', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Corkins, Floyd L II', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hate Crimes', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-16T23:42:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Theo Emery and Michael S. Schmidt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Theo', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Emery', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'S.', 'last