d applications on the company’s platform.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/16/twitter-declares-new-rules-for-developers/', 'snippet': 'On Thursday, Twitter disclosed how it plans to tighten-up rules for developers who build applications on the company’s platform.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The relationship between Twitter and developers who build apps linked to Twitter has been a bit rocky for some time. A year ago, Twitter warned that stricter rules and regulations were coming to people who built apps on the company’s platform.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Twitter Makes New Rules for Developers', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blogs and Blogging (Internet)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-17T00:15:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Bilton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bilton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/39ead912-209d-5c71-8857-274c988350ef', 'word_count': 298, 'uri': 'nyt://article/39ead912-209d-5c71-8857-274c988350ef'}, {'abstract': '“True Wolf,” a documentary by Rob Whitehair, documents the efforts of Bruce Weide and Pat Tucker as caretakers of a female wolf named Koani.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/17/movies/true-wolf-by-rob-whitehair.html', 'snippet': '“True Wolf,” a documentary by Rob Whitehair, documents the efforts of Bruce Weide and Pat Tucker as caretakers of a female wolf named Koani.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Crudely made and frustratingly vague, “True Wolf” documents the extreme efforts of Bruce Weide and Pat Tucker to lead “a wolf-centered life” as caretakers of a female wolf named Koani. Having raised the animal from a pup as part of a 1994 television project, the couple found themselves stuck with a beast that was unable to survive in the wild and that they could not bring themselves to euthanize. Things, you might say, were not thought through.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/17/arts/17RDP_TRUEWOLF_SPAN/17RDP_TRUEWOLF_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 371, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/17/arts/17RDP_TRUEWOLF_SPAN/17RDP_TRUEWOLF_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 371}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/17/arts/17RDP_TRUEWOLF_SPAN/0817TRUEWOLF-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 716, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/17/arts/17RDP_TRUEWOLF_SPAN/0817TRUEWOLF-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1049, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/17/arts/17RDP_TRUEWOLF_SPAN/17RDP_TRUEWOLF_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/17/arts/17RDP_TRUEWOLF_SPAN/17RDP_TRUEWOLF_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/17/arts/17RDP_TRUEWOLF_SPAN/17RDP_TRUEWOLF_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy'