ck, they can spot only three other cabins: two stand among the reeds on islands to either side of theirs, and one, in front, floats in the long, shallow bay known as the Laguna Madre. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/17/us/17TTCabins/17TTCabins-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/17/us/17TTCabins/17TTCabins-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/17/us/17TTCabins/17TTCabins-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 584, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/17/us/17TTCabins/17TTCabins-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1168, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/17/us/17TTCabins/17TTCabins-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/17/us/17TTCabins/17TTCabins-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/17/us/17TTCabins/17TTCabins-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fishing-Retreat Paradises Could Become Pricier', 'kicker': 'The Texas Tribune', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fishing-Retreat Paradises Could Become Pricier', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name