m/2012/08/19/magazine/who-made-that-tube-top.html', 'snippet': 'Plus: Great moments in tube-top history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Elie Tahari arrived in New York in 1971 with less than $100 in his pocket. “I slept in the parks on the benches,” recalls the fashion designer. The son of Iranian refugees who emigrated to Israel and placed him for a time in an orphanage, Tahari hoped to make his fortune at 19 in the United States, “the land of the movies.”', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/19/magazine/19wmt/19wmt-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 608, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/19/magazine/19wmt/19wmt-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 608}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/19/magazine/19wmt/19wmt-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 744, 'width': 669, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/19/magazine/19wmt/19wmt-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 744, 'width': 669, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/19/magazine/19wmt/19wmt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/19/magazine/19wmt/19wmt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/19/magazine/19wmt/19wmt-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': 