icy, since there was an underinsured motorist at the wheel of the car that hit her.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'About Your Underinsured Motorist Policy', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Insurance and Liability', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Progressive Insurance', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-17T19:56:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ron Lieber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ron', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lieber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ab19a03c-9638-5633-886e-d0e5012d9cf5', 'word_count': 207, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ab19a03c-9638-5633-886e-d0e5012d9cf5'}, {'abstract': "Alessandra Stanley, the Times's chief television critic, looks at several cultures from around the world through the prism of their television programming.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/arts/100000001727903/the-tv-watch-saudi-arabia.html', 'snippet': "Alessandra Stanley, the Times's chief television critic, looks at several cultures from around the world through the prism of their television programming.", 'lead_paragraph': "Alessandra Stanley, the Times's chief television critic, looks at several cultures from around the world through the prism of their television programming.", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/19/arts/video-saudi-tv/video-saudi-tv-articleLarge.jpg', '