unt': 556, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8c4dccf1-266a-58f4-aaa0-1e7be60107b7'}, {'abstract': 'He says the president’s rescue plan didn’t help Janesville, Wis.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/17/paul-ryan-and-the-auto-bailout/', 'snippet': 'He says the president’s rescue plan didn’t help Janesville, Wis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At an Ohio campaign stop on Thursday, Paul Ryan ventured into auto-bailout territory. He described a shuttered GM factory in his hometown of Janesville, Wis., and said “I remember President Obama visiting it when he was first running, saying he’ll keep that plant open. One more broken promise.” Later, in an interview with an ABC affiliate, he said the auto rescue “didn’t help Janesville. They shut our plant down.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Paul Ryan and the Auto Bailout', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Paul D Jr', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-17T21:01:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Juliet Lapidos', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Juliet', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lapidos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9c6ef30f-fbb5-50ad-b58f-5e622723e233', 'word_count': 346, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9c6ef30f-fbb5-50ad-b58f-5e622723e233'}, {'abstract': 'Mitt Romney praised fossil fuels, especially coal, while President Obama emphasized the creation of wind power jobs.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/17/on-energy-policy-a-week-of-venus-and-mars/', 'snippet': 'Mitt Romney praised fossil fuels, especially coal, while President Obama emphasized the creation of wind power jobs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Support for green energy is emer