soaring Summer Olympics, the English Premier League is back to reclaim its title as the land’s greatest sporting spectacle.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/18/sports/YSOCCER1/YSOCCER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/18/sports/YSOCCER1/YSOCCER1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/18/sports/YSOCCER1/YSOCCER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/18/sports/YSOCCER1/YSOCCER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/18/sports/YSOCCER1/YSOCCER1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In England’s Premier League, Many Suitors for the Top Spot', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In England’s Premier League, Many Suitors for the Top Spot', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Manchester United (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chelsea (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'English Premier League', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Manchester City (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 5, 'major