ky Cabrera, the most valuable player in last month’s All-Star Game who humbly attributed his success to the Lord. After drug testing, the San Francisco Giants outfielder was forced by league officials to admit this week that banned doses of testosterone also played no small role in his blazing bat speed.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'It’s How You Play the Game', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'It’s How You Play the Game', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Scrabble (Game)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cabrera, Melky', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cheating', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doping (Sports)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-18T02:24:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/4bf70a2a-90a7-58a1-a23c-30d42877795b', 'word_count': 331, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4bf70a2a-90a7-58a1-a23c-30d42877795b'}, {'abstract': 'Homeland Security ordered training for Transportation Security Administration officers who are accused of racially profiling passengers at Boston Logan International Airport.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/18/us/mandatory-class-for-airport-officers-accused-of-profiling.html', 'snippet': 'Homeland Security ordered training for Transportation Security Administration officers who are accused of racially profiling passengers at Boston Logan International Airport.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Transportation Security Administration officers who are in a behavioral detection program designed to