bhouse and placed the game’s lineup card on Derek Jeter’s chair in front of his locker. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/18/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/18/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/18/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/18/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/18/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jeter Hits Home Run, Savoring a Milestone', 'kicker': 'Yankees 6, Red Sox 4', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jeter Hits Home Run, Savoring a Milestone', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boston Red Sox', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jeter, Derek', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-18T02:29:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/73fedb94-5f7f-596a-8317-089bef518886', 'word_count': 863, 'uri': 'nyt://article/73fedb94-5f7f-596a-8317-089bef518886'}, {'abstract': 'When future scholars data-mine the Internet for a digital literature of romance, they are sure to find all of its aspects on Facebook.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/19/nyregion/missed-connections-poetry-on-craigslist.html', 'snippet': 'When future scholars data-mine the Internet for a digital literature of romance, they are sure to find all of its aspects on Facebook.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There will no doubt come a time, in the not-so-distant future, when scholars data-mine Facebook for a digital literature of love. Why not? All of love’s aspects can be found on Facebook: first-date photographs, swooning status updates, jealousy-stirring pokes, the not-quite-terminal “it’s complicated.” Here, meanwhile, are a few poems about Facebook’s role in romance found last week in the Missed Connections section of newyork.craigslist.org. They are printed verbatim, with only line and stanza breaks added; their titles are the subject headings.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Online, Love Blooms and Decays', 'kicker': 'Poetic Connections | Facebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Online, Love Blooms and Decays', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Craigslist', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dating and Courtship', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poetry and Poets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organi