egistration, trailed only by Texas and Mississippi. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Welcome, New York Voters', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Welcome, New York Voters', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voter Registration and Requirements', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-18T02:39:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/bf130483-9595-5890-9809-87c55139d5f0', 'word_count': 375, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bf130483-9595-5890-9809-87c55139d5f0'}, {'abstract': 'Paul Ryan and Mitt Romney are NOT the same person! Yes, yes, yes. I’ve heard all the rumors, too. But let’s get a few things straight.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/18/opinion/collins-political-page-turners.html', 'snippet': 'Paul Ryan and Mitt Romney are NOT the same person! Yes, yes, yes. I’ve heard all the rumors, too. But let’s get a few things straight.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Let’s see if we can clear up a few things.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/gail-collins/gail-collins-articleLarge.png', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/gail-collins/gail-collins-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600