: 'By Elisabeth Rosenthal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabeth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenthal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News Analysis', '_id': 'nyt://article/7006e2f2-aa4e-5f2d-98ad-909e19e76922', 'word_count': 1588, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7006e2f2-aa4e-5f2d-98ad-909e19e76922'}, {'abstract': 'NASA’s “Mohawk Guy” discusses nerds, keeping up with the longer day on Mars and lucky peanuts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/19/opinion/sunday/catching-up-with-bobak-ferdowsi.html', 'snippet': 'NASA’s “Mohawk Guy” discusses nerds, keeping up with the longer day on Mars and lucky peanuts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bobak Ferdowsi is a flight director for NASA’s Mars rover, Curiosity. Widely known as “Mohawk Guy,” he’s become an Internet sensation since Curiosity’s successful landing last week, prompting President Obama to joke that he’s considering getting a mohawk himself.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/19/sunday-review/19download/19download-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 597, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/19/sunday-review/19download/19download-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1195, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/19/sunday-review/19download/19download-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/19/sunday-review/19download/19download-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'