er leading a field-goal drive, Tim Tebow struggled in a loss to the Giants that left the Jets feeling grateful that it’s only preseason.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — Two factors seemed to be in Tim Tebow’s favor before he took his first snap three minutes into the third quarter Saturday. The Giants’ starting defense was out of the game — and so was the Jets’ starting offensive line.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/20/sports/19tebow/19tebow-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 929, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/20/sports/19tebow/19tebow-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1859, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/20/sports/19tebow/19tebow-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/20/sports/19tebow/19tebow-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/20/sports/19tebow/19tebow-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sharp at First, Tebow Does Little Later to Answer Questions', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sharp at First, Tebow Does Little Later to Answer Questions', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tebow, Tim', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'r