f the band guilty of hooliganism. At a recent concert in Moscow Madonna, above, wore a black ski mask and had the punk band’s name scrawled on her back, according to The Associated Press.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Madonna Supports Russian Punk Band', 'kicker': 'Arts, Briefly', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Madonna Supports Russian Punk Band', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Madonna', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pussy Riot', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-19T22:02:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'Compiled by Erik Piepenburg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Piepenburg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/92b31d7b-5486-5d88-8597-78927d7a5fad', 'word_count': 114, 'uri': 'nyt://article/92b31d7b-5486-5d88-8597-78927d7a5fad'}, {'abstract': 'Nicki Minaj canceled her appearances at the V Festival in Britain because of damage to her vocal cords, The Associated Press reported.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/20/arts/music/nicki-minaj-cancels-appearance.html', 'snippet': 'Nicki Minaj canceled her appearances at the V Festival in Britain because of damage to her vocal cords, The Associated Press reported.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nicki Minaj canceled her appearances at the V Festival in Britain because of damage to her vocal cords, The Associated Press reported. A representative for Ms. Minaj said that she had