e trainer for the Hendrick Motorsports pit crew members.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CONCORD, N.C. — With 10 championships and 206 victories in 29 seasons of racing, Hendrick Motorsports is sometimes called the Yankees of Nascar. And now that Hendrick has a Yankees lifer on its staff, it would be hard to argue the point.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/20/sports/YMONAHAN/YMONAHAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 721, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/20/sports/YMONAHAN/YMONAHAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1443, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/20/sports/YMONAHAN/YMONAHAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/20/sports/YMONAHAN/YMONAHAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/20/sports/YMONAHAN/YMONAHAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Yankees Lifer in Nascar Land', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Yankees Lifer In Nascar Land', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Monahan, Gene', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Racing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hendrick Motorsports Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank