i': 'nyt://article/215b8686-b51e-5584-84f2-bf83ca28a3f6'}, {'abstract': 'Credit card collections are riddled with legal problems and consumer abuse. Adequate federal standards need to be set, while regulators should be given the power to impose much needed rules.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/20/opinion/robo-redux.html', 'snippet': 'Credit card collections are riddled with legal problems and consumer abuse. Adequate federal standards need to be set, while regulators should be given the power to impose much needed rules.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Each day in Civil Court in Brooklyn, Judge Noach Dear presides over as many as 100 credit card collection cases, a scene repeated day in and day out in courtrooms across the country. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Robo Redux', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Robo Redux', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit and Debt', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit Cards', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Consumer Protection', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dear, Noach', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collection Agencies', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-20T01:34:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/59113a7a-e972-53aa-861d-62fad743c998', 'word_count': 578, 'uri': 'nyt://article/59113a7a-e972-53aa-861d-62fad743c998'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama’s response to the housing crisis was deliberately subdued, and some economists belie