r the Yankees. He has evolved into a consistent pitcher, allowing four hits and one run in Sunday’s win over the Red Sox.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/20/sports/baseball/hiroki-kuroda-lifts-yankees-over-red-sox.html', 'snippet': 'Hiroki Kuroda was perceived as a back-of-the-rotation commodity for the Yankees. He has evolved into a consistent pitcher, allowing four hits and one run in Sunday’s win over the Red Sox.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The decision by Hiroki Kuroda to sign as a free agent with the Yankees, instead of the Boston Red Sox, was a minor postscript to the story lines for both teams this off-season. Kuroda, now 37, who had pitched five solid but unremarkable seasons for the Los Angeles Dodgers, was perceived as an insurance arm, a back-of-the-rotation commodity. Anything more might be asking too much.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/20/sports/baseball/20yankees-kuroda/20yankees-kuroda-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 917, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/20/sports/baseball/20yankees-kuroda/20yankees-kuroda-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1834, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/20/sports/baseball/20yankees-kuroda/20yankees-kuroda-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/20/sports/baseball/20yankees-kuroda/20yankees-kuroda-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/20/