former top-10 player, Andrea Petkovic has had what any professional athlete would describe as a nightmare season in 2012.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/20/petkovic-hoping-setbacks-will-end-at-u-s-open/', 'snippet': 'A former top-10 player, Andrea Petkovic has had what any professional athlete would describe as a nightmare season in 2012.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW HAVEN — Late on a Sunday morning in New Haven, Andrea Petkovic chats with her fellow German and good friend Anna-Lena Groenefeld. The two laugh, Groenefeld’s eyes glued to her phone. Petkovic is buried into a plush leather couch, the sweat gone from her practice session and a zip-up hoodie keeping her warm.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Petkovic Hoping Setbacks Will End at U.S. Open', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Petkovic, Andrea', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-20T10:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas McCarvel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McCarvel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7cd4e7d4-3ce6-5211-9ab8-826a6b831866', 'word_count': 1004, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7cd4e7d4-3ce6-5211-9ab8-826a6b831866'}, {'abstract': 'Political news from today’s Times, plus a look at the latest happenings in Washington.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/20/the-early-word-hindsight/', 'snippet': 'Political news from today’s Times, plus a look at the latest happen