s.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/20/why-i-still-do-business-with-bank-of-america/', 'snippet': 'Lead Bucks blogger Ann Carrns responds to readers who wonder why she still does business with a big, money-center bank. The reasons include convenience.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Okay, I’ve admitted it: I bank with a big, money-center bank. Specifically, Bank of America.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Why I Still Do Business With Bank of America', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lieber, Ron', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bank of America Corporation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARKANSAS', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-20T17:47:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c6ca0dc9-349c-5438-bc86-c63f851a7005', 'word_count': 826, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c6ca0dc9-349c-5438-bc86-c63f851a7005'}, {'abstract': 'Her show has been searching for that person since Regis Philbin left last winter.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/20/a-date-for-kelly-ripas-new-co-host/', 'snippet': 'Her show has been searching for that person since Regis Philbin left last winter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Inauguration day for Kelly Ripa’s new co-host will be Sept. 4, the producers of her show said Monday, without saying who the co-host would be.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '