nytimes.com/2012/08/20/account-of-a-lynch-in-jerusalem-on-facebook/', 'snippet': 'An eyewitness to the beating of a young Palestinian by Israelis in Jerusalem last week posted an account on Facebook.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As my colleague Isabel Kershner reports, several Israeli teenagers who appeared in court on Monday following their arrest for beating a young Palestinian unconscious expressed little remorse for the attack after a hearing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Account of ‘a Lynch’ in Jerusalem on Facebook', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Assaults', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Jerusalem (Israel)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-20T23:12:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/42d55392-82e5-5403-882e-3f69f2d38b58', 'word_count': 485, 'uri': 'nyt://article/42d55392-82e5-5403-882e-3f69f2d38b58'}, {'abstract': 'The actor, famous for his roles on previous sitcoms as well as his public battle with Parkinson’s disease, will return to television in the fall of 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/20/nbc-will-air-new-michael-j-fox-show/', 'snippet': 'The actor, famous for his roles on previous sitcoms as well as his public battle with Parkinson’s disease, will return to television in the fall of 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': '7:26 p.m. | Updated The NBC network has won the bidding war for a new sitcom starring Michael J. Fox, the actor famous for his roles on “Family Ties” and “Spin City” and for his public battle with Parkinson’s disease.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'NBC Will Broadcast New Michael J. Fox Show', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': "Parkinson's Disease", 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fox, Michael J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Greenblatt, Robert', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sony Corporation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-20T23:17:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3a60dfbf-fcca-5669-8f59-80806d290bbd', 'word_count': 370, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3a60dfbf-fcca-5669-8f59-80806d290bbd'}, {'abstract': 'The comment about rape made by Representative Todd Akin of Missouri shows that he and fellow primary winners are moving ever rightward with the Republican Party.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/21/opinion/new-frontiers-of-extremism-from-the-gop.html', 'snippet': 'The comment about rape made by Representative Todd Akin of Missouri shows that he and fellow primary winners are moving ever rightward with the Republican Party.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Republicans are frantically trying to get Representative Todd Akin to drop out of the United States Senate race in Missouri after his remark about abortion and rape, but not because it was offensive and ignorant. They’re afraid he might lose and cost them a chance at a Senate majority next year. He would surely be replaced by a Republican who sounds more reasonable but holds similarly extreme views on abortion, immigration, gay rights and the role of government because those are the kinds of candidates the party nominates these days in state after state.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Frontiers of Extremism', 'kicker': 'Editorial ', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Frontiers of Extremism', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Akin, Todd', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Missouri', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-20T23:25:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/9581e0ff-67f0-579f-b204-4dfd8c783c2e', 'word_count': 571, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9581e0ff-67f0-579f-b204-4dfd8c783c2e'}, {'abstract': 'Condoleezza Rice has golfed more often since she served as Secretary of State. Now, she is one of the first two female members admitted to Augusta National Golf Club.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/21/sports/golf/condoleezza-rice-joins-augusta-national-golf-club.html', 'snippet': 'Condoleezza Rice has golfed more often since she served as Secretary of State. Now, she is one of the first two female members admitted to Augusta National Golf Club.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Condoleezza Rice has lived a life of firsts: first black woman to be Secretary of State, first black woman to be national security adviser and the first African-American, first woman and youngest person to be provost of Stanford University.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/21/sports/subYRICE/subYRICE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/21/sports/subYRICE/subYRICE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/21/sports/subYRICE/subYRICE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/21/sports/subYRICE/subYRICE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1320, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/21/sports/subYRICE/subYRICE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/21/sports/subYRICE/subYRICE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/21/sports/subYRICE/subYRICE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Avid Golfer Rice Jumps a Barrier Again', 'kicker