d to a St. Louis television station on pregnancy as a result of rape, this was the sequence of events.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/21/us/politics/rep-todd-akin-legitimate-rape-statement-and-reaction.html', 'snippet': 'After Representative Todd Akin, Republican of Missouri, commented to a St. Louis television station on pregnancy as a result of rape, this was the sequence of events.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The sequence of events after Representative Todd Akin, Republican of Missouri, commented to a St. Louis television station on pregnancy as a result of rape.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rep. Todd Akin: The Statement and the Reaction', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Statement And the Reaction', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Missouri', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Akin, Todd', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-21T00:35:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lori Moore', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lori', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moore', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ea88c203-989e-5279-9d1b-e0cf8d0e6233', 'word_count': 583, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea88c203-989e-5279-9d1b-e0cf8d0e6233'}, {'abstract': 'Nine West is starting a Web video channel as the centerpiece of a new multimedia campaign to reinvigorate its brand of trendy, affordable shoes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/21/business/media/nine-west-to-start-online-channel-to-showcase-shoes.html', 'snippet': 'Nine West is starting a Web video channel as the centerpiece of a new multimedia campaign to reinvigorate its brand of trendy, affordable shoes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FASHION brands spend a lot of money and time to place their products in movies, dramas and reality television. Nine West, the mass-market shoe store chain, has decided to cut out the middleman and produce its own media.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/21/business/Adco1/Adco1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 753, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/21/business/Adco1/Adco1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1505, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/21/business/Adco1/Adco1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/21/business/Adco1/Adco1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/21/business/Adco1/Adco1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Channel on the Web Devoted to Shoes, for Those Who Can’t Get Enough', 'kicker': 'Advertising', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Channel on the Web Devoted to Shoes, for Those Who Can’t Get Enough', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shoes and Boots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-21T00:35:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elizabeth Olson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elizabeth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Olson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/059b94e2-c861-5c8a-9020-e0c96e144504', 'word_count': 925, 'uri': 'nyt://article/059b94e2-c861-5c8a-9020-e0c96e144504'}, {'abstract': 'After last year’s lockout, N.F.L. training camps were too condensed to determine whether the new practice rules were helping players, but this year is providing a better snapshot.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/21/sports/football/new-nfl-training-camp-rules-aim-to-reduce-injuries.html', 'snippet': 'After last year’s lockout, N.F.L. training camps were too condensed to determine whether the new practice rules were helping players, but this year is providing a better snapshot.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the Giants co-owner John Mara first told Coach Tom Coughlin last year that the new collective bargaining agreement mandated a day off for players in the first week of training camp, Coughlin was confused. Does that mean they cannot come to meetings, Coughlin asked Mara. No meetings, he was told. A full day off. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/21/sports/football/21camps-training-camp-jets/21camps-training-camp-jets-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 314, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/21/sports/football/21camps-training-camp-jets/21camps-training-camp-jets-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth