'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f0d31e78-d901-5be0-886e-dce3a58a7f6b', 'word_count': 144, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f0d31e78-d901-5be0-886e-dce3a58a7f6b'}, {'abstract': 'Gu Kailai’s death sentence for the murder of a British businessman has been suspended, but she’s headed for a long stretch in prison, most probably at Qincheng, the notorious facility for political prisoners and larcenous officials that some are calling China’s “Club Fed.”', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/21/a-look-inside-chinas-club-fed/', 'snippet': 'Gu Kailai’s death sentence for the murder of a British businessman has been suspended, but she’s headed for a long stretch in prison, most probably at Qincheng, the notorious facility for political prisoners and larcenous officials that some are c...', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — A Chinese court has suspended Gu Kailai’s death sentence for the cyanide murder of a British businessman. But Ms. Gu, the wife of the disgraced Communist Party boss Bo Xilai, is headed for a long stretch in the can, the clink, the hoosegow, the pen, the joint, the slammer, the Big House. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/21/global-home/21rendezvous-prison/21rendezvous-prison-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 552, 'width': 955, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/21/global-home/21rendezvous-prison/21rendezvous-prison-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 552, 'width': 955, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Look Inside China’s ‘Club Fed’', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub