_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/a7be55fe-79a2-5bdc-be4c-01398c818ca5', 'word_count': 173, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a7be55fe-79a2-5bdc-be4c-01398c818ca5'}, {'abstract': 'Previous shows had been telecast from Los Angeles.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/21/grammy-nominations-special-moves-to-nashville/', 'snippet': 'Previous shows had been telecast from Los Angeles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The televised concert to announce nominees for the Grammy Awards will be held in Nashville this year, in a nod to the power of country music within the music industry, the National Academy of Recording Arts and Sciences announced on Tuesday.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Grammy Nominations Special Moves to Nashville', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Grammy Concert Moves to Nashville', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grammy Awards', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Portnow, Neil', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nashville (Tenn)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-21T16:22:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4e80b247-dca5-5452-a9be-2dc3479a35a5', 'word_count': 272, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4e80b247-dca5-5452-a9be-2dc3479a35a5'}, {'abstract': 'For a father with young children, adopting a healthy diet can be hard with cheese and salami, pasta, hot dogs, French fries and Goldfish crackers on the menu.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/22/dining/dads-often-find-it-difficult-to-eat-healthy.html', 'snippet': 'For a father with young children, adopting a healthy diet can be hard with cheese and salami, pasta, hot dogs, French fries and Goldfish crackers on the menu.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THEY sit there, five little pasta shells, nestled in a shallow bath of melted butter and Parmesan: the remains of dinner for my toddler son and daughter. I cannot help myself. I reach over, grab the pink plastic bowl and scoop a bite into my mouth. At that moment, I realize something has gone terribly wrong.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/22/dining/22DAD1_SPAN/22DAD_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/22/dining/22DAD1_SPAN/22DAD_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/22/dining/22DAD1_SPAN/22DAD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/22/dining/22DAD1_SPAN/22DAD-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/22/dining/22DAD1_SPAN/22DAD_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/22/dining/22DAD1_SPAN/22DAD_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 