World Trade Center.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/22/realestate/commercial/the-30-minute-interview-gary-m-rosenberg.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Rosenberg is a founding partner of Rosenberg & Estis, a law firm based in New York that is currently involved in the leasing of One World Trade Center.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mr. Rosenberg, 62, is the founding partner of Rosenberg & Estis, a law firm based in New York that represents real estate developers. The firm has a longstanding relationship with the Durst Organization and has worked on the developer’s projects at Four Times Square and One Bryant Park. It is currently involved in the leasing of One World Trade Center. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/22/business/Interview/Interview-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 675, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/22/business/Interview/Interview-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1995, 'width': 1315, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/22/business/Interview/Interview-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/22/business/Interview/Interview-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/22/business/Interview/Interview-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Gary M. Rosenberg', 'kicker': 'The 30-Minute Interview', 'content_kicker':