 the Panama Canal, which will bring more cargo and more business to Newark.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/22/realestate/commercial/a-650-million-expansion-of-port-newark-spurs-interest-in-its-environs.html', 'snippet': 'Developers say the port may benefit from the expansion of the Panama Canal, which will bring more cargo and more business to Newark.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Newark’s Ironbound district, a developer broke ground last month on a $50 million warehouse without a committed tenant — a bold move and a sign of how much faith there is in the potential for growth in the state’s industrial sector and specifically in its ports. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/22/business/Newark/Newark-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/22/business/Newark/Newark-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/22/business/Newark/Newark-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/22/business/Newark/Newark-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/22/business/Newark/Newark-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A $650 Million Expansion of Port Newark Spurs Interest in Its Environs', 'kicker': 'Square Feet', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_he