nt of Defense has identified 2,084 American service members who have died as a part of the Afghan war and related operations. It confirmed the deaths of the following Americans recently:', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Names of the Dead', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Names of the Dead', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-21T23:24:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'List', '_id': 'nyt://article/71ce6b83-b996-5df4-8f90-33b636e26842', 'word_count': 235, 'uri': 'nyt://article/71ce6b83-b996-5df4-8f90-33b636e26842'}, {'abstract': 'Congressional inaction on trade rules may put American exporters at a disadvantage in the Russian market.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/22/business/with-russia-joining-wto-us-companies-worry-about-losing-business.html', 'snippet': 'Congressional inaction on trade rules may put American exporters at a disadvantage in the Russian market.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — After two decades of negotiations, Russia will finally join the World Trade Organization on Wednesday. The lower trade barriers that come along with membership will open up new opportunities for foreign companies to do business in Russia.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/22/business/TRADE/TRADE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 764, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': '