ial': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a34f6882-d81c-5224-aa0c-042f103adc3b', 'word_count': 218, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a34f6882-d81c-5224-aa0c-042f103adc3b'}, {'abstract': 'Michael Weiner, the executive director of the Major League Players Association, announced that he had started treatment for the tumor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/22/sports/michael-weiner-of-the-major-league-players-association-begins-treatment-for-brain-tumor.html', 'snippet': 'Michael Weiner, the executive director of the Major League Players Association, announced that he had started treatment for the tumor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Michael Weiner, the executive director of the Major League Baseball Players Association, announced Tuesday that he had begun treatment for a brain tumor. Weiner, who plans to continue working, is expected to be treated for at least a month.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/22/sports/baseball/22weiner/22weiner-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 799, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/22/sports/baseball/22weiner/22weiner-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1598, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/22/sports/baseball/22weiner/22weiner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/22/sports/baseball/22weiner/22weiner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/22/sports/baseball/22weiner/22weiner-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150,