ment’s response was poorly planned.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/22/internet-analysts-question-indias-efforts-to-stem-panic/', 'snippet': 'Internet companies say they are helping curb circulation of content that is fueling ethnic tensions, but analysts say the government’s response was poorly planned.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The Indian government’s efforts to stem a weeklong panic among some ethnic minorities has again put it at odds with Internet companies like Google, Facebook and Twitter,” Vikas Bajaj  wrote in The New York Times. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Internet Analysts Question India’s Efforts to Stem Panic', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-08-22T05:54:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By THE NEW YORK TIMES', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a89994a3-75bd-5d1d-b6a7-abb8c28502b9', 'word_count': 216, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a89994a3-75bd-5d1d-b6a7-abb8c28502b9'}, {'abstract': 'A hotel developer plans to build India’s first Western-style ski resort in the Himalayas, but faces resistance from the locals as well as politicians.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/22/american-thwarted-in-quest-to-build-a-ski-resort-in-india/', 'snippet': 'A hotel developer plans to build India’s first Western-style ski resort in the Himalayas, but faces resistance from the locals as well as politicians.', 'lead_paragraph': '“To John Sims, the Himalayas, with some of the finest mountain slopes in the world, seemed like the perfect place to build India’s first Western-style ski resort,” Vikas Bajaj wrote in The New York Times. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'American Thwarted in Quest to Build a Ski Resort in India', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-08-22T06:52:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4016cba6-781f-5396-a8f9-aeba796cc371', 'word_count': 220, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4016cba6-781f-5396-a8f9-aeba796cc371'}, {'abstract': 'Poor infrastructure and resistance from policy makers has impeded the development of skiing destinations in India.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/22/in-the-lap-of-himalayas-luxury-ski-resorts-are-a-distant-dream/', 'snippet': 'Poor infrastructure and resistance from policy makers has impeded the development of skiing destinations in India.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Manali, a hill station in the Kullu Valley of Himachal Pradesh state, has long been seen as a potential hub for skiing in India. Witness the efforts of a group of foreign investors who have been trying to build the Himalayan Ski Village there for nearly a decade.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In the Lap of Himalayas, Luxury Ski Resorts Are a Distant Dream', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-08-22T08:31:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neha Thirani', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Thirani', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e3f3e1f0-812d-56f9-84e6-36b737e9f50b', 'word_count': 1130, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e3f3e1f0-812d-56f9-84e6-36b737e9f50b'}, {'abstract': 'The new heroes within the secular movement are coming from unlikely places — like the pulpit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/26/magazine/from-bible-belt-pastor-to-atheist-leader.html', 'snippet': 'The new heroes within the secular movement are coming from unlikely places — like the pulpit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Late one night in early May 2011, a preacher named Jerry DeWitt was lying in bed in DeRidder, La., when his phone rang. He picked it up and heard an anguished, familiar voice. It was Natosha Davis, a friend and parishioner in a church where DeWitt had preached for more than five years. Her brother had been in a bad motorcycle accident, she said, and he might not survive.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '40', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/26/magazine/26atheist/26atheist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/26/magazine/26atheist/26atheist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/26/magazine/26atheist/26atheist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/26/magazine/26atheist/26atheist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1001, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/26/magazine/26atheist/26atheist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail'