dn’t make the playoffs the previous season. Generally, at least one of those teams had a bad-but-not-awful record – like, say, 6-10 – the year before.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Carolina Panthers, 2012 N.F.L. Season Preview', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Carolina Panthers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-22T10:00:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andy Benoit', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Benoit', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/32111ae5-3f15-53f8-8348-c0d62c647c09', 'word_count': 2722, 'uri': 'nyt://article/32111ae5-3f15-53f8-8348-c0d62c647c09'}, {'abstract': 'The fiberglass-bodied car, which was raced around the Monterey Peninsula in 1953, was awarded a special trophy on Sunday.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/22/the-mameco-ardun-saga-reaches-a-fitting-climax-at-pebble-beach/', 'snippet': 'The fiberglass-bodied car, which was raced around the Monterey Peninsula in 1953, was awarded a special trophy on Sunday.', 'lead_paragraph': '8:22 a.m. | Updated ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Mameco-Ardun Saga Reaches a Fitting Climax at Pebble Beach', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Pebble Beach Concours D'Elegance (Car Show)", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pebble