t easy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/23/technology/personaltech/to-sketch-to-draw-to-create-with-no-pencil-in-sight.html', 'snippet': 'Put away the sketchbook and pencil. Sketching has gone digital, and several apps make it easy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I used to have a habit of carrying around a red Moleskine notebook and, while sipping a beer or a coffee, I’d make little sketches. My drawings were just curiosities, sometimes of the scene or of an interesting person. They were more for fun, to let my creative juices flow, than an attempt at serious art. Often I’d have to borrow a pen from the bar or cafe because carrying a pencil in a jeans pocket wasn’t ideal. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/23/business/23SMART2/23SMART2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 811, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/23/business/23SMART2/23SMART2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1622, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/23/business/23SMART2/23SMART2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/23/business/23SMART2/23SMART2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/23/business/23SMART2/23SMART2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'To Sketch, to Draw, to Create, With No Pencil in Sight', 'kicker': 'App Smart', 'c