ign intelligence services were behind the wave of killings of Western troops by Afghan forces, a statement directly at odds with NATO’s assessment of the crisis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/23/world/asia/afghanistan-blames-spies-for-insider-attacks-on-western-troops.html', 'snippet': 'Afghan officials claimed that foreign intelligence services were behind the wave of killings of Western troops by Afghan forces, a statement directly at odds with NATO’s assessment of the crisis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — Even as the Afghan government said on Wednesday that it would take new measures to counter a wave of deadly insider killings of Western troops by Afghan security forces, President Hamid Karzai’s office asserted for the first time that foreign spy agencies were behind most of the attacks, putting it directly at odds with NATO’s assessment of the crisis.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Afghanistan, Contradicting NATO, Blames Foreign Spies for Insider Attacks', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Afghanistan, Contradicting NATO, Blames Foreign Spies for Insider Attacks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Espionage and Intelligence Services', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'North Atlantic Treaty Organization', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Inter-Services Intelligence', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-22T22:39:26+0000', 'docu