o was fired as president of Penn State, said in a magazine interview that he had no reason to suspect Jerry Sandusky of sexually abusing children.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/23/sports/ncaafootball/lawyers-for-graham-b-spanier-call-claims-in-freeh-report-a-myth.html', 'snippet': 'Graham B. Spanier, who was fired as president of Penn State, said in a magazine interview that he had no reason to suspect Jerry Sandusky of sexually abusing children.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lawyers for the former Penn State president Graham B. Spanier issued a searing rebuttal Wednesday to findings by the former F.B.I. director Louis J. Freeh that Spanier and other top university officials had helped conceal allegations of child abuse involving the former assistant football coach Jerry Sandusky.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spanier’s Lawyers Attack Freeh Findings', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Spanier’s Lawyers Attack Freeh Findings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Freeh, Louis J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spanier, Graham B', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sandusky, Jerry', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schultz, Gary', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pennsylvania State University', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paterno, Joe', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Curley, Tim', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-22T22:40:06+0000', 'do