profiles William Binney, a 32-year veteran of the National Security Agency who helped design a top-secret program he says is broadly collecting Americans’ personal data.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The filmmaker Laura Poitras profiles William Binney, a 32-year veteran of the National Security Agency who helped design a top-secret program he says is broadly collecting Americans’ personal data.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/16/opinion/video-opdoc-nsa/video-opdoc-nsa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/16/opinion/video-opdoc-nsa/video-opdoc-nsa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/16/opinion/video-opdoc-nsa/video-opdoc-nsa-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/16/opinion/video-opdoc-nsa/video-opdoc-nsa-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Program', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surveillance of Citizens by Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Security Agency', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-23T01:08:48+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Opinion', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'Laura Poitras', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Laura', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Poitras', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/ec64aa4a-848f-51f6-806f-70f71a88561c', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/ec64aa4a-848f-51f6-806f-70f71a88561c'}, {'abstract': 'The filmmaker profiles William Binney, a 32-year veteran of the National Security Agency who helped design a top-secret program he says is broadly collecting Americans’ personal data.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/23/opinion/the-national-security-agencys-domestic-spying-program.html', 'snippet': 'The filmmaker profiles William Binney, a 32-year veteran of the National Security Agency who helped design a top-secret program he says is broadly collecting Americans’ personal data.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It took me a few days to work up the nerve to phone William Binney. As someone already a “target” of the United States government, I found it difficult not to worry about the chain of unintended consequences I might unleash by calling Mr. Binney, a 32-year veteran of the National Security Agency turned whistle-blower. He picked up. I nervously explained I was a documentary filmmaker and wanted to speak to him. To my surprise he replied: “I’m tired of my government harassing me and violating the Constitution. Yes, I’ll talk to you.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/16/opinion/video-opdoc-nsa/video-opdoc-nsa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/16/opinion/video-opdoc-nsa/video-opdoc-nsa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/16/opinion/video-opdoc-nsa/video-opdoc-nsa-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/16/opinion/video-opdoc-nsa/video-opdoc-nsa-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'he