, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cb031de8-22ba-5d55-a843-2d653c3921f4'}, {'abstract': 'Sachin Tendulkar stands alone, after many of his peers retire from international cricket.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/23/indias-golden-generation-of-cricket-stars-is-down-to-one/', 'snippet': 'Sachin Tendulkar stands alone, after many of his peers retire from international cricket.', 'lead_paragraph': '“No cricketer in history has been more accustomed than Sachin Tendulkar to playing five-day test matches, ” Huw Richards wrote in The International Herald Tribune.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'India’s Golden Generation of Cricket Stars Is Down to One', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-08-23T05:40:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b5f161f-fe09-57bb-a124-ba5e197227f1', 'word_count': 227, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b5f161f-fe09-57bb-a124-ba5e197227f1'}, {'abstract': 'The decision by Australia’s Qantas Airways, the biggest cancellation for the new 787, reflected a decline in international travel, according to analysts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/24/business/global/qantas-cancels-order-for-boeing-dreamliner-jets.html', 'snippet': 'The decision by Australia’s Qantas Airways, the biggest cancellation for the new 787, reflected a decline in international travel, according to analysts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Boeing lost an order for 35 Dreamliners with a list price of $8.5 billion on Thursday in the biggest cancellation for the 787 jet as Qantas Airways scrapped a contract after delivery delays and losses on international routes.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source'