147cf', 'word_count': 559, 'uri': 'nyt://article/53507e61-bb11-5e09-9b92-fb299c3147cf'}, {'abstract': 'The less time you’ve been in your home, the more likely you’ve accumulated little equity and seen the value of your property fall since 2005.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/23/half-of-homeowners-under-40-are-still-underwater/', 'snippet': 'The less time you’ve been in your home, the more likely you’ve accumulated little equity and seen the value of your property fall since 2005.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The country’s underwater homes are slowly resurfacing as the housing market improves. But younger borrowers are still more likely to be submerged, a new report from real estate site Zillow.com finds.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Half of Homeowners Under 40 Are Still Underwater', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Under 40 and Underwater', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Humphries, Stan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Zillow.com', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-23T15:00:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/68637db2-25e0-5ef2-843d-2782f9d012a1', 'word_count': 378, 'uri': 'nyt://article/68637db2-25e0-5ef2-843d-2782f9d012a1'}, {'abstract': 'A procession marking the end of the Sindhi fasting festival of Jhulelal Chaliha in Ahmedabad, Gujarat.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/23/image-of-the-day-august-23/', 'sni