', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Downes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d0a619a1-2ab6-5eb5-adac-f6078d883e4f', 'word_count': 393, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d0a619a1-2ab6-5eb5-adac-f6078d883e4f'}, {'abstract': 'There are fewer new homes on the market than at any time in decades, and some of those available are not exactly new.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/23/theyre-not-making-any-more-well-almost/', 'snippet': 'There are fewer new homes on the market than at any time in decades, and some of those available are not exactly new.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two facts stand out from Thursday’s report on new home sales in July.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'They’re Not Making Any More (Well, Almost)', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Subprime Mortgage Crisis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Census Bureau', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp (Freddie Mac)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal National Mortgage Assn (Fannie Mae)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-23T17:40:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Floyd Norris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Floyd', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Norris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://articl