wheat beers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/29/dining/whole-wheat-tomato-and-ricotta-tart-recipe.html', 'snippet': 'This tart has a whole-wheat pastry, to echo the wheat beers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'These American wheat beers in the hefeweizen style are bright refreshers designed to sip and enjoy on their own on a summer day, or to pour alongside food that is anything but serious. Beer and grilled hot dogs? Burgers? Pizza? Without question. The last time we trained our palates on this category of suds I devised a pizza paved with ripe tomatoes, Vidalia onions and Stilton. On this revisit I took a longer detour on the way to beer and pizza, making a tomato and ricotta tart for a warm-weather lunch, an early evening bite or a first course at dinner. The whole-wheat pastry pays homage to the beers. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/29/dining/29PAIR_SPAN/29PAIR_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/29/dining/29PAIR_SPAN/29PAIR_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/29/dining/29PAIR_SPAN/29PAIR_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/29/dining/29PAIR_SPAN/29PAIR_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/29/dining/29PAIR_SPAN/29PAIR_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_