non-dissidents by family members and others has become a hot topic.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/23/china-pressed-to-prevent-abuse-of-psychiatric-confinement/', 'snippet': 'While there is virtually no public debate in China on the fate of dissidents in the country’s psychiatric system, involuntary commitment of non-dissidents by family members and others has become a hot topic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — In February 2011, Chen Guoming, 45, a jewelry store owner in southern China’s Fujian Province, was drugged by his wife, tied up with tape and taken to a psychiatric hospital where he was committed as mentally ill.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/24/blogs/24ihtrdv-china-tatlow/24ihtrdv-china-tatlow-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 549, 'width': 869, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/24/blogs/24ihtrdv-china-tatlow/24ihtrdv-china-tatlow-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 549, 'width': 869, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'China Pressed to Prevent  Abuse of Psychiatric Confinement', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'CHINA', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Health and Disorders', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-24T00:00:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Didi Kirsten Tatlow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Didi', 'middlename': 'Kirsten', 'lastname': 'Tatlow', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/32756ef4-2072-513f-aaa5-82cb8b9ad5c5', 'word_count': 723, 'uri': 'nyt://article/32756ef4-2072-513f-aaa5-82cb8b9ad5c5'}, {'abstract': '“Death by China,” a documentary by Peter Navarro, says the admission of China to the World Trade Organization has been catastrophic for the American economy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/24/movies/death-by-china-documentary-directed-by-peter-navarro.html', 'snippet': '“Death by China,” a documentary by Peter Navarro, says the admission of China to the World Trade Organization has been catastrophic for the American economy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'By the end of the alarming and alarmist “Death by China” you may be asking why candidates for public office in this election year are talking about anything other than how to stop the Chinese from wrecking our economy.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/24/arts/24RDP_DEATH_SPAN/24RDP_DEATH_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/24/arts/24RDP_DEATH_SPAN/24RDP_DEATH_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/24/arts/24RDP_DEATH_SPAN/24RDP_DEATH_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/24/arts/24RDP_DEATH_SPAN/24RDP_DEATH_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': '