ools need a new pricing model. Affluent families must donate, as much as they are able, to make up the difference between tuition and the school’s real, per-student cost of operation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/24/opinion/is-private-school-not-expensive-enough.html', 'snippet': 'Private schools need a new pricing model. Affluent families must donate, as much as they are able, to make up the difference between tuition and the school’s real, per-student cost of operation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ANY parent of a private-school child will tell you that tuitions are painfully high — and getting worse every year. Many New York City schools are approaching the $40,000 mark. And it’s not just New York: charges at many private secondary boarding schools are now touching $50,000. Outrageous, many say. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/24/opinion/0824OPEDgainsborough/0824OPEDgainsborough-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 909, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/24/opinion/0824OPEDgainsborough/0824OPEDgainsborough-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 909}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/24/opinion/0824OPEDgainsborough/0824OPEDgainsborough-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 676, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/24/opinion/0824OPEDgainsborough/0824OPEDgainsborough-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1351, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/24/opinion/0824OPEDgainsborough/0824