for now that travelers must continue to remove their footwear, by far the leading source of frustration and delays at the airport. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/24/us/SHOES/SHOES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 738, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/24/us/SHOES/SHOES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1476, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/24/us/SHOES/SHOES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/24/us/SHOES/SHOES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/24/us/SHOES/SHOES-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With Footwear Scanners Failing in Airport Tests, the Shoes Still Have to Come Off', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Footwear Scanners Failing in Airport Tests, the Shoes Still Have to Come Off', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Airport Security', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Scanning Devices', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shoes and Boots', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': '