ds could have been lifted from a recent commercial by President Obama, in which the president presents himself as a defender of the middle class against predatory Republicans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Former President Bill Clinton is not only campaigning for President Obama in his re-election bid. In a new 30-second commercial released on Thursday by the Obama campaign, he is practically channeling him.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/24/us/CAMPAIGN/CAMPAIGN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 288, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/24/us/CAMPAIGN/CAMPAIGN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 288}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/24/us/CAMPAIGN/CAMPAIGN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 491, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/24/us/CAMPAIGN/CAMPAIGN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 982, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'It’s the President’s Message, With President Clinton', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'It’s the President’s Message, With President Clinton', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Advertising', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Bill', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-24T03:02:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name'