'word_count': 798, 'uri': 'nyt://article/00cd742f-0231-5514-bb8d-202063880c35'}, {'abstract': 'The line jumper; the phantom tollbooth.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/26/magazine/impatience-takes-a-number.html', 'snippet': 'The line jumper; the phantom tollbooth.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Returning my cable box at the Time Warner store, I arrived to find 30 people ahead of me in line. Begrudgingly, I took a number (as you do at the deli counter) and waited. A woman turned around and told me she could no longer stay. She offered me her ticket, five numbers away from being called. At first I said no — it wouldn’t be fair to everyone else who was waiting — but she insisted. I took her ticket, returned my cable box and walked out of the store while everyone else kept waiting. Was it right to take the ticket? ALEXANDRA, NEW YORK CITY', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/26/magazine/26ethicist/26ethicist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 402, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/26/magazine/26ethicist/26ethicist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 402, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/26/magazine/26ethicist/26ethicist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/26/magazine/26ethicist/26ethicist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/26/magazine/26ethicist/26ethicist-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'wi