08/25/sports/reaction-to-lance-armstrong-conceding-defeat-leading-off.html', 'snippet': 'Writers reacted to the cyclist Lance Armstrong ending his fight against charges that he used performance-enhancing drugs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The stunning part of Lance Armstrong giving up his fight against doping charges lodged against him by the United States Anti-Doping Agency is not the guilt implicit in the surrender, it is the surrender itself. The guilt part, everyone was ready for. Because by now, it requires supernatural powers of denial to think Armstrong, a seven-time Tour de France champion, could conquer the most drug-soaked sport of them all by being the only clean one.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/sports/cycling/25leading1/25leading1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 688, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/sports/cycling/25leading1/25leading1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1376, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/sports/cycling/25leading1/25leading1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/25/sports/cycling/25leading1/25leading1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/sports/cycling/25leading1/25leading1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Guy Who Would Never Give Up', 'kicker': 'Leading Off', 'content_kicker': N