hink about the players who are not there,” Arsène Wenger insisted after Arsenal’s disappointing opening day draw with Sunderland last weekend. There are those who wish he would cast his mind to those who have left the club since the end of the Invincibles era. It might be enough to force a rethinking of his famed philosophy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wenger Hasn’t Changed, but the Rules Have', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Arsenal (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'English Premier League', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-24T15:11:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Graham Ruthven', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Graham', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ruthven', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dfe7eda4-4051-559e-98c5-0df1673dc435', 'word_count': 805, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dfe7eda4-4051-559e-98c5-0df1673dc435'}, {'abstract': 'The Transportation Department said this week it would award $17.5 million in grants to states that outlaw texting while driving.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/24/wheelies-the-carrot-and-stick-edition/', 'snippet': 'The Transportation Department said this week it would award $17.5 million in grants to states that outlaw texting while driving.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In which we bring you motoring news from around the Web:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wheelies: The Carrot-and-Stick Edition', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 