s of the Tour de France have admitted to using performance-enhancing drugs in their careers or have been officially linked to doping.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2012/08/24/sports/top-finishers-of-the-tour-de-france-tainted-by-doping.html', 'snippet': 'More than a third of the top finishers of the Tour de France have admitted to using performance-enhancing drugs in their careers or have been officially linked to doping.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than a third of the top finishers of the Tour de France have admitted to using performance-enhancing drugs in their careers or have been officially linked to doping.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Top Finishers of the Tour de France Tainted by Doping', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ARMSTRONG, LANCE', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doping (Sports)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Anti-Doping Agency', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Contador, Alberto', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ullrich, Jan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cycling, Road', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-24T17:48:20+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/77c119ac-149a-5e56-a520-38b88471b756', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/77c119ac-149a-5e56-a520-38b88471b756'}, {'abstract': 'When reinvested dividends are included, the performance of the American stock market has returned to the levels of the 2007 peak, outdoing many other markets around the world.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/25/business/economy/american-stock-market-leads-others-in-recovery-from-crisis.html', 'snippet': 'When reinvested dividends are included, the performance of the American stock market has returned to the levels of the 2007 peak, outdoing many other markets around the world.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE American stock market has returned to record territory — at least when dividends are included — but few other stock markets have done so. A survey of the major markets of the world indicates that North America was the best place to be for investors who chose to ride out the credit crisis, while the euro zone was clearly the worst.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Stock Market Leads Most Others in Recovery', 'kicker': 'Off the Charts', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Stock Market Leads Most Others In Recovery', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Subprime Mortgage Crisis', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-24T17:49:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Floyd Norris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Floyd', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Norris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c07dc280-2f1c-5002-b04a-abf81025a512', 'word_count': 641, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c07dc280-2f1c-5002-b04a-abf81025a512'}, {'abstract': 'A couple’s loft is on a block that is among the last remnants of an increasingly shrunken Little Italy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/26/realestate/mulb