o small deals, as well as what they encountered once they were running someone else’s company with their money at stake.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/25/your-money/in-private-equity-profiting-from-small-time-deals-wealth-matters.html', 'snippet': 'What private equity investors expect going into small deals, as well as what they encountered once they were running someone else’s company with their money at stake.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PRIVATE equity investing is getting a lot of attention this presidential season. Now that Mitt Romney, whose fortune came from his private equity work at Bain Capital, is set to accept the Republican presidential nomination next week in Tampa, Fla., the industry will certainly spend the fall in the spotlight. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/your-money/25wealth/25wealth-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/25/your-money/25wealth/25wealth-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/your-money/25wealth/25wealth-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/your-money/25wealth/25wealth-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/your-money/25wealth/25wealth-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/25/your-money/25wealth/25wealth-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/your-money/25wealth/25wealth-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Private Equity, Seeking to Profit From Small-Time Deals', 'kicker': 'Wealth Matters', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Private Equity, Seeking to Profit From Small-Time Deals', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Private Equity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Entrepreneurship', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'High Net Worth Individuals', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-24T18:26:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Sullivan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sullivan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb4ebcf2-fdfb-5881-9cfd-a6fe3383f2b4', 'word_count': 1374, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb4ebcf2-fdfb-5881-9cfd-a6fe3383f2b4'}, {'abstract': 'Created by Peter the Great but closed to the public until last summer, New Holland now draws visitors for everything from art to table tennis to a novel library.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/26/travel/creativity-sprouts-on-a-st-petersburg-island.html', 'snippet': 'Created by Peter the Great but closed to the public until last summer, New Holland now draws visitors for everything from art to table tennis to a novel library.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SHELTERED by a wall covered in colorful murals that depicted a horror-fairy tale with a happy ending, a Russian friend and I sat back in lawn chairs and sipped cappuccinos. To our left was a still pool once used for submarine testing. Behind it stood large, shuttered, morbidly charming brick warehouses. “It’s amazing!” said my friend as he pointed at the row of buildings across the canal, in the midst of St. Petersburg. “All those years, you couldn’t come in here. Now it’s open, and you have a completely new view of the city.”', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/26/travel/26HEADSUP_SPAN/26HEADSUP_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/26/travel/26HEADSUP_SPAN/26HEADSUP_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/26/travel/26HEADSUP_SPAN/26HEADSUP_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/26/travel/26HEADSUP_SPAN/26HEADSUP_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/26/travel/26HEADSUP_SPAN/26HEADSUP_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/26/travel/26HEADSUP_SPAN/26HEADSUP_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/26/travel/26HEADSUP_SPAN/26HEADSUP_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Creativity Sprouts on a St. Petersburg Island', 'kicker': 'Heads Up', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'St. Petersburg’s Island of Hip', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'St Petersburg (Russia)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-24T18:26:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sally McGrane', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sally', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McGrane', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/208161cb-aff6-5f11-b4df-3851211e3fce', 'word_count': 696, 'uri': 'nyt://article/208161cb-aff6-5f11-b4df-3851211e3fce'}, {'abstract': 'BBC2 will adapt the Hilary Mantel novels set during the reign of Henry VIII into a six-hour series.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/24/miniseries-treatment-in-works-for-wolf-hall-and-bring-up-the-bodies/', 'snippet': 'BBC2 will adapt the Hilary Mantel novels set during the reign of Henry VIII into a six-hour series.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A six-hour adaptation of two of Hilary Mantel’s novels, “Wolf Hall” and its sequel, “Bring Up the Bodies,” will come to television in late 2013, BBC Two has announced. “Wolf Hall,” a historical novel set during the reign of King Henry VIII, won the Man Booker Prize for Fiction in 2009. Peter Straughan, who wrote the screenplay for the 2011 movie version of “Tinker Tailor Soldier Spy,” will adapt the Mantel novels for television. ', 'print_section': 'C', 