tion expenses.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/24/pandora-and-spotify-rake-in-the-money-and-then-send-it-off-in-royalties/', 'snippet': 'Each company licenses its music differently, but winds up paying a majority of its revenue to music companies. In Spotify’s case, $229 million, or 97 percent of revenue, goes to licensing fees and distribution expenses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you have read anything about digital music recently, you have probably encountered two names over and over: Spotify and Pandora. Both offer an abundance of free listening on easy-to-use interfaces, and music fans have embraced them. At least 33 million people have tried Spotify, more than 150 million have registered for Pandora.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pandora and Spotify Rake In the Money and Then Send It Off in Royalties', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Audio Recordings and Downloads', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Royalties', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pandora Media Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Spotify', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-24T22:07:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Sisario', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sisario', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b47062b-cad2-5d35-a336-a1be9daa9e40', 'word_count': 652, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b47062b-cad2-5d35-a336-a1be9daa9e40'}, {'abstract': 'The jury found that Samsung infringed upon a series of Apple patents on mobile devices, in a closely watched court case that could have broad implications for the industry.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/25/technology/jury-reaches-decision-in-apple-samsung-patent-trial.html', 'snippet': 'The jury found that Samsung infringed upon a series of Apple patents on mobile devices, in a closely watched court case that could have broad implications for the industry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Apple won a decisive victory on Friday in a lawsuit against Samsung, a verdict that will give Apple ammunition in a far-flung patent war with its global competitors in the smartphone business.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/technology/25apple-photo1/25apple-photo1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/25/technology/25apple-photo1/25apple-photo1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/technology/25apple-photo1/25apple-photo1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 740, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/technology/25apple-photo1/25apple-photo1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1481, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/technology/25apple-photo1/25apple-photo1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012