mbox Bluetooth music player is shedding its monochromatic ways. Now it’s available in roughly 100 custom color combinations.', 'web_url': 'https://gadgetwise.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/24/a-colorful-change-for-jambox/', 'snippet': 'The popular Jambox Bluetooth music player is shedding its monochromatic ways. Now it’s available in roughly 100 custom color combinations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While many have been wowed by the sound of Jawbone’s Jambox portable speaker, some may have been less impressed with the monochromatic look of its blue, silver, black or red cases.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Colorful Change for Jambox', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Portable Speaker of Many Colors, Chosen by You', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bluetooth Wireless Technology', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electronics', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Speakers (Audio)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-24T23:21:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By Roy Furchgott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Roy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Furchgott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/db7cf162-5978-5545-91cb-de6fc95307d8', 'word_count': 254, 'uri': 'nyt://article/db7cf162-5978-5545-91cb-de6fc95307d8'}, {'abstract': 'This interactive map from a climate research group shows how a storm surge could flood Tampa.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/24/republicans-weather-watch/', 'snippet': 'This interactive map from a climate research group shows how a storm surge could flood Tampa.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bad 