n-win-over-indians.html', 'snippet': 'C. C. Sabathia threw seven strong innings in his return from the disabled list, and Derek Jeter was unharmed after being hit in the helmet by a pitch as the Yankees ended a three-game losing streak.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CLEVELAND — The Yankees faced their most critical test of the season Friday night. They had been swept in Chicago, and their division lead slashed to two and a half games. So the thought of C. C. Sabathia being unable to respond after a bout of inflammation in his left elbow was frightening for them to contemplate.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/sports/25yankees-1/25yankees-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/25/sports/25yankees-1/25yankees-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/sports/25yankees-1/25yankees-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 706, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/sports/25yankees-1/25yankees-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1413, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/sports/25yankees-1/25yankees-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/25/sports/25yankees-1/25yankees-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'ima