r two young players. David Wilson, the first-round pick, is pushing to become a critical part of the running game, and Prince Amukamara, the first-round draft pick in 2011, had been trying to fit in as a de facto starting cornerback.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/sports/sub-giants/sub-giants-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 716, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/sports/sub-giants/sub-giants-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1432, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/sports/sub-giants/sub-giants-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/25/sports/sub-giants/sub-giants-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/25/sports/sub-giants/sub-giants-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Wilson Shines for Giants’ Offense, but Amukamara Sustains Ankle Injury', 'kicker': 'Bears 20, Giants 17', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Wilson Shines for Giants’ Offense, but Amukamara Sustains Ankle Injury', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Amukamara, Prince', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 