shooter did not fire again after killing a former co-worker.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/26/nyregion/bystanders-shooting-wounds-caused-by-the-police.html', 'snippet': 'Outside the Empire State Building on Friday, the police killed a gunman but wounded others. The police commissioner said the shooter did not fire again after killing a former co-worker.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The encounter was breathtakingly brief: a surveillance video showed a gunman outside the Empire State Building on Friday pulling a pistol, pointing it at two police officers, their firing at him and his falling to the sidewalk. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/26/nyregion/SHOOTING2/SHOOTING2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/26/nyregion/SHOOTING2/SHOOTING2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/26/nyregion/SHOOTING2/SHOOTING2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/26/nyregion/SHOOTING2/SHOOTING2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After Bullets Hit Bystanders, Protocol Questions', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Bystanders Take Bullets, Questions on Police Protocol', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kelly, Raymond W', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Jeffrey T', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Empire State Building (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-25T16:37:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Wilson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ffe6cbed-37f3-5bda-ae3d-01a859d33425', 'word_count': 1188, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ffe6cbed-37f3-5bda-ae3d-01a859d33425'}, {'abstract': 'A football fan continues watching games alone, a habit formed growing up when his family often disrupted his television-watching experience.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/25/leave-me-alone/', 'snippet': 'A football fan continues watching games alone, a habit formed growing up when his family often disrupted his television-watching experience.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I watched Super Bowl XLVI in February by myself, the same way I watch most televised N.F.L. games. Sad? Hardly. Solo watching is a habit I adopted in high school. Although my friends and family were not overtly obnoxious, I often found them disruptive.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Leave Me Alone!', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Leave Me Alone!', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Digital Video Recorders', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date'