2e58329c0873'}, {'abstract': 'Delegates began to arrive in Tampa on Sunday as convention organizers said they were still working on a revised schedule after canceling the first day because of the weather. Still, many of Sunday’s events were going ahead as planned.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/27/us/politics/republican-convention-tampa.html', 'snippet': 'Delegates began to arrive in Tampa on Sunday as convention organizers said they were still working on a revised schedule after canceling the first day because of the weather. Still, many of Sunday’s events were going ahead as planned.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TAMPA, Fla., — Tropical Storm Isaac began to shift westward early Sunday morning, raising hopes that the city might escape the brunt of the weather that forced the cancellation of the first day of the Republican party’s national convention.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/27/us/27convention_span/27convention_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/27/us/27convention_span/27convention_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/27/us/27convention_span/27convention_span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/27/us/27convention_span/27convention_span-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'First Day Canceled, but Republican Show Goes On', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'First Day Canceled, but G.O.P. Show Goes On', 'na