04765db-0522-5591-ae82-4d307e99481e', 'word_count': 603, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e04765db-0522-5591-ae82-4d307e99481e'}, {'abstract': 'As Time Warner attempts to reinvigorate its 24-hour cable news channel, the company has pushed for CNN to incorporate HBO’s sports and documentaries into its lineup of news programs.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/26/cnn-looks-for-a-boost-from-hbo-shows/', 'snippet': 'As Time Warner attempts to reinvigorate its 24-hour cable news channel, the company has pushed for CNN to incorporate HBO’s sports and documentaries into its lineup of news programs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a bit of corporate synergy, Time Warner is planning to dip into one of its strongest cable channels, HBO, to help revive the fortunes of one of its weakest, CNN.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'CNN Looks for a Boost From HBO Shows', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'CNN Looks for a Boost From HBO Shows', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bourdain, Anthony', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spurlock, Morgan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CNN', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'HBO Sports', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Home Box Office', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Time Warner Inc', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-26T21:38:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amy Chozick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chozick', 'qualifier': None, 