qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4ca8e426-e737-5dd8-803d-34c820ccafab', 'word_count': 1467, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4ca8e426-e737-5dd8-803d-34c820ccafab'}, {'abstract': 'Players and fans have their own ideas about what the U.S. Open of their dreams would include.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/26/u-s-open-preview-players-dream-open-has-clear-skies-and-clear-roads/', 'snippet': 'Players and fans have their own ideas about what the U.S. Open of their dreams would include.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In June, the U.S.T.A. announced an ambitious renovation plan for the National Tennis Center, which included a new Louis Armstrong Stadium and a new Grandstand Court. Players and fans have their own ideas about what the U.S. Open of their dreams would include.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Open Preview: Players’ Dream Open Has Clear Skies and Clear Roads', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Building Your Dream Open | Professional Advice/Dreaming Big: The Sky’s the Limit', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-27T02:32:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/abc75d67-2297-52af-826e-c1745573bae0', 'word_count': 916, 'uri': 'nyt://article/abc75d67-2297-52af-826e-c1745573bae0'}, {'abstract': 'James Eagan Holmes left no trail of hate behind him before the shootings in Aurora. But interviews with people who knew or had contact with him before the attack tell a story of a man struggling with a mental illness and losing his footing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/27/us/before-gunfire-in-colorado-theater-hints-of-bad-news-about-james-holmes.html', 'snippet': 'James Eagan Holmes left no trail of hate behind him before the shootings in Aurora. But interviews with people who knew or had contact with him before the attack tell a story of a man struggling with a mental illness and losing his footing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AURORA, Colo. — The text message, sent to another graduate student in early July, was cryptic and worrisome. Had she heard of “dysphoric mania,” James Eagan Holmes wanted to know?', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/27/us/JP-AURORA-8/JP-AURORA-8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 871, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/27/us/JP-AURORA-8/JP-AURORA-8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1968, 'width': 1674, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/27/us/JP-AURORA-8/JP-AURORA-8-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/27/us/JP-AURORA-8/JP-AURORA-8-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/27/us/JP-AURORA-8/JP-AURORA-8-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Before Gunfire, Hints of ‘Bad News’', 'kicker': None, 'conte