': 'For a Song and for a Cause, a Flight of the Conchords Reunion', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clement, Jermaine', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McKenzie, Bret', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Flight of the Conchords', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Home Box Office', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Zealand', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-27T12:29:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/94f408a0-a212-5c49-8766-cc049c9813c9', 'word_count': 214, 'uri': 'nyt://article/94f408a0-a212-5c49-8766-cc049c9813c9'}, {'abstract': 'Apple’s victory on Friday in a patent lawsuit against Samsung could, if upheld, give its rivals a kick in the pants to create more original products, Nick Wingfield reports in Monday’s New York Times. Whether consumers respond by buying more distinctive devices is another question entirely.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/27/daily-report-after-apple-samsung-verdict-concern-about-innovation/', 'snippet': 'Apple’s victory on Friday in a patent lawsuit against Samsung could, if upheld, give its rivals a kick in the pants to create more original products, Nick Wingfield reports in Monday’s New York Times. Whether consumers respond by buying more disti...', 'lead_paragr