financial statements to help him firm up his potential takeover proposal for the electronics retailer.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/08/27/best-buy-to-open-books-for-founder/', 'snippet': 'Best Buy said on Monday that it had finally agreed to let its founder, Richard Schulze, take a closer look at its financial statements to help him firm up his potential takeover proposal for the electronics retailer.', 'lead_paragraph': '6:20 p.m. | Updated  After more than a week of negotiations, Best Buy said on Monday that it had agreed to let its founder, Richard M. Schulze, take a closer look at its financial statements to help him hone his potential takeover proposal for the electronics retailer.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Best Buy to Open Books for Founder', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Best Buy Will Open Books for Founder', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schulze, Richard M', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Best BUY Company Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-27T13:47:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2fb069d8-a23b-52e4-be6a-c906df0a25e8', 'word_count': 419, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2fb069d8-a23b-52e4-be6a-c906df0a25e8'}, {'abstract': 'Bud Collins has missed the last three major tournaments after he ruptured a tendon in his left quad during last year’s United States Open.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/27/bud-collins-set-to-return-to-grand-slam-tennis/', 'snippet': 'Bud Collins has missed the last three major tournaments after he ruptured a tendon in his left quad during last year’s United States Open.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Never mind Federer. Forget about Azarenka.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bud Collins Set to Return to Grand Slam Tennis', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Collins, Bud', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-27T14:00:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By George Vecsey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'George', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vecsey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b02dde89-5aed-5fba-844c-ddd50667d749', 'word_count': 481, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b02dde89-5aed-5fba-844c-ddd50667d749'}, {'abstract': 'Answer this question by Sept. 21 and you’ll be entered to win a contest to have your thoughts featured on The Learning Network and elsewhere on NYTimes.com.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/27/how-would-the-presidential-campaigns-change-if-the-voting-age-wer-13/', 'snippet': 'Answer this question by Sept. 21 and you’ll be entered to win a contest to have your thoughts featured on The Learning Network and elsewhere on NYTimes.com.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Update: Nov. 4, 2012 |  Congratulations to our winners, and thank you to the many students and teachers who participated!', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How Would the Presidential Campaigns Change if the Voting Age Were 13?', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name'