y to 700 lessees around the country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PALO ALTO, Calif. — A BMW 1 Series costs more than $30,000. But for the price of a few gallons of gas, Bay Area residents can zip around in a purely electric version of the compact coupe using DriveNow, a electric-car-sharing service from the German automaker.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In the Bay Area, Renting Electric BMWs by the Half Hour', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric and Hybrid Vehicles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bayerische Motorenwerke AG', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Silicon Valley Leadership Group', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Francisco Bay Area (Calif)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-27T17:23:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Josie Garthwaite', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Josie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Garthwaite', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/373810fa-791b-5545-9fc5-369ab5254e98', 'word_count': 687, 'uri': 'nyt://article/373810fa-791b-5545-9fc5-369ab5254e98'}, {'abstract': 'Medical overtreatment; pit vipers; and guidelines for bone-density screening.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/audio/2012/08/28/science/28science_pod.html', 'snippet': 'Medical overtreatment; pit vipers; and guidelines for bone-density screening.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Medical overtreatment; pit vipers; and guidelines for bone-density screening.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Science Times Podcast', 'kicker