es are archived on the Bucks blog. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Don’t Let the Original Price Haunt Your Decision to Sell', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-27T17:45:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carl Richards', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carl', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Richards', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/563f4d82-fda2-5dae-adc4-e11a647fa605', 'word_count': 599, 'uri': 'nyt://article/563f4d82-fda2-5dae-adc4-e11a647fa605'}, {'abstract': 'As Sesame Street’s Count von Count, Jerry Nelson taught generations to find joy in numbers and learning.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/27/farewell-count-von-count/', 'snippet': 'As Sesame Street’s Count von Count, Jerry Nelson taught generations to find joy in numbers and learning.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Teaching is a collaborative art. When I stand in front of my classroom and explain the magic of a Dickens metaphor, I conjure up the voice of my sixth-grade teacher, Mr. Akeley. When I describe the heroic journey of King Arthur, I hear Don Cannon’s words in my ear. But when I count? Well, that’s my favorite voice, a Transylvanian chant of numerical mirth:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/27/style/motherlode-jerry-nelson/motherlode-jerry-nelson-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 960, 'width': 858, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/27/style/motherlode-jerry-nelson/motherlode-jerry-nelson-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 960, 'width': 858, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/27/style/motherlode-jerry-nelson/motherlode-jerry-nelson-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/27/style/motherlode-jerry-nelson/motherlode-jerry-nelson-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/27/style/motherlode-jerry-nelson/motherlode-jerry-nelson-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Farewell, Count von Count', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Henson, Jim', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-27T17:45:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jessica Lahey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jessica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lahey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://