 the Mormon Church, has a long history of steering clear of NBC programs it deems of questionable content. Last fall it blocked the NBC drama “The Playboy Club” and for years it has refused to carry one of the pillars of NBC entertainment, “Saturday Night Live.” It also blocked a previous NBC comedy considered too racy, the short-lived “Coupling.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'NBC Searches for ‘New Normal’ Home in Salt Lake City', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'NBC Seeks Home For ‘New Normal’ In Salt Lake City', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mormons (Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-Day Saints)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barkin, Ellen', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-27T18:06:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Carter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a50ceb7f-08db-529e-ba5d-33ba5f6df065', 'word_count': 357, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a50ceb7f-08db-529e-ba5d-33ba5f6df065'}, {'abstract': 'People can form new associations between scents and sounds in their sleep, according to a new study.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/28/science/study-shows-learning-of-smells-and-sounds-in-sleep.html', 'snippet': 'People can form new associations between scents and sounds in their sleep, according to a new study.', 'lead_paragraph': 'People can learn new associations between scents and sounds in their sleep, according to a new study in the journal Nature Neuroscience.', 'print_section': 'D', 'prin