on ways for parents to ensure that their children are ready for more than just another year of school.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/27/what-children-really-need-for-back-to-school/', 'snippet': 'A real list of “back-to-school supplies” includes concentrating less on pencils and sneakers, and more on ways for parents to ensure that their children are ready for more than just another year of school.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Looking over summer homework assignments, last-minute shopping for clothes and supplies, and checking classroom placements — these are among the things parents do in the final weeks before their children start school.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What Children Really Need for ‘Back to School’', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (Secondary)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-27T20:45:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Arthur Levine and Diane Dean', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Arthur', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Levine', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Diane', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dean', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d6278148-399c-58cf-b73a-ac946a6dea36', 'word_count': 747, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d6278148-399c-58cf-b73a-ac946a6dea36'}, {'abstract': 'In a letter to Speaker John A. Boehner, Senator Charles E. Schumer asked House and Senate negotiators to provide money to repair the Capitol dome.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/27/schumer-urges-repairs-to-the-capitol-dome/', 'snippet': 'In a letter to Speaker John A. Boehner, Senator Charles E. Schumer asked House and Senate negotiators to provide money to repair the Capitol dome.', 'lead_paragraph': '6:46 p.m. | Updated Senator Charles E. Schumer of New York, citing years of inclement weather, sent a letter to Speaker John A. Boehner on Monday about the “severe disrepair” plaguing the Capitol dome.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Schumer Urges Repairs to the Capitol Dome', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Capitol Building (Washington, DC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boehner, John A', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schumer, Charles E', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-27T20:47:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jada F. Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jada', 'middlename': 'F.', 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee4e9f94-7bdc-5d6c-b41e-896f18db5067', 'word_count': 314, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee4e9f94-7bdc-5d6c-b41e-896f18db5067'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Cliburn, 78, is undergoing treatment.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/27/van-cliburn-has-advanced-bone-cancer/', 'snippet': 'Mr. Cliburn, 78, is undergoing treatment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The pianist Van Cliburn, who famously triumphed at the International Tchaikovsky Competition in Moscow in 1958, has “advanced bone cancer,” a spokeswoman said on Monday. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Van Cliburn Has Advanced Bone Cancer', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Van Cliburn Is Ill', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cliburn, Van', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Public Library', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-27T20:48:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel J. Wakin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Wakin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/981a8906-16b3-5eb2-8de7-94c8d9930bbb', 'word_count': 115, 'uri': 'nyt://article/981a8906-16b3-5eb2-8de7-94c8d9930bbb'}, {'abstract': '“I think the American people are going to vote with their wallets on Election Day,” said John A. Boehner, the Republican House speaker.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/27/boehner-sees-g-o-p-victory-but-not-necessarily-a-mandate-on-medicare/', 'snippet': '“I think the American people are going to vote with their wallets on Election Day,” said John A. Boehner, the Republican House speaker.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TAMPA, Fla. — The House speaker, John A. Boehner, on Monday cautiously predicted victory for Republicans up and down the ticket in November, but he avoided saying that a Republican victory would mean a mandate for the sweeping changes to Medicare that Mitt Romney and Representative Paul D. Ryan have proposed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Boehner Sees G.O.P. Victory, but Not Necessarily a Mandate on Medicare', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicare', 'r