nd New Orleans analyzed the two big, and intertwined, topics of the day: politics and weather.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/28/us/politics/republican-convention-paused-but-show-must-go-on.html', 'snippet': 'Hordes of news anchors and reporters in Tampa and New Orleans analyzed the two big, and intertwined, topics of the day: politics and weather.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Athletes can forfeit a basketball game or a tennis match, but there is no rain day for a political convention. Especially when a hurricane looms, and events are delayed, the news media doesn’t stand down; it keeps smacking the ball onto an empty court.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Convention Postponed, but the Show Must Go On', 'kicker': 'The TV Watch ', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Convention Postponed, but the Show Must Go On', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Republican National Convention', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tampa (Fla)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Isaac (2012)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gulf Coast (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricanes and Tropical Storms', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-28T02:16:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alessandra Stanley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alessandra', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stanley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9f06c2f6-b951-5f11-9d1c-2dfe51103181', 'word_count': 727, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9f06c2f6-b951-5f11