me': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shoes and Boots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-28T19:55:20+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Style', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By ERICA M. BLUMENTHAL', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/ff31f881-518d-57e8-b419-557fea8eddb2', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/ff31f881-518d-57e8-b419-557fea8eddb2'}, {'abstract': 'Google’s stark white home page is the most-viewed Web site on the Internet, and Google is taking advantage of that by advertising its Nexus 7 tablet there. Though it is not the first time Google has advertised its products on the home page, the ad comes at a crucial time for the Android tablet.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/28/google-advertises-its-nexus-7-tablet-on-its-homepage/', 'snippet': 'Google’s stark white home page is the most-viewed Web site on the Internet, and Google is taking advantage of that by advertising its Nexus 7 tablet there. Though it is not the first time Google has advertised its products on the home page, the ad...', 'lead_paragraph': ' Google’s stark white home page, the most-viewed Web site on the Internet, would be any advertiser’s dream. On Tuesday, Google took full advantage of that — for itself. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Google Uses Its Home Page to Push Nexus 7 Tablet', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Android (Operating System)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Online Advertising', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tablet Computers