ed that is investigating Residential Capital, the home lending arm of Ally Financial that is now in bankruptcy, for potential instances of mortgage fraud.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/08/28/s-e-c-investigates-rescap-for-potential-mortgage-fraud/', 'snippet': 'The Securities and Exchange Commission has disclosed that is investigating Residential Capital, the home lending arm of Ally Financial that is now in bankruptcy, for potential instances of mortgage fraud.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Securities and Exchange Commission has disclosed that it is investigating Residential Capital, the home lending arm of Ally Financial, for potential instances of mortgage fraud.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'S.E.C. Investigates Residential Capital for Potential Mortgage Fraud', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ally Financial Inc.', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Residential Capital LLC', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Securities and Exchange Commission', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-28T21:03:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/78840554-ab37-5249-881f-dba4d6a85470', 'word_count': 212, 'uri': 'nyt://article/78840554-ab37-5249-881f-dba4d6a85470'}, {'abstract': 'The 4x4 Baroque Music Festival features music by Europeans who were popular in 18th-century London.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/29/arts/music/baroque-4x4-festival-at-st-peters-lutheran-church.html', 'snippet': 'The 4x4 Baroque Music Festival features music by Europeans who were popular in 18th-century London.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 4x4 Baroque Music Festival brings together some of the best period-instrument players and early-music singers from ensembles around the country for four free concerts to mark the end of summer. It has become a tradition that Baroque music fans look forward to, not only because the performances are so thoughtfully shaped and beautifully played, but also because the programs are assembled so inventively, with a specialist’s sense of how worthy rarities can be balanced with favorites. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/29/arts/four/four-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/29/arts/four/four-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/29/arts/four/four-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/29/arts/four/four-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/29/arts/four/four-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Listening to 18th-Century London, Its Richness and Subtleties Intact', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Listening to 18th-Century London, Its Richness and Subtleties Intact', '