n American killed in Gaza in 2003, reflects on a verdict absolving a soldier of responsibility for her death.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/28/witness-to-rachel-corries-death-responds-to-israeli-court-ruling-absolving-soldier/', 'snippet': 'A British activist who witnessed the death of Rachel Corrie, an American killed in Gaza in 2003, reflects on a verdict absolving a soldier of responsibility for her death.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated | Wednesday, 4:57 p.m. As my colleagues Jodi Rudoren and Danielle Ziri report, an Israeli judge ruled on Tuesday that the state bore no responsibility for the death of Rachel Corrie, an American activist who was crushed to death by a military bulldozer in 2003 as she tried to block the demolition of a Palestinian home in Gaza.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Witness to Rachel Corrie’s Death Responds to Israeli Court Ruling Absolving Soldier', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Corrie, Rachel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sacco, Joe', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Caterpillar Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gaza Strip', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-28T23:05:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'or