'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/e735080d-640b-5df8-b30f-c76e8248e184', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/e735080d-640b-5df8-b30f-c76e8248e184'}, {'abstract': 'Despite her ready smile and glamorous looks, the life of Carlisle Champalimaud, 29, the daughter of a prominent former city official, had begun to unravel before her accidental death.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/29/nyregion/a-fatal-slip-cuts-short-the-life-of-carlisle-champalimaud.html', 'snippet': 'Despite her ready smile and glamorous looks, the life of Carlisle Champalimaud, 29, the daughter of a prominent former city official, had begun to unravel before her accidental death.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Just months ago, she was studying the translucent flesh of squid bought at a fish market, in the hope of replicating their gleam in the giant, handcrafted model she was making for a special exhibit on bioluminescence at the American Museum of Natural History.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/29/nyregion/CARLISLE2/CARLISLE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 766, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/29/nyregion/CARLISLE2/CARLISLE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1533, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/29/nyregion/CARLISLE2/CARLISLE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/29/nyregion/CARLISLE2/CARLISLE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url'