headers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/29/sports/baseball/baseball-in-france-persists-on-love-of-the-game-not-money.html', 'snippet': 'Low-paid Americans and French amateurs keep coming back for seasons full of long bus rides and doubleheaders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROUEN, France — The best baseball in France was played on a recent Sunday afternoon in Rouen, on a spartan diamond beyond the soccer field at a municipal sports complex. Rouen’s team, the Huskies, swept a doubleheader against the Templiers of Sénart, outside Paris, on a cool, drizzly day when, at most, 35 spectators huddled under umbrellas on metal-and-plywood bleachers behind home plate.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/29/sports/FRANCEBALL1/FRANCEBALL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/29/sports/FRANCEBALL1/FRANCEBALL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/29/sports/FRANCEBALL1/FRANCEBALL1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/29/sports/FRANCEBALL1/FRANCEBALL1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/29/sports/FRANCEBALL1/FRANCEBALL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/29/sports/FRANCEBALL1/FRANCEBALL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbn