nytimes.com/2012/08/29/joss-whedon-creating-s-h-i-e-l-d-pilot-for-abc/', 'snippet': 'Joss Whedon, the director and screenwriter of “The Avengers,” is one of the writers on a television pilot based on “S.H.I.E.L.D.,” the Marvel Comics espionage agency run by Nick Fury.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The recent announcement that the “Avengers” director and screenwriter Joss Whedon would be developing a television pilot as part of a larger deal with Marvel Studios (under which he’s also handling an “Avengers” sequel) set off ripples of speculation: would Mr. Whedon focus on the better-known characters of the Marvel pantheon, home to heroes like Iron Man, Thor and Captain America, or aim for the more obscure reaches of its comic-book universe? Sorry, fans of Brother Voodoo and Ego the Living Planet, but today is not your day.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Joss Whedon Creating ‘S.H.I.E.L.D.’ Pilot for ABC', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Joss Whedon to Make ‘S.H.I.E.L.D.’ Pilot', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gregg, Clark', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jackson, Samuel L', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Whedon, Joss', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABC INC', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Marvel Comics', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Marvel Entertainment', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Marvel Studios', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-29T13:06:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 