d” and has “dodged the tough choices.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney Tells Veterans That Obama ‘Dodged the Tough Choices’', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Republican National Convention', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN LEGION', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-29T20:59:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Baker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2e215083-690b-5260-8ce3-65dc6e09dc1a', 'word_count': 929, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2e215083-690b-5260-8ce3-65dc6e09dc1a'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Skinner talks about the show’s rising American profile, casting changes and plans for the season ahead.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/29/q-and-a-caroline-skinner-executive-producer-of-doctor-who/', 'snippet': 'Ms. Skinner talks about the show’s rising American profile, casting changes and plans for the season ahead.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Saturday night, fans of the long-running British science-fiction series “Doctor Who” will celebrate the start of a new season that may be among its most ambitious and turbulent. In a paradox that a dimension-spanning Time Lord from Gallifrey would surely appreciate, the new season, the seventh since “Doctor Who” was revived in 2005, leads up to celebrations next year for the 50th anniversary of the show’s birth in 1963.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Q. and A.: Caroline Skinner, Executive Producer of ‘Doctor Who’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Doctor Who (TV Program)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Skinner, Caroline', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BBC America', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-29T20:59:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steve Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steve', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/18324195-9046-50cc-b89d-aad62e82796d', 'word_count': 1117, 'uri': 'nyt://article/18324195-9046-50cc-b89d-aad62e82796d'}, {'abstract': 'Photos from Louisiana, Mississippi, Kenya and Syria.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/29/pictures-of-the-day-louisiana-and-elsewhere/', 'snippet': 'Photos from Louisiana, Mississippi, Kenya and Syria.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Photos from Louisiana, Mississippi, Kenya and Syria.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pictures of the Day: Louisiana and Elsewhere', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kenya', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Louisiana', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mississippi', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocation