stly through short sales – in the first stage of relief promised by five banks in settling allegations of foreclosure abuses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than 130,000 homeowners have received $10.5 billion in relief under the national settlement over foreclosure abuses, according to a preliminary report issued Wednesday by the settlement monitor.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Homeowners See Benefits in Bank Plan', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Homeowners See Benefits In Bank Plan', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreclosures', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Home Equity Loans', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Short Selling', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-29T21:22:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shaila Dewan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shaila', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dewan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/47f998c9-385e-5b6a-977f-4577afa95663', 'word_count': 843, 'uri': 'nyt://article/47f998c9-385e-5b6a-977f-4577afa95663'}, {'abstract': 'Alex Waske, who lost in a doubles match at the United States Open on Wednesday to end his professional career, was cheered on by two coaches who helped him have play in college.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/29/at-u-s-open-alex-waske-takes-a-final-bow/', 'snippet': 'Alex Waske, who lost in a doubles match at the United States Open on Wednesday to end his professional career, was cheered on by two coaches who helped him have play in college.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The doubles match on Court 16 lasted exactly two hours, the last two hours of Alex Waske’s 12-year career on the international men’s tour.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At U.S. Open, Alex Waske Takes a Final Bow', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kerber, Angelique', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Norman, Dick', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World TeamTennis', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-29T21:23:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Martin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/629536db-010f-58a0-ac15-87e86218cfff', 'word_count': 858, 'uri': 'nyt://article/629536db-010f-58a0-ac15-87e86218cfff'}, {'abstract': 'The Yankees made three errors and C. C. Sabathia gave back two leads against the Blue Jays on Wednesday afternoon.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/30/sports/baseball/yankees-stumble-before-an-important-stretch.html', 'snippet': 'The Yankees made three errors and C. C. Sabathia gave back two leads against the Blue Jays on Wednesday afternoon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the Yankees head into an important 10-game stretch, it would have served them well to wrap up their final game against the last-place Toronto Blue Jays with a series-winning victory. Then they could have moved on to more significant matters, like playing their divisional rivals, with a clear conscience.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/sports/30yankees1/30yankees1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 686, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/sports/30yankees1/30yankees1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1372, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/sports/30yankees1/30yankees1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/30/sports/30yankees1/30yankees1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/sports/30yankees1/30yankees1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Looking for Cushion Before Tough Stretch, Yankees Have a Hard Fall', 'kicker': 'Blue Jays 8, Yankees 5', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Looking for Cushion Before Tough Stretch, Yankees Have a Hard Fall', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sabathia, C C', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Toronto Blue Jays', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-29T21:25:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/70c77103-305f-5a30-8d5a-8c18a94b5c8c', 'word_count': 896, 'uri': 'nyt://article/70c77103-305f-5a30-8d5a-8c18a94b5c8c'}, {'abstract': 'At the Second World Mind Sports Games in Lille, France, the Transnational Mixed Teams was for players eliminated from the main events.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/30/crosswords/bridge/bridge-transnational-mixed-teams-in-lille-france.html', 'snippet': 'At the Second World Mind Sports Games in Lille, France, the Transnational Mixed Teams was for players eliminated from the main events.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the Second World Mind Sports Games in Lille, France, the Transnational Mixed Teams was for players eliminated from the main events and anyone who cared to come to compete in this picturesque town just south of the Belgian border.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Transnational Mixed Teams in Lille, France', 'kicker': 'Bridge', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bridge (Card Game)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cards and Card Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-29T21:27:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'subsection_name': 'Bridge', 'byline': {'original': 'By Phillip Alder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Phillip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id':