/30/fashion/20120830-LOPEZ.html', 'snippet': 'Although Mr. Lopez’s name may mean little today, at one time he was among the most celebrated talents in fashion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Although Mr. Lopez’s name may mean little today, at one time he was among the most celebrated talents in fashion.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/fashion/20120830-ANTONIO-slide-8TGS/20120830-ANTONIO-slide-8TGS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 737, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/fashion/20120830-ANTONIO-slide-8TGS/20120830-ANTONIO-slide-8TGS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1474, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/fashion/20120830-ANTONIO-slide-8TGS/20120830-ANTONIO-slide-8TGS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/30/fashion/20120830-ANTONIO-slide-8TGS/20120830-ANTONIO-slide-8TGS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/fashion/20120830-ANTONIO-slide-8TGS/20120830-ANTONIO-slide-8TGS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Drawn Again to the Images of the Illustrator Antonio Lopez', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lopez, Antonio', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-29T21:53:42+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Fashion & Style', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/60066198-8aaa-5a09-ad8b-6c36f5c30c60', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/60066198-8aaa-5a09-ad8b-6c36f5c30c60'}, {'abstract': 'A book and a gallery show during New York Fashion Week will put Antonio Lopez’s work back in the public eye.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/30/fashion/drawn-again-to-the-images-of-the-illustrator-antonio-lopez.html', 'snippet': 'A book and a gallery show during New York Fashion Week will put Antonio Lopez’s work back in the public eye.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JESSICA LANGE slipped into a booth at Le Drugstore in Paris, face bare of makeup, hair a nimbus of soft blond curls. She was not a standout beauty or, for that matter, in any apparent way exceptional. Certainly she was not as crazy pretty as Jerry Hall or as oddball gorgeous as the gaptoothed model Donna Jordan, with her shaved eyebrows and platinum bleached mane, or as startling to gaze at as the lunar Warhol superstar Jane Forth.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/fashion/30LOPEZ_SPAN/30LOPEZ_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/30/fashion/30LOPEZ_SPAN/30LOPEZ_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/fashion/30LOPEZ_SPAN/30LOPEZ_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 692, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/fashion/30LOPEZ_SPAN/30LOPEZ_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1384, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/fashion/30LOPEZ_SPAN/30LOPEZ_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/30/fashion/30LOPEZ_SPAN/30LOPEZ_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/fashion/30LOPEZ_SPAN/30LOPEZ_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Drawn to His Shining Light', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Drawn To His Shining Light', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Padilha, Roger', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Padilha, Mauricio', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lopez, Antonio', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-29T21:54:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Guy Trebay', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Guy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Trebay', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], '