, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7b25465c-0fb9-5558-930d-fad94b52d7ff'}, {'abstract': 'In a deal with prosecutors, Levi Aron, 37, pleaded guilty to one charge of second-degree murder and one charge of second-degree kidnapping in the killing of Leiby Kletzky.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/30/nyregion/levi-aron-is-sentenced-to-40-years-in-killing-of-leiby-kletzky-8.html', 'snippet': 'In a deal with prosecutors, Levi Aron, 37, pleaded guilty to one charge of second-degree murder and one charge of second-degree kidnapping in the killing of Leiby Kletzky.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A hardware store clerk who killed and dismembered an 8-year-old Brooklyn boy in 2011, stunning both the close-knit Orthodox Jewish community where they lived and the city, was sentenced Wednesday to 40 years to life in prison.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/nyregion/ALT-CHILD/ALT-CHILD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/nyregion/ALT-CHILD/ALT-CHILD-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/nyregion/ALT-CHILD/ALT-CHILD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/30/nyregion/ALT-CHILD/ALT-CHILD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/nyregion/ALT-CHILD/ALT-CHILD-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name