on Day, but the exception is in the period immediately after the party conventions, when the polls can be a wild ride.', 'web_url': 'https://fivethirtyeight.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/29/measuring-a-convention-bounce/', 'snippet': 'Polling generally becomes more accurate as you get closer to Election Day, but the exception is in the period immediately after the party conventions, when the polls can be a wild ride.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Polling generally becomes more accurate as you get closer to Election Day. The exception to the rule is in the period immediately after the party conventions, when the polls can be a wild ride.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Measuring a Convention Bounce', 'kicker': 'FiveThirtyEight', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-08-30T00:41:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Silver', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Silver', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3c6f8942-c92d-5cf5-ad96-f70fbde2a4b7', 'word_count': 3377, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3c6f8942-c92d-5cf5-ad96-f70fbde2a4b7'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Bartholomew, a senior American diplomat, negotiated for nuclear disarmament with the Soviet Union and survived a bomb attack while he was ambassador to Lebanon in 1984.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/30/world/europe/reginald-bartholomew-american-diplomat-dies-at-76.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Bartholomew, a senior American diplomat, negotiated for nuclear disarmament with the Soviet Union and survived a bomb attack while he was ambassador to Lebanon in 1984.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Reginald Bartholomew, a senior diplomat and ambassador who served four presidents, negotiated for nuclear disarmament with the Soviet Union and for the preservation of American military bases in Europe, and survived a bomb attack while he was ambassador to Lebanon in 1984, died on Sunday in Manhattan. He was 76. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/world/BARTHOLOMEW-oit/BARTHOLOMEW-oit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/30/world/BARTHOLOMEW-oit/BARTHOLOMEW-oit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/world/BARTHOLOMEW-oit/BARTHOLOMEW-oit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 792, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/world/BARTHOLOMEW-oit/BARTHOLOMEW-oit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1584, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/world/BARTHOLOMEW-oit/BARTHOLOMEW-oit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/30/world/BARTHOLOMEW-oit/BARTHOLOMEW-oit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/30/world/BARTHOLOMEW-oit/BARTHOLOMEW-oit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Reginald Bartholomew, Busy Diplomat, Dies at 76', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'pr