'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/30/site-to-be-seen-bureau-of-trade/', 'snippet': 'Gentlemen, you need not shy away from internet shopping, BOT transforms e-commerce into transactional entertainment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Michael Moskowitz is on a mission to abolish what he calls “the meaningless materialist.” It may sound a bit peculiar coming from a merchant, but Moskowitz maintains that his recently launched e-commerce site Bureau of Trade is replete with goods meant to provoke more than the pocketbook. Items in the Bureau’s wide-ranging collections are “eminently valuable for a lifetime,” he explains, “Your progeny will be sitting around the dinner table — arms crossed — waiting for you to pass away, so they can get their hands on them.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Site to Be Seen | Bureau of Trade', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Commerce', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-30T15:00:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lydia Dishman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lydia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dishman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0bdf6474-c224-5fe5-84ea-4a0287a18459', 'word_count': 765, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0bdf6474-c224-5fe5-84ea-4a0287a18459'}, {'abstract': 'The storm’s once fierce winds slowed to 40 miles an hour on Thursday as it moved out of southern Louisiana and headed north, continuing to bring heavy rains and flooding.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/08/30/