News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dba2289b-2542-5040-bba6-5afb3ce4b24b', 'word_count': 511, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dba2289b-2542-5040-bba6-5afb3ce4b24b'}, {'abstract': 'How and where actors live while working away from home can be as varied as the offerings in New York City real estate listings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/02/theater/how-theaters-provide-housing-for-actors.html', 'snippet': 'How and where actors live while working away from home can be as varied as the offerings in New York City real estate listings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN the 1950 movie musical “Summer Stock” Judy Garland plays a farm owner who lets a young acting company rehearse in her barn in exchange for doing chores. As enthusiastic as the troupe might have been to sleep country style, these days the farm might be in hot water with Actors’ Equity Association. The union has negotiated rules about what accommodations its members are entitled to when they work out of town.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/arts/02APARTMENTS_SPAN/02APARTMENTS_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/02/arts/02APARTMENTS_SPAN/02APARTMENTS_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/arts/02APARTMENTS_SPAN/02APARTMENTS_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/arts/02APARTMENTS_SPAN/02APARTMENTS_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbna