1caf-02c4-512c-b104-5d54899888d1'}, {'abstract': 'Baltimore is near the bottom of the league in batting and hitting, has been outscored by 44 runs and yet is in a position to win a wild-card spot and challenge for a division title.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/30/keeping-score-good-bullpen-and-good-luck-keep-orioles-in-the-race/', 'snippet': 'Baltimore is near the bottom of the league in batting and hitting, has been outscored by 44 runs and yet is in a position to win a wild-card spot and challenge for a division title.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Baltimore Orioles have no business being in a playoff race. A team that is near the bottom of the American League in batting and pitching, the Orioles are in a position to win one of the league’s two wild-card spots and only three games behind the first-place Yankees in their division. With 10 more wins, they will clinch the team’s first winning record since 1997.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Keeping Score: Good Bullpen and Good Luck Keep Orioles in the Race', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Keeping Score: Bullpen And Luck Keep Orioles In the Race', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chen, Wei-Yin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hammel, Jason', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Jim', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jones, Adam', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Showalter, Buck', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baltimore Orioles', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-30T16:49:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Hoffman', 'p