longtime Wall Street deal maker Eric Gleacher, said that it was exploring strategic alternatives, including selling itself and raising money from outside investors.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/08/30/struggling-gleacher-co-explores-a-sale/', 'snippet': 'Gleacher & Company, the struggling investment bank started by the longtime Wall Street deal maker Eric Gleacher, said that it was exploring strategic alternatives, including selling itself and raising money from outside investors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gleacher & Company, the struggling investment bank started by the longtime Wall Street deal maker Eric Gleacher, has put itself up for sale.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Struggling Gleacher & Co. Explores a Sale', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gleacher, Eric J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Gleacher and Company Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-30T16:58:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Lattman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lattman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9d8be1da-4464-5dfc-bd73-0e40a74798cc', 'word_count': 340, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9d8be1da-4464-5dfc-bd73-0e40a74798cc'}, {'abstract': 'A flier for a Brooklyn candidate for the State Assembly referred to “our negrohood,” instead of “our neighborhood.”', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/30/orthographic-misstep-disrupts-political-campaign/', 'snippet': 'A flier for a Brooklyn candidate for the State Assembly referred to “our negrohood,” instead of “our neighborhood.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The words “negro” and “neighbor” both begin with “ne” and have a “g” and an “r” and an “o” somewhere later on. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Orthographic Misstep Disrupts Political Campaign', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cymbrowitz, Steven', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'SHEEPSHEAD BAY (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-30T16:59:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andy Newman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Newman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/65fad663-f6cb-556c-8e8e-08b74ace422f', 'word_count': 160, 'uri': 'nyt://article/65fad663-f6cb-556c-8e8e-08b74ace422f'}, {'abstract': 'Sante Fe’s Georgia O’Keeffe Museum will hold the fall art session at Georgia O’Keeffe’s Home and Studio in Abiquiu, N.M.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/30/a-chance-to-paint-where-okeeffe-did/', 'snippet': 'Sante Fe’s Georgia O’Keeffe Museum will hold the fall art session at Georgia O’Keeffe’s Home and Studio in Abiquiu, N.M.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The artist Georgia O’Keeffe made the high desert landscape around her home in Abiquiu, N.M., famous through her paintings of cottonwood trees and rock formations. Now less celebrated artists can bring their own art supplies and sketch or paint in her figurative shoes for one day, Sept. 24.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'h