 only 20 minutes from Amsterdam, is presenting a major show about the sea in Dutch art since 1850, through Sept. 2.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the waning days of summer, thoughts often turn to the sea. For those near Amsterdam, the distinguished De Hallen Haarlem museum, only 20 minutes from the city, can get their last dose of the season by taking in a major show about the sea in Dutch art since 1850, through Sunday. Dutch artists have always been drawn to it as a subject, whether depicting sea battles, coastal scenes or shipwrecks, changing their styles and perspectives according to their period.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Sea, Seen Through the Eyes of Dutch Painters, in Haarlem', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AMSTERDAM (NETHERLANDS)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-30T22:00:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Valerie Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Valerie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/376cca29-08bc-5370-82bc-25d1d25506f2', 'word_count': 204, 'uri': 'nyt://article/376cca29-08bc-5370-82bc-25d1d25506f2'}, {'abstract': '“Side by Side,” with Keanu Reeves, revels in the quickly changing technical side of filmmaking.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/08/31/movies/side-by-side-with-keanu-reeves-charts-filmmaking-advances.html', 'snippet': '“Side by Side,” with Keanu Reeves, revels in the quickly changing technical side of filmmaking.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are quarrels that are certain to be provoked by Chris Kenneally’s new documentary, “Side by Side,” which explores the impact of digital technology on 21st-century moviemaking, but one thing is beyond argument. For a film geek this movie is absolute heaven, a dream symposium in which directors, cinematographers, editors and a few actors gather to opine on the details of their craft. It is worth a year of film school and at least 1,000 hours of DVD bonus commentary.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/31/arts/31SIDE_SPAN/31SIDE-1346278018889-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/08/31/arts/31SIDE_SPAN/31SIDE-1346278018889-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/31/arts/31SIDE_SPAN/31SIDE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 638, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/31/arts/31SIDE_SPAN/31SIDE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1277, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/31/arts/31SIDE_SPAN/31SIDE-1346278018889-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/31/arts/31SIDE_SPAN/31SIDE-1346278018889-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/31/arts/31SIDE_SPAN/31SIDE-1346278018889-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, '