ker.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NORTON, Mass. — Brandt Snedeker was finished with his pro-am round at the Deutsche Bank Championship by noon on Thursday. Instead of hitting balls for at least an hour on the range, as he normally would, Snedeker practiced his putting for less than 30 minutes and then left T.P.C. Boston to rest for his Friday morning pairing with Tiger Woods and Nick Watney. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/31/sports/y-golf/y-golf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/31/sports/y-golf/y-golf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1639, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/31/sports/y-golf/y-golf-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/31/sports/y-golf/y-golf-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/31/sports/y-golf/y-golf-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Snedeker Nearing End of a Tense Marathon', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Snedeker Nearing End Of a Tense Marathon', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ryder Cup (Golf)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Snedeker, Brandt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'