re than 50 points to Oklahoma State and Florida State in its first two games of the season, but payments will total $860,000.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAVANNAH, Ga. — On a resplendent afternoon in late August, when no college football team in the country had yet lost and no player blessed with youthful confidence expected to, the Savannah State Tigers were immersed in a spirited practice peppered by the language of positivity: “Good block.” “Nice tackle.” ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/31/sports/SAVANNAH/SAVANNAH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 873, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/31/sports/SAVANNAH/SAVANNAH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1746, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/31/sports/SAVANNAH/SAVANNAH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/08/31/sports/SAVANNAH/SAVANNAH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/08/31/sports/SAVANNAH/SAVANNAH-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Scheduling Losses to Start a Turnaround', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Scheduling Losses to Start a Turnaround', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Oklahoma St