24, in a brief ceremony — the seventh such onstage marriage at a Train concert this summer — Mr. Underwood declared, “You may kiss the bride.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'NATALIE SOBOLEVSKY and Brandon Pepin found a way to have a memorable, virtually expense-free wedding with 7,000 in attendance. After Train, the pop-rock group, struck the closing chords of their signature hit “Marry Me” at a concert on Aug. 25, Scott Underwood, the band’s drummer, who has also become a Universal Life minister, bounded backstage at the Marvin Sands Performing Arts Center in Canandaigua, N.Y., to fetch the couple. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/fashion/weddings/02FIELDNOTES_SPAN/02FIELDNOTES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/02/fashion/weddings/02FIELDNOTES_SPAN/02FIELDNOTES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/fashion/weddings/02FIELDNOTES_SPAN/02FIELDNOTES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/fashion/weddings/02FIELDNOTES_SPAN/02FIELDNOTES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/fashion/weddings/02FIELDNOTES_SPAN/02FIELDNOTES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/02/fashion/weddings/02FIELDNOTES_SPAN/02FIELDNOTES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/fashion/weddings/02FIELDNOTES_SPAN/02FIELDNOTES-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'From the Band With the Song, It’s the Wedding', 'kicker': 'Field Notes', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'From the Band With the Song, It’s the Wedding', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sands, Marvin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Train (Music Group)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-31T16:38:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ji Hyun Lee', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ji', 'middlename': 'Hyun', 'lastname': 'Lee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e6aa086c-301d-5e10-9dc9-fc7b32abe5f4', 'word_count': 706, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e6aa086c-301d-5e10-9dc9-fc7b32abe5f4'}, {'abstract': 'Unlike a liquid marinade, wine salt allows the exterior of the meat to develop a crisp edge.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/05/dining/using-wine-salt-for-a-marinade.html', 'snippet': 'Unlike a liquid marinade, wine salt allows the exterior of the meat to develop a crisp edge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IT used to be that whenever I wanted to marinate a piece of meat, I’d douse it in wine mixed with garlic, b