m/2012/09/02/nyregion/a-review-of-hudson-river-explorers-in-yonkers.html', 'snippet': '“Hudson River Explorers,” a series by the artist Holly Sears, was commissioned by the Metropolitan Transportation Authority to line the overpasses at Tarrytown’s Metro-North station.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Are the swooping falcons swimming, or are the darting catfish flying? And what about the floating coyote in their midst — is it lofted by air or by water? The delicate wash of blue behind them doesn’t really tell you; the one thing you can say for sure about the animals in Holly Sears’s painting “Hawks” is that they are on the move. ', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/nyregion/02ARTSWE1_SPAN/02ARTSWE1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/02/nyregion/02ARTSWE1_SPAN/02ARTSWE1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/nyregion/02ARTSWE1_SPAN/02ARTSWE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 521, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/nyregion/02ARTSWE1_SPAN/02ARTSWE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1042, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/nyregion/02ARTSWE1_SPAN/02ARTSWE1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/02/nyregion/02ARTSWE1_SPAN/02ARTSWE1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheigh