.com/2012/09/01/arts/dance/cinderella-at-edinburgh-international-festival.html', 'snippet': 'Alexei Ratmansky’s version of “Cinderella,” danced by Diana Vishneva and the Mariinsky Ballet at the Edinburgh International Festival, reflects the mordant qualities of the Prokofiev score.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EDINBURGH — It’s odd to think that in 2002, when Alexei Ratmansky created “Cinderella” for the Mariinsky Ballet in St. Petersburg, he was virtually unknown to Western audiences. A decade and a fast rise to choreographic fame later, Mr. Ratmansky, who is American Ballet Theater’s artist in residence, is frequently described as the most important ballet choreographer working today. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/01/arts/CINDERELLA/CINDERELLA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 374, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/09/01/arts/CINDERELLA/CINDERELLA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 374}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/01/arts/CINDERELLA/CINDERELLA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 640, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/01/arts/CINDERELLA/CINDERELLA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1280, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/01/arts/CINDERELLA/CINDERELLA-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/01/arts/CINDERELLA/CINDERELLA-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailhe