e frightening suicide trend among war veterans.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/08/31/president-obama-takes-action-on-vets-mental-health/', 'snippet': 'There is little doubt about the need to do something to halt the frightening suicide trend among war veterans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Today President Obama signed an executive order to improve mental-health care for service members and veterans, who are killing themselves at alarming and baffling rates. The order affects the Departments of Veterans Affairs, Defense, Health and Human Services, Education\xa0and Homeland Security. It calls for things like\xa0 more hiring of mental-health professionals, a national suicide-prevention campaign, and a review of existing mental-health and addiction-treatment programs to identify and expand the programs that work well.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'President Obama Takes Action on Vets’ Mental Health', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Executive Orders', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Army Times', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Veterans Affairs Department', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-31T22:59:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lawrence Downes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lawrence', '