active/2012/08/31/business/A-Squeeze-on-Fish-Farmers.html', 'snippet': 'The U.S. catfish industry is challenged by rising foreign imports. A glut in catfish inventories beginning earlier this year caused the wholesale price of catfish to fall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The U.S. catfish industry is challenged by rising foreign imports. A glut in catfish inventories beginning earlier this year caused the wholesale price of catfish to fall.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Squeeze on Fish Farmers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fish Farming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Catfish', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-31T23:03:20+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Business Day', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/aab77823-0ab7-5b5a-a392-ec81ea5e13f1', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/aab77823-0ab7-5b5a-a392-ec81ea5e13f1'}, {'abstract': 'A retrospective selection of photographs by Robert Adams is on exhibition at the Yale University Art Gallery in New Haven through Oct. 28.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/09/02/nyregion/a-review-of-robert-adams-the-place-we-live-in-new-haven.html', 'snippet': 'A retrospective selection of photographs by Robert Adams is on exhibition at the Yale University Art Gallery in New Haven through Oct. 28.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What separates art from politics is that in art, one can simultaneously occupy several positions, sometimes successfully. Take Robert Adams: Artistically somewhat conservative, Mr. Adams is also an ardent environmentalist whose photographs, dating to the 1960s, feel amazingly prescient — often radical — today. You can see this tension running throughout “Robert Adams: The Place We Live, a Retrospective Selection of Photographs,” an exhibition of over 200 photographs at the Yale University Art Gallery in New Haven.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/nyregion/02ARTSCT3/02ARTSCT3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 825, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/nyregion/02ARTSCT3/02ARTSCT3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1650, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/nyregion/02ARTSCT3/02ARTSCT3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/02/nyregion/02ARTSCT3/02ARTSCT3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/02/nyregion/02ARTSCT3/02ARTSCT3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Unblinking Eye on the New West', 'kicker': 'Arts | Connecticut', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Unblinking Eye On the New West', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Haven (Conn)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Yale University Art Gallery', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adams, Robert', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-08-31T23:12:04+0